Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.89,ARiAL AQUA,11,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs70}For love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:49.35,ARiAL AQUA,11,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs70}For love
