Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:24.30,iMPACT CHOCOLATE,00,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs120\t(\fs160)\fscy88\fsp2\1c&H03226B&\3a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\pos(900,240)}天才
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果我能重回过去
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If I could just go back.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果一切能够重来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If I could rub everything out,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.77,0:01:33.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会从我自己开始
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.77,0:01:33.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,starting with myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,从借一件外套开始
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.78,0:01:38.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Starting with borrowing a jacket.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 稍纵即逝的天堂
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, such fleeting paradise
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,如此纯真的喜悦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Such innocent delight
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.19,0:01:50.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,为了去爱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.19,0:01:50.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To love
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,被爱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Be loved
Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.50,0:01:58.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,摇篮曲轻唱
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:58.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,A lullaby
Dialogue: 2,0:01:59.43,0:02:07.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,随即是一片死寂
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.43,0:02:07.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Then silence
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.19,0:02:14.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 弗朗西斯, 太动听了  - 我很荣幸, 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.19,0:02:14.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Frances, that was lovely. - I'm so glad. Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.28,0:02:19.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,太棒了 非常优美
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.28,0:02:19.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marvelous. Most enjoyable.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.11,0:02:22.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,赫伯特·格林立夫 这是我的妻子, 埃米莉
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.11,0:02:22.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Herbert Greenleaf. My wife, Emily.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢 汤姆·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you. Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.15,0:02:26.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好吗?  - 你以前在普林斯顿
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.15,0:02:26.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- How do you do? - You were at Princeton.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.50,0:02:29.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,你很有可能认识我的儿子, 迪克, 迪克·格林立夫
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.50,0:02:29.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Most likely you'll know our son, Dick. Dickie Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一眼就注意到了你的外套
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I couldn't help noticing your jacket.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.29,0:02:36.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟓𝟔届的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.29,0:02:36.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Class of'𝟓𝟔.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.42,0:02:39.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克现在还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.42,0:02:39.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How is Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.34,0:02:41.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,很高兴与见你
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.34,0:02:41.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We've enjoyed meeting you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望你以后能常来看看我们
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I do hope that you'll come out and see us.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 你们实在是太好了  - 二位都很好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Thank you. That's very kind. - Both of you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 赫伯特?  - 是啊, 是啊 我也很希望如此
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Herbert? - Yes, yes. I very much hope so.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然, 迪克喜欢爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course, Dickie's idea of music is jazz.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 噢, 是吗  - 他有个萨克斯管
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh, dear. - He has a saxophone.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,在我听来, 爵士根本就是噪音
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To my ear, jazz is just noise.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.36,0:03:01.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过是些靡靡之音
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.36,0:03:01.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just an insolent noise.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你  - 我也一样
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Very nice to meet you. - And you.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 先生  - 我们在船厂见
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Sir. - We'll see you at the shipyard.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我也很期待  - 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I hope to. - Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,我得赶快了! 已经迟到了!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I have to run!I'm very late!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 噢, 你们简直太棒了!  - 你也很棒
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ah, you were great! - You were great.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.30,0:03:20.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,令人羡慕的一对, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.30,0:03:20.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Darling couple, aren't they?
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.71,0:03:23.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,是啊 出色的年轻人
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.71,0:03:23.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, they are. Exceptional young man.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢你的外衣  - 非常感谢替我出场
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Thanks a lot for the jacket. - Thanks for filling in for me.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,小心袖口 再见, 弗朗
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Take care of that wrist. Bye, Fran.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.32,0:03:40.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,相信我 现在买下I. B.M.股, 在它崩盘之前
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.32,0:03:40.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Believe me. Buy I. B.M. now, before it splits.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你肯定能大赚一笔的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You'll make yourself a fortune.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你真这么认为?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.57,0:04:28.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,你可能也听说过迪克一直在意大利
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.57,0:04:28.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You' ve probably heard Dickie's been living in Italy.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,蒙吉 在那不勒斯南部
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mongibello. South of Naples.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.79,0:04:34.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,一个不知名的小地方
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.79,0:04:34.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No kind of place at all.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 早上好, 先生  - 弗兰克
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Good morning, sir. - Frank.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.82,0:04:39.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 她的女朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.82,0:04:39.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, his young lady,
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.46,0:04:41.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,好像是在写什么书
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.46,0:04:41.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,is supposedly writing some kind of book.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,只有上帝知道他到底在干吗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God only knows what he does.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,据说他们成天呆在沙滩和游艇上
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,By all accounts, they spend the whole time on the beach or in a sailboat.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.84,0:04:51.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,那就是我儿子的才能․․․花钱如流水
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.84,0:04:51.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's my son's talent...spending his allowance.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能否考虑去趟意大利, 汤姆?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Could you ever conceive of going to Italy, Tom?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.81,0:04:58.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,劝我儿子回来?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.81,0:04:58.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Persuade my son to come home?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会付你酬劳的․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd pay you...
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.65,0:05:04.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟎美元
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.65,0:05:04.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.82,0:05:10.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,是这样, 我一直希望能去欧洲看看, 先生, 但是․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.82,0:05:10.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, I have always wanted to go to Europe, sir, but...
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,很好 现在你有了去那里的理由
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.49,0:05:14.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good. Now you can go for a reason.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.76,0:05:32.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,康特贝希
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.76,0:05:32.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Count Basie.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.22,0:05:35.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,杜可艾林顿? 我听不出来
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.22,0:05:35.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Duke Ellington?I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,我听不出来
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,我听不出来
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪兹·吉利斯帕
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dizzy Gillespie.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.62,0:05:56.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,我有趣的情人
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.62,0:05:56.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My funny Valentine
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.61,0:05:58.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,我有趣的情人
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.61,0:05:58.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My funny Valentine.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.62,0:06:02.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,我甜蜜有趣的情人
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.62,0:06:02.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sweet, funny Valentine
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,我连这是个男人还是个女人都听不出来
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't even know if this is a man or a woman.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.23,0:06:25.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,查里帕克?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.23,0:06:25.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Charlie Parker?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,查里帕克 我知道, 是 «伯德» 这张专辑
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Charlie Parker. I know it. It's Bird.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:30.74,0:06:33.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,对了!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.74,0:06:33.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.85,0:06:35.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.85,0:06:35.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.39,0:06:59.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 来, 我来拿  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.39,0:06:59.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Here. I'll take it. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟎美元唾手可得
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That thousand bucks should come in handy.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.77,0:07:03.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是啊, 先生  - 我来开
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.77,0:07:03.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir. - I'll get that.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.40,0:07:13.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 先生, 你的旅途会很愉快的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.40,0:07:13.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Sir. You're gonna have a great trip.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生和科纳德公司老板是老友
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf is personal friends with the Cunard people.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.58,0:07:25.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉你, 格林立夫这个名字可是很管用的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.58,0:07:25.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can tell you, the Greenleaf name opens a lot of doors.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.50,0:08:06.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你会说英语吗?  - 请问你的名字是?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.50,0:08:06.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Do you speak English? - What you name, please?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.42,0:08:08.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 瑞普雷  - 跟着我吧 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.42,0:08:08.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ripley. - Follow me. No problem.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这儿, 瑞普雷先生  - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:11.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Here, Signor Ripley. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 那儿 那个
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Uh, there. That one.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这个  - 请等一下, 都齐了吗? 点点看
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- This one. - Wait, is that all? Count them.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,呆会见 就一个箱子, 瑞普雷先生?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Attenzione. Just one suitcase, Signor Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 当心点
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Si. - Attenzione.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你的秘诀是什么?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What's your secret? - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:41.41,0:08:44.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 我的意思是․․․你是个美国人, 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.41,0:08:44.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, it' s just that...You are American, aren't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 我是说․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, it' s just that--
Dialogue: 2,0:08:46.79,0:08:51.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,我有那么多行李, 而你却, 嗯, 轻装上阵
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.79,0:08:51.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I have so much luggage, and you're so, um, streamlined.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,这, 你知道, 我都有点不好意思了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's, you know, humiliating.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,顺便自我介绍一下, 我叫梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm Meredith, by the way.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好, 我叫迪克  - 梅瑞迪斯·兰德尔
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.93,0:09:02.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hello, I'm Dickie. - Meredith Randall.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 嗯, 迪克·格林立夫  - 你好
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Um, Dickie Greenleaf. - Hello.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,你不是造船大亨格林立夫家的吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.65,0:09:10.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're not the shipping Greenleafs.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.73,0:09:13.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 想不是来着
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.73,0:09:13.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, trying not to be.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,想跳船来着
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Trying to jump ship.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.90,0:09:18.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 嗯, 他们刚刚把你的行李放错了地方吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.90,0:09:18.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, uh, did they put your cases in the wrong pile?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.49,0:09:22.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,只不过, 嗯, 你刚才在"R"那一栏
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.49,0:09:22.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s just that, uh, you were in the "R" stand.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.66,0:09:26.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,我好像看到你在那儿了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.66,0:09:26.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I thought I saw you there.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,我的父亲想让我回纽约
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My father wants me back in New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,他造船 我宁可乘船
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He builds boats. I'd rather sail them.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以我以我母亲的姓来登记
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So I travel under my mother's name.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你母亲叫․․․  - 埃米莉
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Which is... - Emily.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,开个玩笑而已
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 很有趣的一件事
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, the funny thing is,
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.68,0:09:47.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我也不是姓兰道尔
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.68,0:09:47.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm not Randall either.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.35,0:09:50.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,我姓罗吉
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.35,0:09:50.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm Logue.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是․․․  - 是从事纺织业的罗吉
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- As in... - As in the textile Logues.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.48,0:09:56.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,想抛开这个行当
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.48,0:09:56.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Trying to shrug off the dress.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我也是以我母亲的姓旅游的  - 兰道尔
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I travel under my mother's name too. - Randall.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:58.53,0:10:00.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.53,0:10:00.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.53,0:10:03.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 那么, 罗马, 罗马, 罗马
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.53,0:10:03.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh. - So, Rome, Rome, Rome. - Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.29,0:10:09.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们看起来还挺配的 再见  - 再见
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.29,0:10:09.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We're partners in disguise. Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,"未婚妻有张脸"
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"The fiancée has a face.  "
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,伯德
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Bird.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,"这是我的脸"
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"This is my face.  "
Dialogue: 2,0:12:34.23,0:12:37.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,我猜你没还看过我新写的一章
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.23,0:12:37.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So I guess you didn't look at my new chapter.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会的, 玛吉 我保证
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I will, Marge. I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过是太热了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s just been too hot.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果我今晚我为你做晚餐, 你可以顺便看看
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If I make dinner at my place tonight, maybe you could look at it then.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.83,0:12:56.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克格林立夫?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.83,0:12:56.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie Greenleaf?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你是?  - 汤姆, 汤姆·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Who's that? - It's Tom. Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:59.67,0:13:01.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆瑞普雷?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.67,0:13:01.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.63,0:13:05.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们在普林斯顿是同学  - 是吗
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.63,0:13:05.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We were at Princeton together. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:05.22,0:13:08.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们认识?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.22,0:13:08.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did we know each other?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好 呃, 我认识你, 所以․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hello. Well, I knew you, so...
Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.85,0:13:12.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,我猜你也该认识我
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.85,0:13:12.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I suppose you must have known me.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:14.39,0:13:16.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,普林斯顿是一团雾
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.39,0:13:16.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Princeton's like a fog.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,美国也是一团雾
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,America's like a fog.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:19.90,0:13:23.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我叫玛吉·舍伍德 汤姆․․․对不起, 贵姓?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.90,0:13:23.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is Marge Sherwood. Tom...Sorry, what is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 瑞普雷  - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ripley. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.86,0:13:28.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 玛吉?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.86,0:13:28.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How do you do, Marge?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.32,0:13:30.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你在蒙吉干吗?  - 没什么
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.32,0:13:30.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What are you doing in Mongi? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:30.53,0:13:32.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,没什么事
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.53,0:13:32.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过是经过而已
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just passing through.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:34.91,0:13:38.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 经过?  - 是呀
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.91,0:13:38.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Passing through? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.25,0:13:40.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,你可真白
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.25,0:13:40.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're so white.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.55,0:13:45.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,你看见过这么白的男人吗, 玛吉?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.55,0:13:45.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did you ever see a guy so white, Marge?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,灰色, 事实上是
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.22,0:13:47.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Gray, actually.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,就像件内衣一样
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s just an undercoat.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:49.84,0:13:53.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 再说一遍?  - 你知道, 刚入门
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.84,0:13:53.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Say again? - You know, a primer.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:55.85,0:13:57.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.85,0:13:57.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉喜欢皮肤白的人, 因为她自己就很白
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Margie likes that 'cause she's so white too.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,是呀, 我是很白, 而你一点也不幽默
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, I do, and you're not funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,在你走之前请务必来和我们共进午餐
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You should come and have lunch with us before you go.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好吗, 迪克?  - 当然, 什么时候都可以
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes, Dickie? - Sure, anytime.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 2,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,真是巧啊
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,coincidence.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一点也不记得他
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.62,0:14:18.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't remember him.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,真够搞笑的
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's so funny.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.13,0:14:29.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,希尔维那! 嗨!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.13,0:14:29.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Silvana! Hey!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.89,0:14:33.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,我到处找你
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.89,0:14:33.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:33.39,0:14:35.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,你躲哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.39,0:14:35.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where' ve you been hiding?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.35,0:14:38.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,今天你倒找我来了 剩下一星期都死哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.35,0:14:38.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Today you're looking for me. Where've you been the rest of the week?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:38.31,0:14:41.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,你总在工作 来吧 上来
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.31,0:14:41.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're always working. Come on. Get on.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.73,0:14:44.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,和那个美国女孩在一起?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.73,0:14:44.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,With the American girl?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 抓紧我  - 我恨死你了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hold on to me. - I hate you.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:46.61,0:14:50.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 啊?  - 我恨死你了!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.61,0:14:50.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Huh? - I hate you!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是不是连我住哪里都忘了?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did you suddenly forget where I lived?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.95,0:14:56.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道了 我来晚了, 我是一头猪
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.95,0:14:56.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know. I'm late. I'm a swine.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 四点了  - 我刚起床
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- It's 𝟒:𝟎𝟎 - I just woke up.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 哦  - 我很抱歉 对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ohh. - I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.75,0:15:03.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你才起床  - 福斯托和我出去划船了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.75,0:15:03.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You just woke up. - Fausto and I took the boat out.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.50,0:15:07.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们去打鱼, 天才刚亮, 我们什么都没捕到
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.50,0:15:07.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We were fishing, and then it was dawn, and we caught absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.21,0:15:11.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 是吗, 那好, 我们没等你一起吃饭
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.21,0:15:11.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mmm, yes, well, we ate everything without you.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.43,0:15:13.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们?  - 是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.43,0:15:13.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We? - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆·瑞普雷来了  - 谁?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom Ripley's here. - Who?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.60,0:15:21.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆 你好  - 你好
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.60,0:15:21.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom. Hello. - Hi.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 你还好吧? 我们以为你失踪了呢
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hello. - How are you? Thought you'd disappeared.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们都想派个搜索队去找你了  - 没有
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We were gonna send out a search party. - No.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:27.48,0:15:31.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 没有, 还在这儿呢  - 汤姆在和我谈论他的旅途
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.48,0:15:31.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- No, still here. - Tom was telling me about his journey.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.78,0:15:35.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,我笑得鼻血都要喷出来了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.78,0:15:35.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Made me laugh so hard I almost got a nosebleed.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.83,0:15:39.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 那不是很爽?  - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.83,0:15:39.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is that good? - Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,我是很可耻 不过我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm despicable. But I love you.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.21,0:15:48.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你爱我吗? 你爱我吗?  - 我煞风景了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.21,0:15:48.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Do you love me? Do you love me? - I'm intruding.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.21,0:15:50.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能替我调杯马提尼酒?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.21,0:15:50.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can you mix a martini?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.93,0:15:56.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 当然  - 我去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.93,0:15:56.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Sure. - I'll do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:56.77,0:15:59.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 哦  - 我调的马提尼酒很棒
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.77,0:15:59.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ohh. - I make a fabulous martini.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:03.85,0:16:07.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,每个人都应该有一样才能 你的是什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.85,0:16:07.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Everybody should have one talent. What's yours?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,伪造签名
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Forging signatures,
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,撒谎, 模仿别人
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,telling lies, impersonating practically anybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.61,0:16:16.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,超过三样了 没有人应该拥有一种以上的才能
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.61,0:16:16.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's three. Nobody should have more than one talent.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧, 来试试看
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay, do an impression.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.59,0:16:22.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 现在?  - 是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.59,0:16:22.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,我儿子唯一的一项才能就是․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The only talent my son has...
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,花钱如流水
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,is for cashing his allowance.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 哦, 我喜欢航行
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - Oh, I like to sail.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,相信我, 我喜欢航行
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Believe me, I love to sail.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 真的, 我造船  - 住嘴!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Instead, I make boats. - Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 其他人乘它们远航  - 够了!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Other people sail them. - It's too much!
Dialogue: 2,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,你让我浑身起鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're making all the hairs on my neck stand up.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:41.47,0:16:44.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 是啊 爵士, 哦 爵士, 让我们看看
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.47,0:16:44.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Jazz. Oh, jazz. Let's face it.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.94,0:16:48.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,那不过是, 那不过是․․․ 那不过是靡靡之音罢了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.94,0:16:48.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s just, uh-- It' s just insolent noise.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,好像他真来了一样
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I feel like he's here.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:50.65,0:16:54.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 太可怕了, 就像那个老混蛋真来了似的  - 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.65,0:16:54.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Horrible, like the old bastard's here. - Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.93,0:16:56.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.93,0:16:56.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 太棒了! 你是怎么认识他的?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Brilliant!How do you know him?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我和他在纽约见过面
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I met him in New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉! 玛吉, 真是太吓人了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge!Marge, this is scary.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,你得来听听 见过我父亲
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've got to hear this. Meet my father,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,赫伯特·理查德·格林立夫一世
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Herbert Richard Greenleaf 𝟏.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.67,0:17:11.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你迪克的眼光不错
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.67,0:17:11.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you. Dickie's made a fine catch.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 真不可思议!  - 我知道埃米莉一定也是这么想的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Uncanny! - I know Emily thinks so.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我弄不明白  - 太不可思议了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I don't get it. - It's uncanny.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:16.55,0:17:19.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能不能考虑去一趟意大利, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.55,0:17:19.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Could you ever conceive of going to Italy, Tom,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.76,0:17:22.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,然后, 嗯, 把他带回来?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.76,0:17:22.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and, uh, bringing him back?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我会付给你酬劳
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - I'd pay you.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.85,0:17:27.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你愿意去意大利
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.85,0:17:27.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If you would go to Italy,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.60,0:17:31.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,劝我儿子回家来, 我会付给你𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟎美金
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.60,0:17:31.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,persuade my son to come home, I'd pay you a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,我绝不会回去
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm never going back.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:35.74,0:17:38.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,还雇人大老远地跑这儿来․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.74,0:17:38.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To actually hire somebody to come all the way here...
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,把我拉回去․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to drag me back home...
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,肯定是神经有点毛病了, 是不是?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Got to be a little insane, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 福斯托
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ciao, Fausto.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这位是汤姆  - 你好, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- This is Tom. - Ciao, Tom.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.28,0:17:56.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我绝不会回去的  - 不过, 我想․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.28,0:17:56.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I'm never going back. - No, I think...
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.59,0:17:58.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,你母亲, 她的病, 我觉得那样有点․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.59,0:17:58.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Your mother, her illness, I think that's...
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,这和我妈妈一点关系都没有
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do with my mother.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.81,0:18:05.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,她有白血病․․․这更让我厌烦他
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.81,0:18:05.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She's had leukem...This is what makes me boil about him.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.56,0:18:09.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,是他想让我回去 是他想让我回去
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.56,0:18:09.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He wants me back. He wants me back.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这和我母亲一点关系都没有  - 你看, 我不明白․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- It's got nothing to do with my mother. - Look, I don't know...
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.65,0:18:13.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,回去 回纽约去
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.65,0:18:13.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Go back. Go back to New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,要么就给他打个电话, 如果你能找得到可用的电话
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Or call him, if you can find a telephone that works,
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.78,0:18:20.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉他就是野马也不能把我拉回他跟他那个船坞那儿去
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.78,0:18:20.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and tell him wild horses wouldn't drag me back to him or his shipyard.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.74,0:18:25.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 嗨, 汤姆  - 嗨
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.74,0:18:25.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hi, Tom. - Hi.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 汤姆来告别
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, Tom's saying good-bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.21,0:18:30.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我来了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.21,0:18:30.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll come down.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 嗯, 你和我爸爸说过了吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, uh, did you speak to my father?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 你是对的․․․关于电话
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, you were right...about the telephones.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我告诉过你  - 根本连电话线都没有
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I told you. - There are no lines.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.55,0:18:41.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 没问题  - 这就是意大利
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.55,0:18:41.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- There's some problem. - That's Italy.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.36,0:18:47.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆 你要走了? 你有什么打算?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.36,0:18:47.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom. You're off?What are your plans?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:47.23,0:18:49.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 回去, 我想, 越慢越好 噢!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.23,0:18:49.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, back, I suppose, as slow as I can. Oh!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,这个破包!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.44,0:18:53.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This bag!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:54.82,0:18:58.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨 你喜欢爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.82,0:18:58.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hey. You like jazz.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.92,0:18:59.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,我爱爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.92,0:18:59.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I love jazz.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是最好的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.28,0:19:04.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is the best.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,贝克尔, 罗林斯
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Baker, Rollins.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.45,0:19:10.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉说她喜欢爵士, 但是她以为格兰·米勒叫爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.45,0:19:10.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge says she likes jazz, but she thinks Glenn Miller' s jazz.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.75,0:19:12.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我可从没那么说过!   -  «伯德»
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.75,0:19:12.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I never said that! - Bird.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,这才是爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That' s jazz.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.42,Default,22,0,0,0,, «伯德»? 问问我我的游艇叫什么名字
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.68,0:19:17.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Bird? Ask me the name of my sailboat.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道 你的游艇叫什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know. What's the name of your sailboat?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,看啊! 看啊! 伯德!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Look! Look!Bird!
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了 船是女性化的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Which is ridiculous. Boats are female.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,谁都知道你不能给一只船取个男人的名字
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you can't call a boat after a man.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他不是男人, 他是上帝  - 好, 我们一起去那不勒斯
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He's not a man. He's a god. - Okay, we're going to Naples.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:31.27,0:19:33.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,那儿有个俱乐部․․․也不算是个俱乐部, 是个地下室
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.27,0:19:33.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's a club...It's not a club, it's a cellar.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.94,0:19:36.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 很烂  - 是的, 很烂 你不一定要来
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.94,0:19:36.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- It's vile. - Yes, it's vile. You don't have to come.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.94,0:19:39.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,太棒了 太․․․太棒了 你会喜欢它的
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.94,0:19:39.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's great. It's...It's great. You're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:16.06,0:20:17.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.06,0:20:17.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 2,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,那太棒了 把他带上来
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That'd be cool. Bring him up.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆·瑞普雷!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom Ripley!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,来呀! 快上来!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on!Get on up here!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.41,0:21:13.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,吔!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.41,0:21:13.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会告诉你从什么时候开始唱的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when to join the chorus.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,好 一起来!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay. Together!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,我遇到了一个普林斯顿的同学
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I bumped into an old friend from Princeton,
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,一个叫汤姆·瑞普雷德家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,a fellow called Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:14.38,0:22:17.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,他说他会一直缠着我直到我同意․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.38,0:22:17.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He says he's going to haunt me until I agree...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:17.81,0:22:22.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,和他一起․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.81,0:22:22.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to go back to New York...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.27,0:22:24.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,回纽约
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.27,0:22:24.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,with him.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,下午好
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.83,0:22:33.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,几点了?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.83,0:22:33.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.87,0:22:35.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 噢, 天  - "和他一起回纽约"
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.87,0:22:35.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh, God. - "Go back to New York with him."
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.16,0:22:39.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这儿․․․  - 你总是打印信件?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.16,0:22:39.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Here... - You always type your letters?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.84,0:22:45.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这儿应该是两个"T"  - 我不会写, 我也不会拼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.84,0:22:45.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- That should be two T's. - I can't write, and I can't spell.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.38,0:22:48.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,这就是一流教育赋予的特权
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.38,0:22:48.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's the privilege of a first-class education.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,你的房间在后面楼上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Your room's upstairs at the back.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.51,0:22:53.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想艾莫琳达已经整理好了床铺, 艾莫琳达!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.51,0:22:53.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think Ermalinda made up the bed. Ermalinda!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:55.81,0:22:58.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你真是太好了  - 别再提了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.81,0:22:58.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- This is so good of you. - Don't say it again.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.65,0:23:05.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在你是个双面间谍了, 我们一起合谋来骗我父亲
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.65,0:23:05.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now that you're a double agent and we're going to string my dad along,
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,你说我们用你的佣金买辆车怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.86,0:23:08.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,what if we were to buy a car with your expense money?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.70,0:23:11.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好啊  - 太好了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.70,0:23:11.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Great.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.54,0:23:13.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好, 汤姆  - 你好
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.54,0:23:13.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hello, Tom. - Hello.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.24,0:23:15.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 玛吉, 你说怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.24,0:23:15.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, Marge, what do you think?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,用我爸爸的钱买辆小车?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.62,0:23:17.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Little Ciquencento with my dad's money?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.87,0:23:20.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 拜托, 迪克 你连车都不会开
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.87,0:23:20.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, please, Dickie. You can't even drive a car.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.79,0:23:24.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你连车都不会开  - 我们现在需要的是个冰箱
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.79,0:23:24.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You can't even drive. - What we need urgently is an icebox.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.21,0:23:26.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,你怎么认为? 同意我吧, 我保证我们会成为终生的朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.21,0:23:26.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What do you think? Agree with me, and I'll be your friend for life.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.04,0:23:31.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我完全同意玛吉  - 嗯
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.04,0:23:31.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I absolutely agree with Marge. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.72,0:23:34.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,冰箱 冰箱
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.72,0:23:34.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Icebox. Icebox.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 什么, 他会搬来和你一起住?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, what, is he gonna move in with you?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:48.61,0:23:53.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,就一段时间 他能․․․ 他能让我发笑
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.61,0:23:53.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It'll just be for a little while. He can be-- He makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:53.37,0:23:56.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好吧, 亲爱的  - 保证?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.37,0:23:56.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay, darling. - Promise you'd say?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 不, 我喜欢他  - 玛吉, 你谁都喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- No, I like him. - Marge, you like everybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.87,0:24:03.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,不喜欢你
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.87,0:24:03.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't like you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:03.67,0:24:06.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,那我会搬去你那儿, 你和汤姆一起住好了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.67,0:24:06.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Then I'll go to your place and you can move in with Tom.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:15.51,0:24:17.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,我喜欢他
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.51,0:24:17.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I like him.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:17.51,0:24:21.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 你谁都喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.51,0:24:21.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, you like everybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 不, 我喜欢他
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, I like him.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:28.44,0:24:33.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 你谁都喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.44,0:24:33.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, you like everybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:33.36,0:24:36.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在你知道为什么舍伍德小姐总是会在早餐时出现
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.36,0:24:36.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now you'll find out why Miss Sherwood always shows up for breakfast.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:36.95,0:24:39.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是爱 是我的咖啡机
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.95,0:24:39.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's not love. It's my coffee machine.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.62,0:24:42.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,自从艾莫琳达教他怎样自己煮咖啡
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.62,0:24:42.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ever since Ermalinda showed him how to make his own espresso,
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.46,0:24:44.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,他就觉得自己是成人了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.46,0:24:44.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,he feels like quite the grownup.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:44.75,0:24:47.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是我买的咖啡机  - 噢, 亲爱的, 那杯是给我的?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.75,0:24:47.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I bought the coffee machine. - Oh, darling, is that for me?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:47.63,0:24:49.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,这杯是给汤姆的, 因为他不会抱怨
Dialogue: 1,0:24:47.63,0:24:49.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is for Tom, because he didn't complain.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,那戒指太美了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That ring is superb.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.92,0:24:55.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 汤姆, 我爱你 知道了吧?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.92,0:24:55.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, Tom, I love you. See?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:55.47,0:25:00.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,唔! 我还得很郑重地发誓, 决不取下它
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.47,0:25:00.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ooh! I had to promise, capital "P," never to take it off.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 要不然, 我会把它送给你  - 是不是很棒? 我在那不勒斯淘到的
Dialogue: 1,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Otherwise, I'd give it to you. - Isn't it great? I found it in Naples.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,我为了买下它整整还了两周的价
Dialogue: 1,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I had to bargain for it for about two weeks.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:06.60,0:25:09.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望它不便宜, 玛吉
Dialogue: 1,0:25:06.60,0:25:09.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I hope it wasn't cheap, Marge.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:09.48,0:25:11.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 是很便宜
Dialogue: 1,0:25:09.48,0:25:11.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, it was.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:11.87,0:25:15.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,我得为弗朗西斯买件生日礼物, 也许你能帮帮我
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.87,0:25:15.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I have to get a birthday present for Frances, so perhaps you could help me.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:15.78,0:25:18.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谁是弗朗西斯?  - 我的未婚妻
Dialogue: 1,0:25:15.78,0:25:18.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Who's Frances? - My fiancée.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:18.66,0:25:21.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,订婚了? 你可真是出其不意啊, 瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,0:25:18.66,0:25:21.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Engaged?You're a dark horse, Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:21.58,0:25:23.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 她是谁?  - 你的父母见过她
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.58,0:25:23.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Who is she? - Your parents met her.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:23.58,0:25:27.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 天啊 噢, 我能想象
Dialogue: 1,0:25:23.58,0:25:27.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Oh, I can just imagine.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:27.54,0:25:29.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,"如果迪克能成家该多好
Dialogue: 1,0:25:27.54,0:25:29.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"If only Dickie would settle down.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,每一对父母都该有个孙子不是吗?"
Dialogue: 1,0:25:29.79,0:25:31.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Doesn't every parent deserve a grandchild?"
Dialogue: 2,0:25:31.96,0:25:34.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 天 决不 决不
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.96,0:25:34.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Never. Never.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:34.84,0:25:39.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,我以你的戒指发誓, 玛吉, 我永远也不回去
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.84,0:25:39.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I swear on your ring, Marge, I'm never going back.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:39.51,0:25:42.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 告诉我什么时候该拉  - 现在拉 拉
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.51,0:25:42.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Say when to pull. - Pull now. Pull.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:42.38,0:25:45.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,那不是在拉 我做错了
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.38,0:25:45.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's not pulling. I'm doing it wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:47.77,0:25:50.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 现在好点了, 嗯?  - 好, 好, 好
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.77,0:25:50.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Better now, huh? - Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:50.19,0:25:52.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,就由你来开船了
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.19,0:25:52.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We'll make a sailor of you yet.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:52.19,0:25:54.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,你做得很不错
Dialogue: 1,0:25:52.19,0:25:54.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're doing really well.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.61,0:25:57.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好了 酒吧时间  - 好, 请
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.61,0:25:57.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- All right. Bar's open. - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:57.91,0:26:01.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 嗨, 我们能开船去威尼斯吗?  - 好啊 我爱威尼斯
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.91,0:26:01.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hey, can we sail to Venice? - Sure. I love Venice.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.16,0:26:05.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,"看到威尼斯死而无憾"是吗? 要么应该是罗马?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.16,0:26:05.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"See Venice and die."Isn't that right? Or is it Rome?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:05.87,0:26:08.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是罗马吗?  - 我得说是威尼斯
Dialogue: 1,0:26:05.87,0:26:08.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is it Rome? - I have to see Venice.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.04,0:26:12.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,你做了一些事情后便死而无憾了, 不是吗? 威尼斯就是其中之一
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.04,0:26:12.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You do something and die, don't you?Okay. Venice is on the list.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:12.96,0:26:15.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,还有罗马
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.96,0:26:15.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And Rome.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.59,0:26:17.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,你会滑雪吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.59,0:26:17.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you ski?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:19.89,0:26:22.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,啊, 不是吧, 不是吧 别说真是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.89,0:26:22.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ah, no, no. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:22.72,0:26:26.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,你完了 这是接下来要做的一件事
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.72,0:26:26.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're a lost cause. That's the next thing to deal with.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,圣诞节, 我们打算去科尔蒂纳滑雪
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Christmas, we' re planning a skiing trip to Cortina.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:28.73,0:26:32.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 很棒的滑雪 太棒了 玛吉  - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.73,0:26:32.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Excellent skiing. Excellent. Marge. - Yes?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:32.23,0:26:34.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,不可思议 汤姆连滑雪都不会
Dialogue: 1,0:26:32.23,0:26:34.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Tom can't ski either.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:35.08,0:26:38.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们还得再教他滑雪  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:26:35.08,0:26:38.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We'll have to teach him that too. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:40.24,0:26:43.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,太掉价了, 玛吉 这家伙有没有什么会的?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.24,0:26:43.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Such low class, Marge. Does this guy know anything?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:43.54,0:26:45.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们还没快结婚真是幸事
Dialogue: 1,0:26:43.54,0:26:45.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good thing we're not getting married soon.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.87,0:26:48.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,否则我们还得请汤姆和我们共度蜜月
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.87,0:26:48.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We'd have to invite Tom on our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:51.88,0:26:54.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 我恨纽约 恨拥挤的帕克大道
Dialogue: 1,0:26:51.88,0:26:54.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I hated New York. That whole Park Avenue crowd.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:54.88,0:26:56.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以我飞去巴黎打算专心写我的书
Dialogue: 1,0:26:54.88,0:26:56.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So I fled to Paris to work on my book.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:56.92,0:27:00.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,我经常会去蒙特利尔的一家咖啡馆․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:26:56.92,0:27:00.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I was always going to this cafe in Monmartre...
Dialogue: 2,0:27:00.33,0:27:02.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,和让․․․ 让克一起
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.33,0:27:02.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,with Jean-- Jaques.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:02.76,0:27:05.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克会演奏 «我有趣的情人»
Dialogue: 1,0:27:02.76,0:27:05.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And Dickie would play "My Funny Valentine."
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.77,0:27:11.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,只是我后来才发现原来他就会那六首曲子
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.77,0:27:11.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It was only later that I found out he only knows about six songs.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:11.85,0:27:13.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过, 我很想见见他, 我想
Dialogue: 1,0:27:11.85,0:27:13.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Anyway, I looked forward to seeing him, I suppose.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.88,0:27:43.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨, 嗨, 格林立夫先生!
Dialogue: 1,0:27:39.88,0:27:43.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Signor Greenleaf!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.64,0:27:47.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,你七点还没到我那儿, 汤姆和我打算私奔了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.64,0:27:47.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're not at my place by 𝟕.:𝟎𝟎,Tom and I are running off together.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:47.39,0:27:50.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好啊, 很好  - 噢, 迪克!
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.39,0:27:50.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay, fine. - Oh, Dickie!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:00.49,0:28:03.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 等会儿 等会儿
Dialogue: 1,0:28:00.49,0:28:03.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:03.54,0:28:07.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,希尔维那, 希尔维那
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.54,0:28:07.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Silvana, Silvana
Dialogue: 2,0:28:07.45,0:28:09.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,你让我微笑
Dialogue: 1,0:28:07.45,0:28:09.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You make me smile
Dialogue: 2,0:28:09.45,0:28:12.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,我得和你谈谈
Dialogue: 1,0:28:09.45,0:28:12.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:18.63,0:28:21.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你快把我的肋骨压断了!  - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:28:18.63,0:28:21.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You're breaking my ribs! - What?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:23.39,0:28:26.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,你快把我的肋骨压断了!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:23.39,0:28:26.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're breaking my ribs!
Dialogue: 2,0:28:28.37,0:28:31.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是请不要
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.37,0:28:31.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But don't
Dialogue: 2,0:28:31.31,0:28:34.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,为我改变一丝一毫
Dialogue: 1,0:28:31.31,0:28:34.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Change a hair for me
Dialogue: 2,0:28:37.73,0:28:39.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你
Dialogue: 1,0:28:37.73,0:28:39.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Not if you care
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.86,0:28:42.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,真爱我
Dialogue: 1,0:28:39.86,0:28:42.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,For me
Dialogue: 2,0:28:44.32,0:28:49.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,留下, 小瓦伦丁
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.32,0:28:49.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stay, little Valentine
Dialogue: 2,0:28:50.37,0:28:53.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,留下
Dialogue: 1,0:28:50.37,0:28:53.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stay
Dialogue: 2,0:28:58.21,0:29:00.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,每一天
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.21,0:29:00.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Each day
Dialogue: 2,0:29:00.26,0:29:07.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,都是情人节
Dialogue: 1,0:29:00.26,0:29:07.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is Valentine's Day
Dialogue: 2,0:29:11.27,0:29:12.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:11.27,0:29:12.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ohh!
Dialogue: 2,0:29:12.93,0:29:17.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,我都能干这只冰箱了, 我太爱它了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:12.93,0:29:17.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I could fuck this icebox, I love it so much.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:19.65,0:29:23.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 你在纽约是做什么的?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:19.65,0:29:23.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, what did you actually do in New York?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.28,0:29:26.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,四处弹钢琴 我告诉过你
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.28,0:29:26.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Played piano in a few places. I told you.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.54,0:29:29.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,好, 那只是一份工作 你说过你有好几份工作
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.54,0:29:29.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, that's one job. You told me a lot of jobs.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:29.24,0:29:31.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,好几个地方 那就是好几份工作了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:29.24,0:29:31.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Few places. That's a few jobs.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.79,0:29:33.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,神秘的瑞普雷先生
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.79,0:29:33.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The mysterious Mr. Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.96,0:29:36.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉和我花了好些时间推测
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.96,0:29:36.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge and I spend hours speculating.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:36.88,0:29:40.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,无论如何, 我连想都不愿想到纽约
Dialogue: 1,0:29:36.88,0:29:40.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't even want to think about New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:40.21,0:29:42.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:40.21,0:29:42.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:42.80,0:29:47.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 冰啤酒 谢谢, 老爸  - 好
Dialogue: 1,0:29:42.80,0:29:47.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Cold beer. Thank you, Dad. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:47.33,0:29:49.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,从这儿开始抄
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.33,0:29:49.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Copy out from here.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.81,0:29:54.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你把这个一起带到欧洲来了?  - 你打算写吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.81,0:29:54.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You bring this with you to Europe? - You gonna write something?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:54.18,0:29:57.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,我注意到你带来了莎士比亚却没带来衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.18,0:29:57.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I love the fact that you brought Shakespeare with you but no clothes.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:57.48,0:30:00.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,艾莫琳达告诉我你每天晚上都洗同一件衬衫, 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.48,0:30:00.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ermalinda says you wash out the same shirt every night. Is that true?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.98,0:30:02.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有 我的衬衫不止一件
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.98,0:30:02.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No. I have more than one shirt.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:03.07,0:30:05.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,她会帮你洗的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:03.07,0:30:05.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She can do that for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:05.24,0:30:07.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过, 你也可以穿我的衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:30:05.24,0:30:07.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Anyway, just wear some of my stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.95,0:30:10.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,随便穿 大多都有些旧了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.95,0:30:10.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Wear anything you want. Most of it's ancient.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.58,0:30:14.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在签个名
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.58,0:30:14.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now your signature.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.50,0:30:20.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是这样迪克 你的签名
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.50,0:30:20.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Not Dickie. Your signature.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:31.35,0:30:33.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,不带眼镜, 你还挺帅的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.35,0:30:33.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Without the glasses, you're not even ugly.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:35.85,0:30:38.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不需要眼镜, 因为我从来不看书
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.85,0:30:38.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't need them because I never read.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我看起来怎么样?  - 像克拉克·肯特
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- How do I look? - Like Clark Kent.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:45.36,0:30:48.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 现在是超人了  - 超人
Dialogue: 1,0:30:45.36,0:30:48.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Now Superman. - Superman.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好  - 我知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay. - I know.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:55.70,0:31:00.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,这像个小孩子写的 看见没有, 这个"S"和"T"? 看起来很脆弱
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.70,0:31:00.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's like a kid's. See this, the "S" and the "T"? Fine, vulnerable.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:00.63,0:31:03.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,那是痛苦 那是不为人知的痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.63,0:31:03.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's pain. That's secret pain.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:03.71,0:31:06.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,好啊, 那一定是个隐藏的非常深的秘密, 连我自己都不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:31:03.71,0:31:06.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, that must be a very deep secret, 'cause I don't know about it.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:06.72,0:31:10.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯 没有什么能比你的笔迹更能泄漏你心底的秘密
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.72,0:31:10.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hmm. There's nothing more naked than your handwriting.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.04,0:31:12.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有字是挨着线的, 看到吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.04,0:31:12.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,See how nothing's quite touching the line?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:12.89,0:31:17.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 那是空虚  - 呃, 我们都知道就是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.89,0:31:17.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- That's vanity. - Well, we certainly know that's true.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:22.86,0:31:25.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,你有兄弟吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.86,0:31:25.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you have any brothers?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.48,0:31:27.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.48,0:31:27.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:28.92,0:31:30.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有兄弟, 没有姐妹
Dialogue: 1,0:31:28.92,0:31:30.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No brothers, no sisters.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:32.49,0:31:34.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.49,0:31:34.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:35.58,0:31:37.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉也一样
Dialogue: 1,0:31:35.58,0:31:37.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Nor does Marge.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:38.83,0:31:41.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,都是独子
Dialogue: 1,0:31:38.83,0:31:41.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,All only children.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:47.59,0:31:49.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,这意味着什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.59,0:31:49.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.93,0:31:54.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,意味着我们从未和人共用一个浴池
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.93,0:31:54.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Means we've never shared a bath.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:58.35,0:32:01.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很冷 我能进来吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:58.35,0:32:01.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I'm cold. Can I get in?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:08.23,0:32:09.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 1,0:32:08.23,0:32:09.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:12.41,0:32:15.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不是说和你一起
Dialogue: 1,0:32:12.41,0:32:15.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I didn't mean with you in it.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:18.95,0:32:22.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:32:18.95,0:32:22.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:22.62,0:32:26.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,进来吧 我也该去修修边幅了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:22.62,0:32:26.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Get in. I'm like a prune anyway.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:48.37,0:32:50.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是我 不过是年代久远罢了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.37,0:32:50.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It is me. It's an old picture.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:50.91,0:32:54.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,每次都是这样! "是你吗? 看起来不像你"
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.91,0:32:54.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Every time! "Is it you?It doesn't look like you."
Dialogue: 2,0:32:54.24,0:32:56.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,天!
Dialogue: 1,0:32:54.24,0:32:56.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,信․․․格林立夫写给瑞普雷的
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Letters...Greenleaf and for Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:59.03,0:33:01.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢 弗朗"我想念你 你什么时候回来?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.03,0:33:01.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ooh. Fran. "I miss you. When are you coming home?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:02.03,0:33:04.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,别告诉我你在那儿过得有多开心
Dialogue: 1,0:33:02.03,0:33:04.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop telling me what an incredible time you're having.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:04.67,0:33:06.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 或是你又多爱迪克  - 哇噢!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:04.67,0:33:06.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- How much you love Dickie. - Whoo!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:06.84,0:33:09.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,爱玛吉和蒙吉"
Dialogue: 1,0:33:06.84,0:33:09.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And Marge and Mongibello."
Dialogue: 2,0:33:10.04,0:33:12.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,这封信, 我认为是你父亲写的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.04,0:33:12.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And this one, I think, is from your father.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:15.84,0:33:20.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 他说了些什么?  - 他开始不耐烦了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:15.84,0:33:20.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Let me see it. What does he say? - He's getting impatient.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:20.97,0:33:25.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,他想让我保证你能在感恩节前赶回去
Dialogue: 1,0:33:20.97,0:33:25.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He wants me to reassure him that you're going to be home by Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:25.48,0:33:28.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,你得买件新外套了, 真的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:25.48,0:33:28.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've got to get a new jacket. Really.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:28.36,0:33:30.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,老穿一件衣服, 你一定觉得很厌烦了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:28.36,0:33:30.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You must be sick of wearing the same clothes.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不能 我不能老花你父亲的钱
Dialogue: 1,0:33:30.65,0:33:33.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can't. I can't keep spending your father's money.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:33.70,0:33:36.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的责任感
Dialogue: 1,0:33:33.70,0:33:36.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I love how responsible you are.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:36.70,0:33:39.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,我爸爸会让你做个首席会计之类的工作
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.70,0:33:39.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My dad should make you chief accountant or something.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:39.87,0:33:42.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,或者等我接管的时候, 我想那是不可能发生了, 我聘你
Dialogue: 1,0:33:39.87,0:33:42.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Or when I take over, which is never, I will.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:42.91,0:33:46.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,好的 当你接管的时候, 反正遥遥无期, 我接受
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.91,0:33:46.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay. When you take over, which is never, I'll accept.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:46.71,0:33:48.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,让我给你买件外套 当我们一起去罗马的时候, 那儿有个极好的地方․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:33:46.71,0:33:48.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Let me buy you a jacket. When we get to Rome, there's a great place...
Dialogue: 2,0:33:48.92,0:33:52.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 巴蒂斯多尼  - 巴蒂斯多尼
Dialogue: 1,0:33:48.92,0:33:52.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Battistoni. - Battistoni.
Dialogue: 2,0:33:56.38,0:33:59.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,罗马, 我们带汤姆去罗马
Dialogue: 1,0:33:56.38,0:33:59.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Roma, we're taking Tom to Roma
Dialogue: 2,0:33:59.60,0:34:03.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们一起去罗马
Dialogue: 1,0:33:59.60,0:34:03.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We' re going to a- Roma
Dialogue: 2,0:34:10.77,0:34:13.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,早上好 漂亮的毛衣
Dialogue: 1,0:34:10.77,0:34:13.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Buongiorno. Nice sweater.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:13.65,0:34:15.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们应该到哪儿雇辆马车去广场?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.65,0:34:15.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where do we get a carrozza for the Forum?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:15.78,0:34:18.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们能雇他们吗?  - 放松点
Dialogue: 1,0:34:15.78,0:34:18.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Can we just hire any of them? - Relax.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:18.54,0:34:20.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,放松点!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:18.54,0:34:20.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:20.83,0:34:23.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,只是今天一天要做的事情太多了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:20.83,0:34:23.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s just there's so much to do in a single day.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:23.70,0:34:27.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,最重要的事是我们该去哪儿吃饭 我希望弗雷迪已经订好了位子
Dialogue: 1,0:34:23.70,0:34:27.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The most important question is where to eat. I hope Freddie made a reservation.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:27.75,0:34:29.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,费雷迪?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:27.75,0:34:29.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:29.75,0:34:33.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,费雷迪 费雷迪·迈尔斯
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.75,0:34:33.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie. Freddie Miles.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.69,0:34:35.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,是费雷迪组织的科尔蒂纳滑雪游
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.69,0:34:35.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie's organizing the Cortina skiing trip.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:35.51,0:34:37.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.51,0:34:37.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:37.30,0:34:39.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 他来了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.30,0:34:39.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, here he is.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.31,0:34:45.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 弗朗西斯科!  - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:43.31,0:34:45.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Frederico! - Comestai?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:50.97,0:34:54.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 天, 你是不是看到每个女人都想上一次?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:50.97,0:34:54.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, God, don't you want to fuck every woman you see just once?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:54.61,0:34:57.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 就一次?  - 当然 就一次 你好
Dialogue: 1,0:34:54.61,0:34:57.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Only once? - Absolutely. Once. Ciao.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:57.86,0:35:00.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆·瑞普雷, 弗雷迪·迈尔斯  - 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,0:34:57.86,0:35:00.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom Ripley, Freddie Miles. - Tom.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:00.09,0:35:05.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,我是指, 嗨, 如果我这也叫晚, 想想看她老公会怎么说
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.09,0:35:05.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I mean, hey, if I'm late, think what her husband's saying.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:05.18,0:35:07.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你看起来棒极了  - 和往常一样
Dialogue: 1,0:35:05.18,0:35:07.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You look gorgeous. - As always.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:08.87,0:35:10.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 吃饭
Dialogue: 1,0:35:08.87,0:35:10.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, mangiare.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.88,0:35:13.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,好 我在法布里兹奥订了张桌子 汤米
Dialogue: 1,0:35:10.88,0:35:13.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Si. I got us a table outside at Fabrizio's. Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,太棒了 我告诉你
Dialogue: 1,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Outstanding. I tell you,
Dialogue: 2,0:35:15.30,0:35:18.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我快被蒙吉那个小地方给困死了  - 我知道, 我去过那儿
Dialogue: 1,0:35:15.30,0:35:18.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I'm so cabin-crazy with Mongi. - I know. I was there.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:33.65,0:35:36.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,看, 汤姆, 我们得去一个俱乐部见见弗雷迪的一群朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:35:33.65,0:35:36.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Look, Tom, we got to go to a club and meet some friends of Freddie' s.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:36.86,0:35:40.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你想去游玩, 最好现在就去叫辆车
Dialogue: 1,0:35:36.86,0:35:40.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The best thing is, if you want to be a tourist, grab a cab now,
Dialogue: 2,0:35:40.32,0:35:43.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会和你在火车站碰头
Dialogue: 1,0:35:40.32,0:35:43.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and I'll meet you at the railway station.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:43.08,0:35:45.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,哪家俱乐部?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:43.08,0:35:45.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What club?
Dialogue: 2,0:35:46.66,0:35:50.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪和滑雪团一些人安排的
Dialogue: 1,0:35:46.66,0:35:50.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie's arranged it with some of the skiing crowd.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:51.67,0:35:54.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,你想来就来吧, 不过我以为你想去观光
Dialogue: 1,0:35:51.67,0:35:54.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come if you want, but I thought you wanted to go sightseeing.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:54.25,0:35:56.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,我是想, 也许还会去买件外套, 你说过的
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.25,0:35:56.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I do, and then maybe get the jacket and what have you.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克! 你得来听听这个
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dick!You gotta hear this.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:00.55,0:36:03.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,听着, 先穿我的, 等我们回来再说
Dialogue: 1,0:36:00.55,0:36:03.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Listen, just take one of mine when we get back.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:03.51,0:36:06.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.51,0:36:06.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:08.39,0:36:09.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:08.39,0:36:09.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.06,0:36:22.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,再见 玩得开心点, 好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:20.06,0:36:22.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ciao. Have fun, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:35.21,0:36:38.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,你说过要确定你不会错过火车, 𝟖∶𝟎𝟎发车
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.21,0:36:38.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You said to make sure you didn't miss the train. Leaves at 𝟖:𝟎𝟎.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:40.72,0:36:42.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,玩得开心点
Dialogue: 1,0:36:40.72,0:36:42.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Have a good time.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:42.88,0:36:44.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,再见, 汤米
Dialogue: 1,0:36:42.88,0:36:44.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,See ya, Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.39,0:37:34.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果我对她来说还有意义
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.39,0:37:34.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If I meant anything to her
Dialogue: 2,0:37:34.42,0:37:39.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会勇敢, 我将会对她唱这首歌
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.42,0:37:39.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd be brave, and here' s the song I'd bring to her
Dialogue: 2,0:37:39.27,0:37:42.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会对她唱道
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.27,0:37:42.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd sing to her
Dialogue: 2,0:37:43.06,0:37:46.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,也许我是唯一一个
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.06,0:37:46.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,May I be the only one
Dialogue: 2,0:37:46.28,0:37:48.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,对她说
Dialogue: 1,0:37:46.28,0:37:48.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To say I
Dialogue: 2,0:37:48.83,0:37:53.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,在我第一次见到你的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:37:48.83,0:37:53.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Really fell in love the day I
Dialogue: 2,0:37:53.16,0:37:56.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就深深地爱上了你
Dialogue: 1,0:37:53.16,0:37:56.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,First set eyes on you
Dialogue: 2,0:37:58.92,0:38:02.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我能否  - 你在干吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:58.92,0:38:02.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- May I - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:02.38,0:38:05.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦 我只是在自娱自乐罢了
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.38,0:38:05.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh. I was just amusing myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:06.34,0:38:10.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 对不起  - 我希望你能脱下我的衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:38:06.34,0:38:10.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - I wish you'd get out of my clothes.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:10.76,0:38:15.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你是不是还穿了我的鞋?  - 你说过我可以先穿你的外套․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.76,0:38:15.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Do you have my shoes on too? - You said I could pick out a jacket...
Dialogue: 2,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能不能回你自己的房间脱?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:18.40,0:38:20.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did you get undressed in your own room?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:23.23,0:38:25.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,我以为你错过了火车
Dialogue: 1,0:38:23.23,0:38:25.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thought you missed the train.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:25.57,0:38:28.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪用车带我回来的
Dialogue: 1,0:38:25.57,0:38:28.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie drove me back in his car.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.24,0:38:31.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 弗雷迪也来了吗?  - 他就在楼下
Dialogue: 1,0:38:28.24,0:38:31.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is Freddie here? - He's downstairs.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:31.33,0:38:34.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,我刚刚只是在瞎胡闹
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.33,0:38:34.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was just fooling around.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:34.54,0:38:38.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,别再说了 我刚刚只是在瞎胡闹
Dialogue: 1,0:38:34.54,0:38:38.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't say anything. I was just fooling around.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:40.25,0:38:42.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:38:40.25,0:38:42.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:44.17,0:38:46.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,天 在意大利就一件灯芯绒外套
Dialogue: 1,0:38:44.17,0:38:46.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God. A corduroy jacket in Italy.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:46.68,0:38:48.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 早上好, 汤姆  - 早上好
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.68,0:38:48.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Good morning, Tom. - Morning.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:48.68,0:38:51.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,来一起坐
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.68,0:38:51.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come join us.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:53.31,0:38:57.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨 我也想要你这份工作, 汤米
Dialogue: 1,0:38:53.31,0:38:57.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hey. I want this job of yours, Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:57.39,0:39:00.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,我刚刚还在说, 你住在意大利
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.39,0:39:00.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was just saying, you live in Italy,
Dialogue: 2,0:39:00.40,0:39:03.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,你住的是迪克的, 你吃的是迪克的
Dialogue: 1,0:39:00.40,0:39:03.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,you stay at Dickie's house, you eat Dickie's food,
Dialogue: 2,0:39:04.49,0:39:08.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,你穿的是他的, 他父亲还得给你付帐
Dialogue: 1,0:39:04.49,0:39:08.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,you wear his clothes, and his father picks up the tab.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:08.95,0:39:12.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你不想干了
Dialogue: 1,0:39:08.95,0:39:12.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If you get bored,
Dialogue: 2,0:39:12.49,0:39:16.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉我, 我来做
Dialogue: 1,0:39:12.49,0:39:16.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,you let me know, 'cause I'll do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:16.19,0:39:18.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我来做  - 潜到底!
Dialogue: 1,0:39:16.19,0:39:18.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I'll do it. - To the mainland!
Dialogue: 2,0:39:22.96,0:39:26.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,你真应该下来 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:39:22.96,0:39:26.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You really should go in. It's marvelous.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:26.26,0:39:29.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 1,0:39:26.26,0:39:29.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:38.94,0:39:40.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:38.94,0:39:40.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:42.45,0:39:44.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.45,0:39:44.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:48.28,0:39:51.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,和迪克一起是这样的․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:39:48.28,0:39:51.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The thing with Dickie...
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.12,0:39:56.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,就像是阳光为你闪耀, 金光灿烂
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.12,0:39:56.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's like the sun shines on you, and it's glorious.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:57.58,0:40:01.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果他遗忘了你, 就会寒彻骨
Dialogue: 1,0:39:57.58,0:40:01.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And then he forgets you and it's very, very cold.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:01.21,0:40:03.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,我正在学会适应
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.21,0:40:03.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So I'm learning.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:03.21,0:40:06.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,当他注意你时, 你会感觉整个世界只属于你一人
Dialogue: 1,0:40:03.21,0:40:06.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,When you have his attention, you feel you're the only person in the world.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:06.80,0:40:09.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,这就是为什么人人都爱他
Dialogue: 1,0:40:06.80,0:40:09.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's why everybody loves him.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:09.59,0:40:13.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,总是这样 每当一个人进入他的生活․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.59,0:40:13.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's always the same. Whenever someone new comes into his life...
Dialogue: 2,0:40:13.30,0:40:16.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪, 福斯托, 彼得 史密斯⬝金斯利
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.30,0:40:16.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie, Fausto, Peter Smith- Kingsley.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:16.37,0:40:18.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,他是个大好人 你见过他吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:16.37,0:40:18.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's wonderful. Have you met him?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.85,0:40:23.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,特别是你
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.85,0:40:23.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Especially you.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:27.82,0:40:30.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,这还只是男孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.82,0:40:30.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And that' s just the boys.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:37.79,0:40:41.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,快来抓他! 快来抓他!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:37.79,0:40:41.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come get him!Come get him!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:41.62,0:40:43.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉我, 为什么每次男人在一起玩闹
Dialogue: 1,0:40:41.62,0:40:43.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tell me, why is itthat when men play,
Dialogue: 2,0:40:43.64,0:40:45.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,他们总是完一些杀来杀去的游戏?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:43.64,0:40:45.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,they always play at killing each other?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.75,0:40:48.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,他想淹死我! 他想淹死我!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.75,0:40:48.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's drowning me!He's drowning me!
Dialogue: 2,0:40:50.84,0:40:57.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 关于科尔蒂纳的事我很抱歉, 顺便说一句  - 科尔蒂纳怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.84,0:40:57.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry about Cortina, by the way. - What about Cortina?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:57.18,0:41:00.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,他还没․․․迪克还没告诉过你吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:57.18,0:41:00.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Didn't...Didn't- Didn't Dick say?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:01.77,0:41:04.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,他对弗雷迪说过, 然而․․․ 然而明显他还没有․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:41:01.77,0:41:04.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He spoke to Freddie, and-and apparently...
Dialogue: 2,0:41:04.77,0:41:06.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是行不通的
Dialogue: 1,0:41:04.77,0:41:06.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,it's not going to work out.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:08.48,0:41:11.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是因为其他所有人都会滑雪
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.48,0:41:11.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's because everyone else can ski,
Dialogue: 2,0:41:11.09,0:41:13.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你不会自然会产生些影响,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.09,0:41:13.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and it affects where you stay,
Dialogue: 2,0:41:20.70,0:41:23.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,来吧, 弗雷迪
Dialogue: 1,0:41:20.70,0:41:23.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on, Freddie.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:23.25,0:41:25.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,至少留下来过圣母节
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.25,0:41:25.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,At least stick around for the Festival of the Madonna.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:25.92,0:41:28.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 全镇的人都会出来․․․  - 我不这样想
Dialogue: 1,0:41:25.92,0:41:28.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- The whole town comes out... - I don' t think so.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:28.59,0:41:33.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,我自己在罗马, 嗯, 有个圣母节 你不如和我一起来?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:28.59,0:41:33.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I have my own, uh, Madonna back in Rome. Why don' t you come back with me?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:33.34,0:41:35.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,狂多的女人 噢
Dialogue: 1,0:41:33.34,0:41:35.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,A lot of ladies. Ooh.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:41.52,0:41:43.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 噢, 天  - 你来掌舵?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.52,0:41:43.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh, God. - You want to take over?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:43.77,0:41:45.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,好的, 没问题
Dialogue: 1,0:41:43.77,0:41:45.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:45.77,0:41:48.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,就对着卡普里的方向就行了 绕过岩石
Dialogue: 1,0:41:45.77,0:41:48.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just point her at Capri. Avoid the rocks.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:48.77,0:41:51.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,你去哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:48.77,0:41:51.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:51.32,0:41:53.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,安抚玛吉
Dialogue: 1,0:41:51.32,0:41:53.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge maintenance.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:53.40,0:41:55.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:41:53.40,0:41:55.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Aye-aye.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:16.47,0:42:18.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 1,0:42:16.47,0:42:18.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:32.48,0:42:34.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.48,0:42:34.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie...
Dialogue: 2,0:42:36.15,0:42:39.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米 偷窥的感觉如何?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.15,0:42:39.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy. How's the peeping?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:41.08,0:42:45.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米 偷窥的感觉如何?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:41.08,0:42:45.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy, how's the peeping?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:47.21,0:42:49.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米, 汤米, 汤米, 汤米, 汤米
Dialogue: 1,0:42:47.21,0:42:49.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy, Tommy, Tommy, Tommy, Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.40,0:44:43.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,就没人叫辆救护车吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.40,0:44:43.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is someone getting an ambulance?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:48.20,0:44:51.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,就没人叫辆救护车吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:48.20,0:44:51.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is someone getting an ambulance?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:20.19,0:45:23.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,为什么要争执? 那不是她的未婚夫吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:20.19,0:45:23.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What's the fight about?That's her fiancé, isn't it?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:23.94,0:45:28.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我不知道, 你干吗问我?  - 他们是在指责他吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:23.94,0:45:28.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I don't know. Why are you asking me? - Are they blaming him?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:28.58,0:45:31.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,为什么叫一辆救护车得花一个小时?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.58,0:45:31.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How can it take an hour to find an ambulance?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:31.83,0:45:34.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,她早就死了, 亲爱的, 不是吗? 所以我想․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.83,0:45:34.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She was already dead, darling, wasn't she? So I suppose...
Dialogue: 2,0:45:34.42,0:45:38.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么人们说这个国家是个文明古国
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.42,0:45:38.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know why people say this country is civilized.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:39.27,0:45:42.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克!  - 根本就不是 根本就是个原始社会
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.27,0:45:42.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dickie! - It isn't. It's fucking primitive.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:43.76,0:45:46.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,我去看看到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.76,0:45:46.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll go see what's the matter.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.22,0:45:48.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.22,0:45:48.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:05.74,0:46:06.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么伤心
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.74,0:46:06.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know why you' re upset.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:09.41,0:46:11.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道希尔维那, 迪克
Dialogue: 1,0:46:09.41,0:46:11.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know about Silvana, Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:14.66,0:46:16.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你和希尔维那之间的关系
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.66,0:46:16.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know about you and Silvana.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.88,0:46:19.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.88,0:46:19.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What about us?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.51,0:46:26.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,你不需要来收拾! 不需要!
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.51,0:46:26.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You don't have to clean up! Really!
Dialogue: 2,0:46:33.77,0:46:36.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 比如什么?  - 算了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:46:33.77,0:46:36.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Like what? - Forget it.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:38.65,0:46:41.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,她怀孕了 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.65,0:46:41.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She was pregnant. Did you know that?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:45.65,0:46:48.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,希尔维那怀孕了
Dialogue: 1,0:46:45.65,0:46:48.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Silvana was pregnant.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:50.03,0:46:52.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道这在这种地方意味着什么吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:50.03,0:46:52.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means in a place like this?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:52.70,0:46:55.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了接受指责
Dialogue: 1,0:46:52.70,0:46:55.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to take the blame.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:55.71,0:46:59.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你说什么呢?  - 你一直对我这么好
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.71,0:46:59.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - You've been so good to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:59.67,0:47:04.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,你就像是我从未有过的兄弟 我就像是你从未有过的兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:46:59.67,0:47:04.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're the brother I never had. I'm the brother you never had.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:04.46,0:47:07.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我可以为你做任何事, 迪克
Dialogue: 1,0:47:04.46,0:47:07.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I would do anything for you, Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:09.51,0:47:11.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,她来求我帮助她
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.51,0:47:11.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She came to me for help.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:11.68,0:47:13.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,她需要钱
Dialogue: 1,0:47:11.68,0:47:13.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She needed money.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:16.81,0:47:21.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,我没帮她 我没帮她
Dialogue: 1,0:47:16.81,0:47:21.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I didn't help her. I didn't help her.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:21.31,0:47:25.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在她自杀了, 这全是我的错
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.31,0:47:25.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now she' s drowned herself, and it's my fault.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:33.16,0:47:34.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不会说出去的․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:47:33.16,0:47:34.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm not going to say anything...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:35.18,0:47:38.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,包括玛吉, 包括警察, 任何人
Dialogue: 1,0:47:35.18,0:47:38.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to Marge, to the police or anybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:38.16,0:47:41.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是我们俩人之间的秘密, 迪克
Dialogue: 1,0:47:38.16,0:47:41.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's a secret between us, Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.38,0:47:45.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会保守秘密的
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.38,0:47:45.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I'll keep it.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.88,0:47:49.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,"亲爱的汤姆 看到迪克在你去了之后․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.88,0:47:49.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"Dear Tom. in view of the fact Dickie shows...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:49.51,0:47:54.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,并不比以前更想回家․․․如此这般, 如此这般․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:47:49.51,0:47:54.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,no more signs of coming home than before you went..."  blah, blah, blah...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:54.35,0:47:57.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:47:54.35,0:47:57.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.18,0:47:59.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,"我希望这次旅行给你带来了一定快乐․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.18,0:47:59.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"I hope that the trip has afforded you some pleasure...
Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.89,0:48:03.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,虽然目标并没有达成
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.89,0:48:03.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,despite the failure of its main objective.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:03.19,0:48:07.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,你也无需认为还对我们负有任何义务"
Dialogue: 1,0:48:03.19,0:48:07.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You no longer should consider yourself obligated to us in any way."
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.74,0:48:09.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,不能怪他
Dialogue: 1,0:48:07.74,0:48:09.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can't blame him.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:09.82,0:48:11.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,不会一直这样下去的, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.82,0:48:11.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You could hardly expect this to go on forever, Tom.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:12.13,0:48:14.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 你可以再写信
Dialogue: 1,0:48:12.13,0:48:14.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, you can write again.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:14.53,0:48:17.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 特别是我们现在已经成兄弟了  - 我不能
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.53,0:48:17.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Especially now we're brothers. - I can't.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.54,0:48:19.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,我怎么能这么做, 会很丢脸
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.54,0:48:19.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How can l, in all decency.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:19.71,0:48:22.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,你自己说过 你在这里花的钱都是我父亲的
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.71,0:48:22.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You said it yourself. It' s my dad's money you're spending.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:22.54,0:48:26.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们玩得很开心, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.54,0:48:26.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We've had a great run though, haven't we?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:26.71,0:48:30.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 我们还是要去威尼斯 我们可以按原计划去
Dialogue: 1,0:48:26.71,0:48:30.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, we'll still go to Venice. We could stick to that plan.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:30.72,0:48:32.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不这样认为, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,0:48:30.72,0:48:32.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Tom.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:32.89,0:48:35.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,你无法支付旅费, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:32.89,0:48:35.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You can' t pay your own way, can you?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:35.56,0:48:39.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们都该往前了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:35.56,0:48:39.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It' s time we all moved on.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:40.41,0:48:44.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,我受不了蒙吉 特别是现在, 当一切都
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.41,0:48:44.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm sick of Mongi. Especially now, with everything...
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.31,0:48:46.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,我真的很想搬去北方
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.31,0:48:46.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I really want to move to the north.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:46.36,0:48:48.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,我下星期要去圣雷默看看
Dialogue: 1,0:48:46.36,0:48:48.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I need to check out San Remo next week.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:48.94,0:48:51.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,给游艇找个新地方
Dialogue: 1,0:48:48.94,0:48:51.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Find somewhere new to keep the boat.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:51.10,0:48:54.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然, 如果你能来就太好了, 如果你和我一起去圣雷默
Dialogue: 1,0:48:51.10,0:48:54.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It would be great, though, if you came with me to San Remo.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:54.53,0:48:58.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,哪儿有个很棒的爵士节 我们可以很体面地告别
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.53,0:48:58.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's a great jazz festival. We could say good-bye in style.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:58.59,0:49:00.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:58.59,0:49:00.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:00.75,0:49:03.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们最后的旅行!
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.75,0:49:03.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Our last trip!
Dialogue: 2,0:49:09.09,0:49:11.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.09,0:49:11.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:05.31,0:50:07.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,你干吗老那么扭你的脖子?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:05.31,0:50:07.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why do you do that thing with your neck?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:07.65,0:50:09.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,怎么扭了?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:07.65,0:50:09.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:11.78,0:50:15.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,在火车上, 你老是这么干
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.78,0:50:15.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,On trains, you always  do that thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:19.20,0:50:22.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,阴森森的
Dialogue: 1,0:50:19.20,0:50:22.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Spooky.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:22.16,0:50:26.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,阴森森․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.16,0:50:26.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Spook... k. k...k. k...k. k...
Dialogue: 2,0:50:30.04,0:50:32.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,阴森森
Dialogue: 1,0:50:30.04,0:50:32.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Spooky.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:53.49,0:50:55.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:53.49,0:50:55.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:55.51,0:50:58.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不是告诉过你圣雷默很疯狂?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.51,0:50:58.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you San Remo was crazy?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:58.87,0:51:01.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,这才像嘛! 来啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.87,0:51:01.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is more like it!Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:11.55,0:51:14.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.55,0:51:14.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Grazie.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:14.13,0:51:17.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,敬蒙吉, 敬我生命中最快乐的时光
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.13,0:51:17.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To Mongibello and the happiest days of my life.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:17.38,0:51:19.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,敬蒙吉, 你今晚很开心
Dialogue: 1,0:51:17.38,0:51:19.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To Mongi. You're cheerful tonight.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.05,0:51:22.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,我突然很高兴快回去了
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.05,0:51:22.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly quite happy to be going back.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:22.56,0:51:25.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,在普林斯顿时我认识你吗, 汤姆?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:22.56,0:51:25.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did I know you at Princeton, Tom?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:25.39,0:51:28.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不觉得我认识你, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.39,0:51:28.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't think I did, did I?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:28.84,0:51:31.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 为什么突然一下问起这个?  - 没什么
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.84,0:51:31.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Why are you asking all of a sudden? - No reason.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:31.40,0:51:35.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,也许是因为你要离开了, 我猜 我不认为你是打那儿毕业的
Dialogue: 1,0:51:31.40,0:51:35.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Because you're leaving, I guess. I don't think you were there.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.06,0:51:39.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 我是在恭维你
Dialogue: 1,0:51:36.06,0:51:39.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Why? - I mean it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:39.28,0:51:41.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你的品位很高
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.28,0:51:41.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've got such great taste.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:41.28,0:51:45.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,普林斯顿那帮俗人什么都尝试所以没品
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.28,0:51:45.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Most of the thugs at Princeton had tasted everything and had no taste.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:45.54,0:51:50.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,我经常这样说,"美国奶油:又厚又油"
Dialogue: 1,0:51:45.54,0:51:50.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I used to say,"the cream of America: rich and thick."
Dialogue: 2,0:51:50.63,0:51:52.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪就是一个典型
Dialogue: 1,0:51:50.63,0:51:52.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie's the perfect example.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:52.79,0:51:55.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,那我就当恭维来听了
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.79,0:51:55.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:55.46,0:51:57.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就知道! 我就知道
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.46,0:51:57.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I knew it!I knew it.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:57.51,0:52:00.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉和我打了个赌
Dialogue: 1,0:51:57.51,0:52:00.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge and I had a bet.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:08.73,0:52:10.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是否真喜欢爵士
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.73,0:52:10.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you even like jazz,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:10.69,0:52:12.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,或者只是为了迎合我?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.69,0:52:12.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,or was that for my benefit?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:13.06,0:52:16.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我当然喜欢  - 噢, 太好了!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:13.06,0:52:16.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I've gotten to like it. - Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:17.40,0:52:20.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,我喜欢你和你所有的生活方式
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.40,0:52:20.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I' ve gotten to like everything about the way you live.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:20.36,0:52:22.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,这事关爱
Dialogue: 1,0:52:20.36,0:52:22.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's one big love affair.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:24.74,0:52:26.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你知道我以前在纽约的生活
Dialogue: 1,0:52:24.74,0:52:26.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If you knew my life back home in New York...
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.95,0:52:29.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想放弃吹萨克斯
Dialogue: 1,0:52:26.95,0:52:29.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm thinkin' of givin' up the sax.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:29.62,0:52:31.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,你觉得做鼓手怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.62,0:52:31.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What do you think about the drums?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:31.33,0:52:34.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 太酷了
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.33,0:52:34.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - So cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:34.63,0:52:37.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,我明天打算租艘船, 四处看看
Dialogue: 1,0:52:34.63,0:52:37.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rent a boat tomorrow, take a look around.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:38.59,0:52:41.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,我当初就是这么找到蒙吉的
Dialogue: 1,0:52:38.59,0:52:41.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is how I found my place in Mongi.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:41.22,0:52:44.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,租艘船․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.22,0:52:44.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Took a boat out...
Dialogue: 2,0:52:44.35,0:52:46.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,绕着海岸行驶
Dialogue: 1,0:52:44.35,0:52:46.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,around the bay,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:46.39,0:52:49.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,遇到第一个我喜欢的
Dialogue: 1,0:52:46.39,0:52:49.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,first thing I liked,
Dialogue: 2,0:52:49.05,0:52:50.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就要它
Dialogue: 1,0:52:49.05,0:52:50.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:52.35,0:52:56.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 哇!  - 好了, 迪克 别太疯了
Dialogue: 1,0:52:52.35,0:52:56.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Whoa! - Come on, Dickie. Don' t go crazy.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:56.69,0:52:59.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克 放慢速度!  - 抓紧
Dialogue: 1,0:52:56.69,0:52:59.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dickie. Slow down! - Hold on.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:59.24,0:53:01.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,等一下! 要翻了! 噢, 天啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:59.24,0:53:01.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!It's gonna tip! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:01.32,0:53:04.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,停下! 救命! 救命! 停下!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:01.32,0:53:04.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop it! Somebody!Somebody! Stop it!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:08.41,0:53:10.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我爱这里!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:08.41,0:53:10.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I love it here!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:10.62,0:53:13.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,我爱这里! 我爱这里!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:10.62,0:53:13.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I love it here!I'm gonna move here!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:13.25,0:53:15.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,多美
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.25,0:53:15.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:20.26,0:53:23.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想告诉你我的计划
Dialogue: 1,0:53:20.26,0:53:23.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I want to tell you my plan.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:23.43,0:53:26.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 告诉我吧  - 是这样, 我想․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:53:23.43,0:53:26.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- So tell me. - Well, I thought...
Dialogue: 2,0:53:26.39,0:53:29.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想在新年时自费回来
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.39,0:53:29.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd come back in the new year under my own steam.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:29.35,0:53:32.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 真的? 回意大利?  - 当然
Dialogue: 1,0:53:29.35,0:53:32.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Really? To Italy? - Of course.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:32.60,0:53:36.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想了想, 只是说说而已
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.60,0:53:36.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I figured, just for argument's sake,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:36.87,0:53:38.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,比如说我找了一套房子
Dialogue: 1,0:53:36.87,0:53:38.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,say I got a place.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:38.28,0:53:40.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,比如说我们分摊房租
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.28,0:53:40.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Or say we split the rent on a house,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:40.78,0:53:43.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,我能找一份工作, 或者, 更好些
Dialogue: 1,0:53:40.78,0:53:43.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I could get a job, or, better still,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:43.52,0:53:46.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果我在罗马租了一套房子, 那我们想去那里去那里
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.52,0:53:46.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,if I got a place in Rome, and then when we're there,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:46.02,0:53:47.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,想在这里在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:53:46.02,0:53:47.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,we could be there, and when we're here, we could be here.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:47.91,0:53:52.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我不这样想  - 尤其是考虑到玛吉
Dialogue: 1,0:53:47.91,0:53:52.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I don't think so. - Particularly with the Marge problem.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:52.54,0:53:54.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,你就说是我的错好了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:52.54,0:53:54.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You just blame me.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:55.83,0:54:00.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 玛吉和我就要结婚了  - 怎么会?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:55.83,0:54:00.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Marge and I are getting married. - How?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:00.34,0:54:04.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 怎么会?  - 昨天你还在和其他女孩调情
Dialogue: 1,0:54:00.34,0:54:04.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- How? - Yesterday, you were ogling girls.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:04.38,0:54:07.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,今天你就要结婚了? 太荒谬了
Dialogue: 1,0:54:04.38,0:54:07.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Today you're getting married?That's absurd.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:08.39,0:54:12.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我爱玛吉  - 你爱我 你也没和我结婚啊
Dialogue: 1,0:54:08.39,0:54:12.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I love Marge. - You love me. You're not marrying me.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:12.43,0:54:15.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆, 我不爱你  - 不, 我并不是威胁的意思
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.43,0:54:15.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom, I don't love you. - No, I don't mean that as a threat.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:15.27,0:54:18.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,老实说, 我․․․我有点希望你能离开
Dialogue: 1,0:54:15.27,0:54:18.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm...I' m a little relieved you're going.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:18.44,0:54:21.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我觉得这段时间我们已经看够对方了
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.44,0:54:21.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think we've seen enough of each other for a while.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:26.02,0:54:28.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你有时就像条吸血水蛭!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:26.02,0:54:28.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - You can be a leech!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:29.15,0:54:30.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:29.15,0:54:30.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know that!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:33.19,0:54:36.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,而且․․․令人厌烦
Dialogue: 1,0:54:33.19,0:54:36.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And... it' s boring.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:38.75,0:54:42.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,你有时真的很令人厌烦
Dialogue: 1,0:54:38.75,0:54:42.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You can be quite boring.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.73,0:54:56.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,可笑的是, 我没有假装․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.73,0:54:56.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The funny thing is, I'm not pretending...
Dialogue: 2,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,去成为别人, 你却一直这样
Dialogue: 1,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to be somebody else, and you are.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:58.56,0:55:01.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 令人厌烦  - 我对你一直都很․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.56,0:55:01.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Boring. - I' ve been absolutely honest with you...
Dialogue: 2,0:55:01.82,0:55:03.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,坦诚相待
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.82,0:55:03.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,about my feelings.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:03.82,0:55:06.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 令人厌烦  - 但是你․․․首先
Dialogue: 1,0:55:03.82,0:55:06.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Boring. - But you...First of all,
Dialogue: 2,0:55:06.53,0:55:08.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你在隐藏一些事
Dialogue: 1,0:55:06.53,0:55:08.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know there's something.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:08.53,0:55:11.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,举个例子, 那一晚, 当我们在下棋的时候, 就很明显
Dialogue: 1,0:55:08.53,0:55:11.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That evening, when we played chess, for instance, it was obvious.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:11.58,0:55:15.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 哪一晚?  - 对你来说表现出来会很危险
Dialogue: 1,0:55:11.58,0:55:15.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What evening? - It's too dangerous for you to take on.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:15.61,0:55:17.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 不, 不 我们是兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:55:15.61,0:55:17.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no. We're brothers.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:17.21,0:55:22.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨 然后你就和玛吉做哪些肮脏的事․․․干她․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.21,0:55:22.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hey. And then you do this sordid thing with Marge...fucking her...
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.26,0:55:24.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,在船上, 我们还都得听着
Dialogue: 1,0:55:22.26,0:55:24.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,on the boat, while we all have to listen,
Dialogue: 2,0:55:24.18,0:55:25.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,根本就是种折磨
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.18,0:55:25.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,which was excruciating.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.92,0:55:29.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,你总是用下半身来思考․․․现在你倒是要结婚了
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.92,0:55:29.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And you follow your cock around like a...And now you're getting married.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:29.18,0:55:31.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 我太迷惑了 原谅我
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.18,0:55:31.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, I' m bewildered. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:31.55,0:55:34.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,你欺骗玛吉却还要和她结婚
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.55,0:55:34.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're lying to Marge and then you're getting married to her.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:34.38,0:55:38.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,你甩了席尔瓦那, 毁了所有人․․․你想吹萨克斯
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.38,0:55:38.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're knocking up Sylvana, ruining everybody....You want to play the sax.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:38.48,0:55:41.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,你想做鼓手 是这样吗, 迪克? 你到底是什么․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:55:38.48,0:55:41.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You want to play the drums. Which is it, Dickie? What are you actually...
Dialogue: 2,0:55:42.82,0:55:46.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,你又是什么? 嗯? 一个三流乞丐? 你又是什么?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:42.82,0:55:46.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Who are you? Huh?Some third-class mooch? Who are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:46.65,0:55:48.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,谁给你权力来教训我的?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:46.65,0:55:48.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Who are you to say anything to me?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:48.70,0:55:51.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,谁给你权力来教训我的?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:48.70,0:55:51.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Who are you to tell me anything?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:51.32,0:55:54.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,其实, 我真的, 真的无法忍受和你一起呆在这条船上
Dialogue: 1,0:55:51.32,0:55:54.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Actually, I really, really do not want to be on this boat with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:54.49,0:55:57.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你不动我就动不了  - 住嘴 住嘴
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.49,0:55:57.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I can't move without you moving. - Shut up. Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:57.20,0:56:00.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,是你让我起鸡皮疙瘩 是你让我起鸡皮疙瘩
Dialogue: 1,0:55:57.20,0:56:00.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It gives me the creeps. You give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:00.50,0:56:02.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你住嘴  - 没有你在一旁像小姑娘一样叫"迪克, 迪克"
Dialogue: 1,0:56:00.50,0:56:02.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You shut up. - I can't move without "Dickie, Dickie,"
Dialogue: 2,0:56:02.54,0:56:04.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就动不了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.54,0:56:04.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Like a little girl all the time.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:04.67,0:56:06.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,住嘴!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:04.67,0:56:06.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:08.04,0:56:10.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 天啊, 迪克
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.04,0:56:10.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, God, Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:10.84,0:56:13.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 看在上帝的份上  - 噢․․․噢 上帝啊!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:10.84,0:56:13.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- God's sake. - Oh...Oh God!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:15.77,0:56:18.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:56:15.77,0:56:18.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:18.31,0:56:20.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们得给你․․․好․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:56:18.31,0:56:20.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We have to get you... Okay...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:22.52,0:56:25.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我要杀了你! 杀了你!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:22.52,0:56:25.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!Kill you!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:28.28,0:56:30.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,你死定了!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.28,0:56:30.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:37.50,0:56:40.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,住手! 住手! 求你了! 求你了!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.50,0:56:40.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!Please! Please!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:40.37,0:56:44.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,快住手! 快住手!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.37,0:56:44.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:46.46,0:56:48.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克, 放开!- 我要杀了你!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:46.46,0:56:48.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dickie, let go!- I' ll kill you!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:54.14,0:56:57.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,住手! 住手! 住手!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:54.14,0:56:57.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:56:57.89,0:57:00.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,住手! 住手! 住手!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:57.89,0:57:00.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!Stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:59:05.05,0:59:06.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好 我能拿我的钥匙吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:05.05,0:59:06.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hi. Can I have my key, please?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:06.52,0:59:08.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 1,0:59:06.52,0:59:08.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:08.56,0:59:12.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,你一定很冷吧 呃, 格林立夫先生, 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:08.56,0:59:12.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You must be very cold. Uh, Signor Greenleaf, yes?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:12.48,0:59:14.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,不 我是․․․
Dialogue: 1,0:59:12.48,0:59:14.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No. I'm...
Dialogue: 2,1:00:25.76,1:00:27.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 玛吉
Dialogue: 1,1:00:25.76,1:00:27.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hello, Marge.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:27.35,1:00:30.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:27.35,1:00:30.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:30.42,1:00:32.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,你吓着我了!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:30.42,1:00:32.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:32.19,1:00:35.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 对不起 你怎么样?  - 你回来了!
Dialogue: 1,1:00:32.19,1:00:35.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Sorry. How are you? - You're back!
Dialogue: 2,1:00:35.44,1:00:37.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你的书进展得还顺利吧?  - 是啊
Dialogue: 1,1:00:35.44,1:00:37.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Your book going well? - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:38.09,1:00:41.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,很顺利, 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:00:38.09,1:00:41.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm on a good streak, thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.12,1:00:45.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,我只是․․․一直很安静地望着你
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.12,1:00:45.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was just...Looking at you. So quiet.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:46.74,1:00:48.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.74,1:00:48.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where's Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.22,1:00:54.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想他计划在罗马多呆几天
Dialogue: 1,1:00:51.22,1:00:54.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think he's planning on staying in Rome for a few days.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:54.45,1:00:58.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,罗马? 呃 他说为什么了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:54.45,1:00:58.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Rome? Ahh. Did he say why?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:58.12,1:01:01.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不了解迪克 你也知道
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.12,1:01:01.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't understand Dickie. Your guess is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:01.32,1:01:02.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,什么意思?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:01.32,1:01:02.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:03.05,1:01:08.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 某一天我被邀请去滑雪, 第二天就不要我去了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:03.05,1:01:08.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, one day I'm invited skiing, the next day I'm not.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:09.73,1:01:14.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,某一天, 我们是一家人, 第二天他就想独自呆着
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.73,1:01:14.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,One day, we're one family, then the next day he wants to be alone.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:14.46,1:01:16.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,你告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:01:14.46,1:01:16.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You tell me.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:16.06,1:01:18.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,那是他说的吗? 他想一个人呆着?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:16.06,1:01:18.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is that what he said?He wants to be alone?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:18.74,1:01:23.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,他一直想着你 他让我给你这个
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.74,1:01:23.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He was thinking of you. He asked me to deliver this.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:23.24,1:01:26.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.24,1:01:26.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.66,1:01:28.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,他知道我喜欢这种香水
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.66,1:01:28.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He knows I love this.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:30.50,1:01:34.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 为什么他不等回来再送给我呢 我․․․  - 任务一:
Dialogue: 1,1:01:30.50,1:01:34.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- But why it couldn't have waited. I... - Errand number one.:
Dialogue: 2,1:01:34.00,1:01:36.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,转交给玛吉香水
Dialogue: 1,1:01:34.00,1:01:36.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,deliver Marge's perfume.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:36.25,1:01:38.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,任务二:
Dialogue: 1,1:01:36.25,1:01:38.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Errand number two:
Dialogue: 2,1:01:38.88,1:01:42.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,收拾些衣服, 再带上他那支宝贝萨克斯
Dialogue: 1,1:01:38.88,1:01:42.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,pack some clothes and his precious saxophone.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:43.72,1:01:45.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,他打算住多久?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:43.72,1:01:45.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How long is he staying for?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:45.76,1:01:49.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,问我也白问 我猜我们都被抛弃了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:45.76,1:01:49.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Search me. I guess we're abandoned.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:15.54,1:02:17.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,见鬼!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.54,1:02:17.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:19.30,1:02:21.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.30,1:02:21.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:32.37,1:02:35.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是迪克夹在香水盒里的一封信
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.37,1:02:35.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There was a letter from Dickie in with my perfume.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:37.19,1:02:40.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道这次并不是多呆几天
Dialogue: 1,1:02:37.19,1:02:40.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You realize it's more than just a few days.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:40.94,1:02:44.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,他想着要搬到罗马去
Dialogue: 1,1:02:40.94,1:02:44.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's thinking of moving to Rome.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:45.11,1:02:47.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,事实上是
Dialogue: 1,1:02:45.11,1:02:47.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 2,1:02:47.49,1:02:50.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,他离开前一天的晚上, 我们․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:02:47.49,1:02:50.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,the night before he left, we...
Dialogue: 2,1:02:50.24,1:02:53.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们商量要搬到一起住․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.24,1:02:53.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,we talked about moving together...
Dialogue: 2,1:02:54.03,1:02:57.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,北面的某个地方, 我猜我․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.03,1:02:57.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,somewhere north, and I suppose I...
Dialogue: 2,1:02:58.75,1:03:02.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,是在结婚这件事上给了他太多的压力
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.75,1:03:02.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,put some pressure on him about getting married.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.30,1:03:06.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,我只是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.30,1:03:06.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:08.18,1:03:11.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,只是我有可能把他吓走了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.18,1:03:11.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I just might have scared him off.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:16.14,1:03:18.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,当我们一起躺在床上․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.14,1:03:18.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's a side to him...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.86,1:03:22.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我望着他的侧面․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.86,1:03:22.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,when our heads are on the pillow...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:22.28,1:03:25.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道再没有人能像他这样温柔
Dialogue: 1,1:03:22.28,1:03:25.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know no one else sees that's so tender.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:27.70,1:03:31.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想我该跟随你到罗马去问问他
Dialogue: 1,1:03:27.70,1:03:31.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think I should come with you to Rome and confront him.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:37.33,1:03:40.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,他讨厌被质问
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.33,1:03:40.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He hates being confronted.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:42.21,1:03:44.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,我认为你是对的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:42.21,1:03:44.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think you' re right.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:53.12,1:03:55.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢 住店
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.12,1:03:55.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Grazie. Checking in.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:03.68,1:04:05.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,住店
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.68,1:04:05.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Checking in.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:05.68,1:04:10.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 瑞普雷先生?  - 对
Dialogue: 1,1:04:05.68,1:04:10.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Signor Ripley? - It's me.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:12.51,1:04:15.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生
Dialogue: 1,1:04:12.51,1:04:15.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Signor Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:15.15,1:04:17.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然是格林立夫先生 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 1,1:04:15.15,1:04:17.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:17.74,1:04:20.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:04:17.74,1:04:20.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:39.30,1:04:40.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,喂?
Dialogue: 1,1:04:39.30,1:04:40.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Pronto?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.40,1:04:43.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,是的, 我想打个电话给高道尼旅馆
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.40,1:04:43.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd like to telephone the Hotel Goldoni.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:43.42,1:04:47.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好的, 先生  - 我找托马斯·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,1:04:43.42,1:04:47.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Si, signor. - I want to speak to Thomas Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:47.69,1:04:50.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 瑞普雷? 知道了  - 是的 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:04:47.69,1:04:50.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ripley? Subito. - Yes. Grazie.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:03.62,1:05:04.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 1,1:05:03.62,1:05:04.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Pronto.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:04.71,1:05:06.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生, 瑞普雷先生不在
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.71,1:05:06.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Signor Greenleaf, Signor Ripley's not there.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他不在?  - 不在, 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He's not there? - No, signor.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:07.88,1:05:10.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧, 我留个言
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.88,1:05:10.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, I would like to leave a message.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:10.72,1:05:13.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他不在那儿? 那我留言吧  - 不在, 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:05:10.72,1:05:13.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He's not there? I'll leave a message. - No, signor.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:14.05,1:05:16.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 接到你的电话  - 接到你的电话
Dialogue: 1,1:05:14.05,1:05:16.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Got your call. - Got your call.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:16.22,1:05:18.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 今晚共餐․․․  - 今晚共餐․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:05:16.22,1:05:18.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dinner tonight... - Dinner tonight...
Dialogue: 2,1:05:18.22,1:05:19.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 似乎不错  - 似乎不错
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.22,1:05:19.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- sounds fine. - sounds fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:19.23,1:05:22.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 瑞普雷 瑞普雷  - 瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,1:05:19.23,1:05:22.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ripley. Ripley. - Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:22.81,1:05:26.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克·格林立夫  - 迪克·格林立夫
Dialogue: 1,1:05:22.81,1:05:26.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dickie Greenleaf. - Dickie Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:26.40,1:05:29.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是的 格林立夫  - 格林立夫
Dialogue: 1,1:05:26.40,1:05:29.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes. Greenleaf. - Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:29.45,1:05:31.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,在格兰得旅馆
Dialogue: 1,1:05:29.45,1:05:31.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,At the Grand.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:31.66,1:05:35.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想在这个钱包上加点装饰
Dialogue: 1,1:05:31.66,1:05:35.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I' d like to have this wallet embossed.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:35.16,1:05:37.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道这个词用英文怎么说
Dialogue: 1,1:05:35.16,1:05:37.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know the word in Italian.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.16,1:05:39.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,装饰一下 当然可以, 格林立夫先生
Dialogue: 1,1:05:37.16,1:05:39.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Embossed. Of course, Signor Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:39.25,1:05:41.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:05:39.25,1:05:41.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.21,1:05:48.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克! 我是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.21,1:05:48.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie!It's...
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.76,1:05:54.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.76,1:05:54.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh, my gosh. - Meredith.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.88,1:05:56.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好!  - 你好 请进 请进
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.88,1:05:56.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ciao! - Ciao. Come in. Come in.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:56.77,1:05:59.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过你会和那些美国佬一起去滑雪, 对吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:56.77,1:05:59.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But you're going skiing with those Yankees, aren't you?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:59.48,1:06:03.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 圣诞节 去科尔蒂纳滑雪
Dialogue: 1,1:05:59.48,1:06:03.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - At Christmas. To Cortina.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:03.24,1:06:05.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 和弗雷迪·迈尔斯  - 你是怎么知道的?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.24,1:06:05.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- With Freddie Miles. - How did you know that?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:05.28,1:06:09.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢! 人人都认识弗雷迪·迈尔斯
Dialogue: 1,1:06:05.28,1:06:09.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh! Everybody knows Freddie Miles.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:12.48,1:06:14.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪在罗马?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:12.48,1:06:14.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is Freddie in Rome?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:14.50,1:06:16.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 现在?  - 对
Dialogue: 1,1:06:14.50,1:06:16.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:16.08,1:06:18.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我可不这样想
Dialogue: 1,1:06:16.08,1:06:18.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:18.50,1:06:23.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过我․․․不过我见过他, 当然, 我们还聊了几句
Dialogue: 1,1:06:18.50,1:06:23.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But l...But I've met him, of course, and we've chatted.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:23.18,1:06:26.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,而且我还知道你․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:06:23.18,1:06:26.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I know about you...
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.78,1:06:29.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,和玛吉两人在蒙吉
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.78,1:06:29.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and Marge in Mongi.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:29.35,1:06:32.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还真是只靠不住的小老鼠啊
Dialogue: 1,1:06:29.35,1:06:32.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What an unreliable rat you are.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:32.65,1:06:34.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然, 弗雷迪说你是只小老鼠
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.65,1:06:34.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, Freddie said you were a rat.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:35.31,1:06:37.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在我想到了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:35.31,1:06:37.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 2,1:06:37.32,1:06:40.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,"为什么他旅行时以'R'作为姓名首字母"
Dialogue: 1,1:06:37.32,1:06:40.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"Ah, now I know why  he travels under 'R."'
Dialogue: 2,1:06:40.53,1:06:42.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,我离开了玛吉, 梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,1:06:40.53,1:06:42.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've left Marge, Meredith.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:43.15,1:06:45.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,离开了蒙吉
Dialogue: 1,1:06:43.15,1:06:45.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And Mongi.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:45.24,1:06:49.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 所以现在这只老鼠在罗马了  - 噢, 太遗憾了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:45.24,1:06:49.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- So the rat's here in Rome. - Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:49.58,1:06:51.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 别觉得遗憾, 别 我从未这样开心过
Dialogue: 1,1:06:49.58,1:06:51.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be sorry, no. I've never been happier.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:51.79,1:06:55.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․我觉得自己好像被赋予了新生命
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.79,1:06:55.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I feel like I've been handed a new life.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:55.17,1:07:00.05,Default,22,0,0,0,,事实是如果你一生都很富有
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.17,1:07:00.05,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The truth is that if you' ve had money your entire life,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:00.14,1:07:03.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,你要么就像我们这样蔑视金钱․․․对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:00.14,1:07:03.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,either you despise it, which we do...agreed?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.51,1:07:06.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,你也只有在和其它那些富有又同样蔑视金钱的人一起时․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.51,1:07:06.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're only truly comfortable around other people...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.52,1:07:08.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,才会真正感觉舒服
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.52,1:07:08.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,who have it and despise it.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:08.69,1:07:10.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.69,1:07:10.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:12.11,1:07:14.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,我还从来没向任何人坦白过这一点
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.11,1:07:14.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've never admitted that to anyone.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:20.29,1:07:24.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,因为我的朋友格林立夫先生, 格林立夫和我
Dialogue: 1,1:07:20.29,1:07:24.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Because my friend Mr. Greenleaf, Signor Greenleaf and I,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:24.62,1:07:26.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,打算花钱搞个小狂欢
Dialogue: 1,1:07:24.62,1:07:26.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,are on a little spending spree.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.13,1:07:29.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 明白了  - 我们的行为不太检点
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.13,1:07:29.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I see. - We're behaving very badly.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:29.67,1:07:34.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我喜欢意大利的纸币 色调很暗 不会让我觉得有罪恶感
Dialogue: 1,1:07:29.67,1:07:34.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I love Italian money. So dark. Doesn't make you feel guilty.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.22,1:07:37.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谢․․․谢  - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.22,1:07:37.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Gr-r-razie. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:46.73,1:07:50.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不想要太多大钞 没人愿意找零
Dialogue: 1,1:07:46.73,1:07:50.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't want too many large bills. No one will change them.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:50.32,1:07:52.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,完全没问题, 格林立夫先生
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.32,1:07:52.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tutto bene, Signor Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:08.26,1:08:12.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我真的很喜欢这一件  - 我想把它也买下来
Dialogue: 1,1:08:08.26,1:08:12.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I really like this too. - I think I'm having that too.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:18.27,1:08:20.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.27,1:08:20.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:25.57,1:08:28.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 再见  - 再见 噢!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:25.57,1:08:28.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Arrivederci. - Arrivederci. Oops!
Dialogue: 2,1:08:29.28,1:08:31.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 再见  - 再见
Dialogue: 1,1:08:29.28,1:08:31.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ciao. - Ciao.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:36.71,1:08:41.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你是个爵士迷, 不过你就一定恨歌剧吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.71,1:08:41.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know you're a jazz fiend, but do you absolutely hate the opera?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:44.34,1:08:47.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一直想․․․我一直想․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.34,1:08:47.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've...I've...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:47.60,1:08:50.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,解决掉我的几张门票
Dialogue: 1,1:08:47.60,1:08:50.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,been trying to give my tickets away.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:51.43,1:08:55.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,明天的 不过如果你愿意被硬拖着去的话․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.43,1:08:55.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's tomorrow. But if you were prepared to be dragged...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:57.08,1:08:59.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,你可以拉我去
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.08,1:08:59.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You could drag me.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:49.15,1:10:51.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,费奥多·卡利亚宾 全是俄国男中音
Dialogue: 1,1:10:49.15,1:10:51.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Feodor Chaliapin. It's the whole Russian baritone.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:51.84,1:10:54.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,非常感谢你今晚邀请我来
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.84,1:10:54.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for inviting me tonight.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:54.70,1:10:58.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,你受的了? 我们听说你是弗雷迪的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:10:54.70,1:10:58.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can you bear it?We hear you are a friend of Freddie's.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:58.63,1:11:01.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,他在胸前纹了"我恨歌剧"几个字
Dialogue: 1,1:10:58.63,1:11:01.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He has "I hate opera" tattooed on his chest.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:01.88,1:11:04.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪胸前足够刻上整个歌剧剧本了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:01.88,1:11:04.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's room for a whole libretto on Freddie's chest.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,我确信我们见过面
Dialogue: 1,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm sure we've met before.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:08.89,1:11:12.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,我确信我们见过面 你觉得呢, 泰德?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:08.89,1:11:12.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was sure we'd met before. Weren't you, Ted?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:12.89,1:11:14.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克是赫伯特·格林立夫的儿子
Dialogue: 1,1:11:12.89,1:11:14.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dick is Herbert Greenleaf's boy.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:14.98,1:11:16.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我知道  - 对, 我想我们见过面
Dialogue: 1,1:11:14.98,1:11:16.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I know. - Yes, I think we have.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:16.65,1:11:21.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,一分钟前你们还是孩子,  一眨眼功夫连纹身都纹上了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:16.65,1:11:21.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,One minute you people are children, and the next you're getting tattooed.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:22.70,1:11:26.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 干杯  - 干杯
Dialogue: 1,1:11:22.70,1:11:26.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Cheers. - Cheers.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.37,1:11:29.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 1,1:11:27.37,1:11:29.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:33.63,1:11:36.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 请让一下  - 请
Dialogue: 1,1:11:33.63,1:11:36.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Excuse me. - Prego.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:36.45,1:11:38.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢! 对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:11:36.45,1:11:38.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh!Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:38.55,1:11:40.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 你好
Dialogue: 1,1:11:38.55,1:11:40.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:43.30,1:11:44.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆!  - 玛吉!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:43.30,1:11:44.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom! - Marge!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.85,1:11:48.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好吗? 你来罗马干什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.85,1:11:48.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How are you?What are you doing in Rome?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:48.52,1:11:51.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他在这儿吗? 你是和迪克一起的吗?  - 不 嗯, 不是
Dialogue: 1,1:11:48.52,1:11:51.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is he here? Are you with Dickie? - No. Um, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.29,1:11:54.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 你好 嗯, 我是汤姆·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.29,1:11:54.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, hello  Um, I'm Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:54.86,1:11:57.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得·史密斯·金斯利 我从玛吉和迪克那儿听说过不少你的事
Dialogue: 1,1:11:54.86,1:11:57.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Peter Smith- Kingsley. I've heard all about you from Marge and Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:57.86,1:11:59.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 果然如此  - 没․․․没戴眼镜
Dialogue: 1,1:11:57.86,1:11:59.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Ditto. - No...No glasses.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.86,1:12:03.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 你把他藏哪儿了? 他真是不可理喻, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.86,1:12:03.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, where are you hiding him?He's impossible, isn't he?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.78,1:12:05.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,他真不在这?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:03.78,1:12:05.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is he really not here?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.91,1:12:08.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 你知道迪克在胸前刻着"我恨歌剧" 几个字
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.91,1:12:08.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, you know Dickie has"I hate opera" tattooed on his chest.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:08.71,1:12:12.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我以为你们去了威尼斯  - 是呀, 后来怎么样了?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:08.71,1:12:12.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I thought you were going to Venice. - Yes, what happened with that?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.84,1:12:13.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,我听说你一心想来
Dialogue: 1,1:12:12.84,1:12:13.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I heard you were desperate to come.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:13.84,1:12:16.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我还期盼着能带你去划船
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.84,1:12:16.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was rather looking forward to rowing you around.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:16.28,1:12:20.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,是啊, 我是很想来着
Dialogue: 1,1:12:16.28,1:12:20.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I am. I really am.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:20.68,1:12:22.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一直在旅行, 但好像就是到不了那么北的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.68,1:12:22.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've been traveling, and I just can't seem to get that far north.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:22.98,1:12:24.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧, 你得快点, 否则我们都得沉了
Dialogue: 1,1:12:22.98,1:12:24.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, you should hurry, before we sink.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.89,1:12:28.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,这样吧, 我给你我的电话号码
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.89,1:12:28.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Look, let me give you the telephone number.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:28.15,1:12:31.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,看那儿 噢, 看 那不是梅瑞迪斯吗
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.15,1:12:31.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There. Oh, look. There's Meredith.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:32.18,1:12:35.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,梅瑞迪斯 她姓什么来着, 玛吉? 那些开纺织厂的人
Dialogue: 1,1:12:32.18,1:12:35.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Meredith. What's her name, Marge? The textile people.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:35.36,1:12:38.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 想想 我们一些人还在她家度过圣诞
Dialogue: 1,1:12:35.36,1:12:38.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, come on. Some of us spent Christmas at her house.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:38.91,1:12:41.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不认识她
Dialogue: 1,1:12:38.91,1:12:41.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know her.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:41.75,1:12:46.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,他从未打过电话 连信都很少写
Dialogue: 1,1:12:41.75,1:12:46.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He hasn't called. He's hardly written.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:46.59,1:12:48.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,就是写点神秘小纸条, 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:46.59,1:12:48.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just these cryptic notes, you know?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:48.25,1:12:49.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,你不能就这样甩了别人
Dialogue: 1,1:12:48.25,1:12:49.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You don't just dump people.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:49.92,1:12:53.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,这样吧, 我们是呆会见, 或者你是和其它人一起来的?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:49.92,1:12:53.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Look, will we see you later, or are you with people?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:53.59,1:12:57.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 嗯, 呆会不行  - 这样吧, 明天怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.59,1:12:57.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Uh, I can't later. - Well, how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:57.28,1:12:59.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,好啊, 嗯, 早上怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:57.28,1:12:59.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, uh, maybe in the morning?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:59.20,1:13:03.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道斯帕格纳广场边的蒂内利咖啡店吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:59.20,1:13:03.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you know Cafe Dinelli at the Piazza di Spagna?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:03.16,1:13:05.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我知道那广场 几点?  - 𝟏𝟎:𝟑𝟎?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:03.16,1:13:05.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I know the Piazza. What time?  - 𝟏𝟎:𝟑𝟎?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:05.98,1:13:08.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们会准时到的  - 好的
Dialogue: 1,1:13:05.98,1:13:08.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- We'll be there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:08.28,1:13:10.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,那明天见, 玛吉?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:08.28,1:13:10.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So I'll see you in the morning, Marge?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:10.41,1:13:13.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟏𝟎.:𝟑𝟎   很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 1,1:13:10.41,1:13:13.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,𝟏𝟎.:𝟑𝟎   Very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:13.54,1:13:15.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 1,1:13:13.54,1:13:15.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:19.46,1:13:20.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:13:19.46,1:13:20.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:20.42,1:13:24.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,来吧 让我们进去
Dialogue: 1,1:13:20.42,1:13:24.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go back in.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:31.26,1:13:33.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不明白汤姆为什么还在罗马
Dialogue: 1,1:13:31.26,1:13:33.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't understand why Tom's still in Rome.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:33.95,1:13:38.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧  - 我还以为你很喜欢歌剧呢
Dialogue: 1,1:13:33.95,1:13:38.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Let's go. - I thought you were enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:38.77,1:13:40.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,让我们乘马车看看月亮
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.77,1:13:40.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Let's take a carrozza and look at the moon.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:40.46,1:13:43.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,你疯了吗? 外面冷极了
Dialogue: 1,1:13:40.46,1:13:43.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?It's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:43.15,1:13:45.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,来吧 我得和你谈谈 就我们俩
Dialogue: 1,1:13:43.15,1:13:45.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Come on. I need to talk to you. Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:45.27,1:13:47.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:13:45.27,1:13:47.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:50.91,1:13:53.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,请别担心
Dialogue: 1,1:13:50.91,1:13:53.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't worry, please.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:53.50,1:13:56.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 1,1:13:53.50,1:13:56.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:56.42,1:14:00.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,你真的很善解人意 我․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:13:56.42,1:14:00.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're such a palto understand. I...
Dialogue: 2,1:14:00.59,1:14:03.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,就好像玛吉无时无刻不在这儿 当我望着你的脸庞
Dialogue: 1,1:14:00.59,1:14:03.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's like Marge is here right now. I look at you,
Dialogue: 2,1:14:03.52,1:14:04.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,就看到了她的脸
Dialogue: 1,1:14:03.52,1:14:04.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and I see her face.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:04.97,1:14:08.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就是不能․․․不管我对你的感觉到底如何․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:14:04.97,1:14:08.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I can't... No matter what I'm feeling towards you...
Dialogue: 2,1:14:08.21,1:14:13.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,不用解释 我完全․․․理解 当․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:14:08.21,1:14:13.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No. I absolutely...understand. Of c...
Dialogue: 2,1:14:13.29,1:14:16.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,要不然, 你会抗拒我的
Dialogue: 1,1:14:13.29,1:14:16.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'd be fighting me off.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:16.82,1:14:18.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,打走你
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.82,1:14:18.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Beating you away.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:57.45,1:15:00.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过我们明天能见面吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:57.45,1:15:00.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But will you meet me tomorrow?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:00.74,1:15:04.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,就是来个正式告别, 你知道, 在白天
Dialogue: 1,1:15:00.74,1:15:04.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just to say good-bye properly, you know, in the daylight,
Dialogue: 2,1:15:04.68,1:15:06.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,不像现在这样
Dialogue: 1,1:15:04.68,1:15:06.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,so it's not just this.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:06.29,1:15:09.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然 梅瑞迪斯, 很抱歉 我当然会去见你
Dialogue: 1,1:15:06.29,1:15:09.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course. Meredith, I'm sorry. Of course I'll meet you.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.84,1:15:14.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,你永远都应该把痛苦留给白天
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.84,1:15:14.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You should always save pain for daylight.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:14.43,1:15:17.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,不如我们明天早上一起去蒂内利喝咖啡?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.43,1:15:17.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why don't we have coffee in the morning at Dinelli's?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.81,1:15:19.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 就在西班牙阶梯旁边
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.81,1:15:19.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Uh, by the Spanish Steps.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:20.23,1:15:22.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,完全正确 𝟏𝟎:𝟑𝟎?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:20.23,1:15:22.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Exactly. 𝟏𝟎:𝟑𝟎?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:24.61,1:15:27.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 𝟏𝟎:𝟏𝟓  - 好的
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.61,1:15:27.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- 𝟏𝟎:𝟏𝟓 - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:27.28,1:15:29.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.28,1:15:29.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:22.57,1:16:24.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 彼得?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:22.57,1:16:24.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Grazie. - Peter?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:24.25,1:16:26.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好 我是梅瑞迪斯·罗吉
Dialogue: 1,1:16:24.25,1:16:26.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hello. It's Meredith Logue.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:26.68,1:16:30.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然是你 梅瑞迪斯, 你好 对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:16:26.68,1:16:30.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course it is. Meredith, hello. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:30.35,1:16:32.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我还没睡醒呢 你好吗?  - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.35,1:16:32.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I was half asleep. How are you? - How are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:32.56,1:16:34.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是玛吉·舍伍德, 梅瑞迪斯·罗吉
Dialogue: 1,1:16:32.56,1:16:34.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,This is Marge Sherwood. Meredith Logue.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:34.98,1:16:38.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:34.98,1:16:38.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.02,1:16:41.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,来和我们坐一起吧? 我们正在等个朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.02,1:16:41.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do join us, won' t you?We' re just waiting for a friend.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:41.49,1:16:44.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․不了, 其实 我想这有些․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:16:41.49,1:16:44.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I won't, actually  I think there's...
Dialogue: 2,1:16:44.33,1:16:46.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们昨天在歌剧院见过对吗?  - 嗯․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:16:44.33,1:16:46.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Did we see you at the opera last night? - Uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:16:46.99,1:16:49.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,你们是在等迪克?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:46.99,1:16:49.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you waiting for Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:49.79,1:16:53.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克? 你․․․你․․․你认识迪克?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:49.79,1:16:53.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie? Do you...Do you...Do you know Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:54.00,1:16:57.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是在歌剧院 噢, 难怪․․․是的, 我在那儿
Dialogue: 1,1:16:54.00,1:16:57.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You were at the opera. Oh, that explains...Yes, I was there.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:57.80,1:17:00.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,我和迪克一起去的
Dialogue: 1,1:16:57.80,1:17:00.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was there with Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:01.85,1:17:04.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 1,1:17:01.85,1:17:04.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:04.68,1:17:06.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,我告诉过你
Dialogue: 1,1:17:04.68,1:17:06.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:08.98,1:17:13.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 我和你不熟, 所以我也没权利对你说什么․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:17:08.98,1:17:13.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, I don't know you, so I've got no right to...
Dialogue: 2,1:17:13.57,1:17:16.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克爱你 他就是․․․这样说吧․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:17:13.57,1:17:16.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie loves you. He's...Well...
Dialogue: 2,1:17:16.86,1:17:19.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想你会发现他现正赶着去找你呢
Dialogue: 1,1:17:16.86,1:17:19.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think you' ll find he's on his way home to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:20.20,1:17:24.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,好吧, 你是怎么․․․怎么․․․怎么知道这些的?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:20.20,1:17:24.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, how...how...how would you know that?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:25.37,1:17:28.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,他․․․ 告诉了我一切
Dialogue: 1,1:17:25.37,1:17:28.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He... told me everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.29,1:17:32.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢不, 我本应该在𝟏𝟓分钟前和他见面的, 那么, 嗯
Dialogue: 1,1:17:28.29,1:17:32.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, I was supposed to meet him 𝟏𝟓 minutes ago, so, uh,
Dialogue: 2,1:17:33.01,1:17:35.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想我得走了
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.01,1:17:35.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go now, I think.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:37.72,1:17:39.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,天, 除非他是计划好了要让我们见面
Dialogue: 1,1:17:37.72,1:17:39.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God, unless he meant us to meet.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:39.89,1:17:42.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,那就有点太残酷了, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:39.89,1:17:42.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That' d be a little cruel, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:43.05,1:17:44.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 不是, 我们在等其它朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.05,1:17:44.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, no, we're meeting another friend.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:44.60,1:17:47.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆·瑞普雷  - 你认识过汤姆·瑞普雷?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:44.60,1:17:47.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom Ripley. - Do you know Tom Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:47.52,1:17:52.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 不认识 我当然听说过他, 不过还没见过面, 没见过
Dialogue: 1,1:17:47.52,1:17:52.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, no. I've heard about him, of course, but I didn't meet him, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:52.41,1:17:54.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不要了 不要了, 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:17:52.41,1:17:54.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Not for me. No, grazie.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:00.25,1:18:04.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,希望我没把事情搞复杂了
Dialogue: 1,1:18:00.25,1:18:04.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hope I didn't complicate matters.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:04.06,1:18:08.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,天, 没什么, 没发生过任何过分的事
Dialogue: 1,1:18:04.06,1:18:08.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God, nothing, nothing...untoward happened.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:08.63,1:18:12.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有, 没有任何事能阻止他回到你身边
Dialogue: 1,1:18:08.63,1:18:12.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, there is nothing to prevent you from welcoming him back,
Dialogue: 2,1:18:12.93,1:18:15.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,能阻止他和你结婚
Dialogue: 1,1:18:12.93,1:18:15.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,from marrying him.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:19.44,1:18:22.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,再见 我很高兴又认识了一位新朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:18:19.44,1:18:22.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good-bye. I'm happy to put a face to a name.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:23.23,1:18:25.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,再见, 彼得 别, 请别站起来
Dialogue: 1,1:18:23.23,1:18:25.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Peter. Please, don't get up.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.26,1:18:49.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在我完全不知所措了 你觉得他会回来吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.26,1:18:49.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now I don't know what to think. Do you think he's coming back?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:49.97,1:18:54.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 得更新我的档案
Dialogue: 1,1:18:49.97,1:18:54.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sorry. Sorry. Had to renew my papers.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:54.29,1:18:56.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,他们总能把只要盖一个章就能解决的事搞得很复杂
Dialogue: 1,1:18:54.29,1:18:56.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Never one stamp when they can make you line up for three.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:56.19,1:18:57.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你们等了很久吗?  - 没有
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.19,1:18:57.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Have you been waiting long? - Not at all.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.07,1:19:00.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 早上好, 汤姆  - 早上好 对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.07,1:19:00.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Morning, Tom. - Hi. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:00.86,1:19:03.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还好吗? 你看上去像撞了鬼一样
Dialogue: 1,1:19:00.86,1:19:03.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You okay? You look like you' ve seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:03.26,1:19:05.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克昨天晚上也在歌剧院
Dialogue: 1,1:19:03.26,1:19:05.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie was at the opera last night.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.66,1:19:09.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不信 呃․․․野马也不能把他拽到那儿去․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.66,1:19:09.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't believe that. Uh...Wild horses couldn't drag Dickie...
Dialogue: 2,1:19:09.94,1:19:12.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,他和其它人一起去的, 你知道
Dialogue: 1,1:19:09.94,1:19:12.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, he was there with someone, you know,
Dialogue: 2,1:19:12.41,1:19:14.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想她一定是硬拉他去的
Dialogue: 1,1:19:12.41,1:19:14.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,so I suppose she must have dragged him.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,这不公平
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:16.88,1:19:21.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想我得回蒙吉了 迪克应该是已经回家了
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.88,1:19:21.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think I'm going back to Mongi. I think Dickie's coming home.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:21.02,1:19:23.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,是吗? 我․․․那简直是太好
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.02,1:19:23.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Really? I...Well, that' s just swell.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:23.85,1:19:26.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 你知道, 你总是比我先知 太好了
Dialogue: 1,1:19:23.85,1:19:26.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, you know, you'reway ahead of me. Great.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:26.56,1:19:28.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,我听到那席话时还觉得挺感动․․․对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:19:26.56,1:19:28.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That was rather moving when I heard...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:28.92,1:19:31.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,梅瑞迪斯是我昨晚在歌剧院看到的那个美国女孩
Dialogue: 1,1:19:28.92,1:19:31.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Meredith is the American girl I saw at the opera last night.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:31.26,1:19:35.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 她了解迪克一些事  - 哦, 上帝啊
Dialogue: 1,1:19:31.26,1:19:35.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- She' s been seeing something of Dickie. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:35.73,1:19:38.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是重点在于, 迪克․․․我们都知道
Dialogue: 1,1:19:35.73,1:19:38.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But the point is, Dickie...and we all know this.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:38.78,1:19:42.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克爱玛吉 他也很想念她
Dialogue: 1,1:19:38.78,1:19:42.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie loves Marge. And he misses her.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:42.53,1:19:45.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,我有一种负疚感 玛吉并不了解
Dialogue: 1,1:19:42.53,1:19:45.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I feel guilty. Marge doesn't understand this,
Dialogue: 2,1:19:45.37,1:19:48.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是每当迪克做错了事, 我都会感觉愧疚
Dialogue: 1,1:19:45.37,1:19:48.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,but whenever Dickie does something, I feel guilty.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:48.29,1:19:51.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,好像是心有灵犀一样
Dialogue: 1,1:19:48.29,1:19:51.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,As if that makes sense.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:14.02,1:21:15.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:21:14.02,1:21:15.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:17.35,1:21:21.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克, 开门 是我
Dialogue: 1,1:21:17.35,1:21:21.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie, come on. It's me.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:22.49,1:21:25.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,费雷迪 让我进来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.49,1:21:25.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's Freddie. Let me in.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:27.45,1:21:29.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:21:27.45,1:21:29.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:34.67,1:21:37.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 费雷迪 是汤姆
Dialogue: 1,1:21:34.67,1:21:37.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hello, Freddie. It's Tom.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:38.55,1:21:41.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 迪克在哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:38.55,1:21:41.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, where's Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:41.55,1:21:43.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:21:41.55,1:21:43.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:43.55,1:21:46.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,还不错 呃, 是的, 谢谢 他出门了 他去吃晚饭了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.55,1:21:46.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm good. Uh, yes, thank you. He's gone. He went to dinner.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.74,1:21:51.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他在澳泰罗饭店 你知道澳泰罗吗?  - 不, 不, 不
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.74,1:21:51.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He's at Otello's. You know Otello's?- No, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:51.46,1:21:54.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․我不认为他会在下午𝟔:𝟑𝟎用晚餐
Dialogue: 1,1:21:51.46,1:21:54.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I don't think he's at dinner at 𝟔:𝟑𝟎 P. M.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:54.12,1:21:57.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你说他还吃午饭, 也许我会相信你
Dialogue: 1,1:21:54.12,1:21:57.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If you said he was still at lunch, maybe I'd believe you.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:57.36,1:22:00.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 难以置信
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.36,1:22:00.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know? Incredible.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:01.03,1:22:04.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,我是说, 那家伙就这么, 你知道, 就这么一下子从地球上消失了
Dialogue: 1,1:22:01.03,1:22:04.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I mean, the guy just, you know, disappeared off the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:07.02,1:22:08.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想是吧
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.02,1:22:08.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:10.06,1:22:13.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,房东, 就我所知․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:22:10.06,1:22:13.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The landlady, as far as I could tell...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:13.38,1:22:17.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,房东说他现在就在这儿
Dialogue: 1,1:22:13.38,1:22:17.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The landlady said he was here right now.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:17.72,1:22:19.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,你搜吧
Dialogue: 1,1:22:17.72,1:22:19.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Search the place.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:19.55,1:22:23.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․我只是不明白․․․不明白迪克为什么要躲着你
Dialogue: 1,1:22:19.55,1:22:23.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I just don't... I don't know why you'd imagine that Dickie would hide from you.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.23,1:22:24.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,因为他以前也躲过我
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.23,1:22:24.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Because he's been hiding from me.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:27.10,1:22:30.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 圣诞节怎么搞的?  - 圣诞节怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:27.10,1:22:30.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What happened at Christmas? - What about Christmas?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.03,1:22:35.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,他本该一起来滑雪的 我连个电报都没收到․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:22:31.03,1:22:35.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He was supposed to come skiing. I didn't get a cable...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:35.28,1:22:36.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,或是一个电话, 一张便条, 或是一个․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:22:35.28,1:22:36.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,or a call or a little note or a...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.53,1:22:41.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,老实说, 连个屁都没有
Dialogue: 1,1:22:36.53,1:22:41.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Frankly, a fart.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:41.22,1:22:43.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,他最近很沉迷于他的音乐
Dialogue: 1,1:22:41.22,1:22:43.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, he's been very involved with his music.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:43.46,1:22:47.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 我认为他的理论․․․ 是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:22:43.46,1:22:47.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, I think his theory... is...
Dialogue: 2,1:22:47.75,1:22:53.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,你先得把自己裹在茧里, 呃, 才能变成一只蝴蝶
Dialogue: 1,1:22:47.75,1:22:53.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,that you have to go into a cocoon, uh, before you can be a butterfly.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:53.13,1:22:54.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 1,1:22:53.13,1:22:54.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Which is horseshit.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.05,1:22:58.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,你听过他吹这个? 呃, 他不会
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.05,1:22:58.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You hear him play this thing?Well, he can't.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:01.39,1:23:03.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到他的?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:01.39,1:23:03.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,How did you find him?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:03.56,1:23:07.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是这么偏远的一所房子 要我给你倒杯酒吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:03.56,1:23:07.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's such an out-of-the-way apartment. Can I fixyou a drink?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:07.29,1:23:10.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 谢谢了 美国快递
Dialogue: 1,1:23:07.29,1:23:10.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, thanks. At the American Express.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:13.03,1:23:15.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 1,1:23:13.03,1:23:15.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Some kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:20.96,1:23:23.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,你住这儿吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:20.96,1:23:23.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you living here?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:23.96,1:23:28.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 不 我只在这儿逗留几天
Dialogue: 1,1:23:23.96,1:23:28.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, no. I'm staying here for a few days.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:29.76,1:23:32.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,那․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:23:29.76,1:23:32.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:32.47,1:23:36.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是台新钢琴 也许不该在这儿․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:23:32.47,1:23:36.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's a new piano. Probably shouldn't...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:40.73,1:23:43.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,也许不该․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:23:40.73,1:23:43.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Probably shouldn't...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:46.28,1:23:50.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,这地方装修过?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:46.28,1:23:50.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did this place come furnished?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:50.12,1:23:53.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,看起来完全不像迪克的风格, 呃․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:23:50.12,1:23:53.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like Dickie's, uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:23:53.37,1:23:56.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,太差劲了, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:23:53.37,1:23:56.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's really horrible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:58.04,1:24:01.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,太, 呃, 太小资了
Dialogue: 1,1:23:58.04,1:24:01.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's so, uh, bourgeois.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.06,1:24:13.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 那是一个, 呃․․․你得․․․小心点
Dialogue: 1,1:24:11.06,1:24:13.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a, uh...You should...Watch that.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:13.97,1:24:16.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,不好意思․․․让我来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:13.97,1:24:16.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Excuse...Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:16.53,1:24:18.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:16.53,1:24:18.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:21.49,1:24:26.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,事实上, 唯一一样像迪克的․․․是你
Dialogue: 1,1:24:21.49,1:24:26.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,In fact, the only thing that looks like Dickie... is you.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 不太像吧  - 嗯
Dialogue: 1,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hardly. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:30.04,1:24:32.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,你做过头发?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:30.04,1:24:32.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Have you done something to your hair?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:33.00,1:24:35.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,你想说什么, 弗雷迪?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:33.00,1:24:35.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is there something you'd like to say, Freddie?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:35.29,1:24:38.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 你想说什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:35.29,1:24:38.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - You have something you'd like to say?
Dialogue: 2,1:24:38.25,1:24:39.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想我正说着
Dialogue: 1,1:24:38.25,1:24:39.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think I'm saying it.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:41.39,1:24:44.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,有些事不对劲
Dialogue: 1,1:24:41.39,1:24:44.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Something' s going on.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:44.60,1:24:47.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,要么就是他改变了信仰
Dialogue: 1,1:24:44.60,1:24:47.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Either he's converted to Christianity,
Dialogue: 2,1:24:48.65,1:24:50.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,要么就是发生了其它什么事
Dialogue: 1,1:24:48.65,1:24:50.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,or there's something else.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:52.02,1:24:54.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 我建议你还是自己去找迪克问清楚
Dialogue: 1,1:24:52.02,1:24:54.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, I would suggest you ask Dickie that yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:54.26,1:24:57.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,澳泰罗餐馆就在街道出去的路口处
Dialogue: 1,1:24:54.26,1:24:57.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Otello's is on della Croce just off the Corso.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:57.25,1:25:00.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,就在街道出去的路口处?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:57.25,1:25:00.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is it on della Croce just off the Corso?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.75,1:25:07.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,是呀 你学得可真快, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:25:02.75,1:25:07.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sure. You're a quick study, aren' t you?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:07.08,1:25:09.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,上次你连意大利语的手肘和屁股都分不清楚
Dialogue: 1,1:25:07.08,1:25:09.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Last time you didn't know you ass from your elbow.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:09.29,1:25:11.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在你已经能为我指路了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:09.29,1:25:11.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now you're giving me directions.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:11.59,1:25:15.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,这不公平 你也许能分得清你的屁股和手肘
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.59,1:25:15.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That' s not fair. You probably do know your ass from your elbow.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:18.26,1:25:20.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们会再见面的
Dialogue: 1,1:25:18.26,1:25:20.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:32.32,1:25:35.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是迪克·格林立夫 托马斯·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,1:25:32.32,1:25:35.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No Dickie Greenleaf. Thomas Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:35.39,1:25:38.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 1,1:25:35.39,1:25:38.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Si.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:43.63,1:25:45.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:25:43.63,1:25:45.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ciao, Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:50.09,1:25:52.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克不弹钢琴
Dialogue: 1,1:25:50.09,1:25:52.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie doesn't play the piano.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:54.10,1:25:56.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米
Dialogue: 1,1:25:54.10,1:25:56.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:56.10,1:25:58.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:56.10,1:25:58.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy!
Dialogue: 2,1:25:58.10,1:26:00.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤米!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:58.10,1:26:00.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tommy!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:38.57,1:26:42.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢! 你可真逗
Dialogue: 1,1:26:38.57,1:26:42.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh! You're making me laugh.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:42.15,1:26:45.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,不 你不过是喝多了 噢 你不过是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:26:42.15,1:26:45.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No. You' re just so drunk. Oh. You' re just...
Dialogue: 2,1:26:45.96,1:26:48.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还能怎么样呢, 嗯? 你该看看我其它的朋友都醉成什么样了
Dialogue: 1,1:26:45.96,1:26:48.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What can you do, eh?You should see my other friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:48.70,1:26:51.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还能做什么呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.70,1:26:51.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What canyon do?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:51.12,1:26:54.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,是呀 根本就是一头猪
Dialogue: 1,1:26:51.12,1:26:54.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes. Such a pig.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:57.92,1:27:03.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨, 如果我这就算醉了的话, 想想他老公会怎么说
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.92,1:27:03.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hey, if I'm drunk, think what her husband's saying.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:50.61,1:27:52.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 打搅了  - 迪克 格林立夫?
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.61,1:27:52.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- La polizia. - Dickie Greenleaf?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.07,1:27:56.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是的  - 罗维利尼警探
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.07,1:27:56.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes. - Inspector Roverini.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:56.16,1:27:58.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我们能进来吗?  - 请吧
Dialogue: 1,1:27:56.16,1:27:58.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Can we come in? - Please.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:05.92,1:28:08.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,这真是令人震惊, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.92,1:28:08.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's a terrible shock, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:08.55,1:28:12.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,迈尔斯先生昨天是几点钟走的?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:08.55,1:28:12.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,W- What time did Signor Miles leave yesterday?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:12.09,1:28:16.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 嗯, 我不敢肯定 我想是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:28:12.09,1:28:16.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, um, I can't be certain exactly. I...
Dialogue: 2,1:28:16.17,1:28:17.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟖:𝟎𝟎, 𝟗:𝟎𝟎
Dialogue: 1,1:28:16.17,1:28:17.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,𝟖:𝟎𝟎, 𝟗:𝟎𝟎.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:20.98,1:28:25.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们都, 呃, 喝了太多酒
Dialogue: 1,1:28:20.98,1:28:25.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We'd both taken on, uh, far too many drinks.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:25.44,1:28:30.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过那时天已经很黑了, 天当然已经很黑了, 当我․․․当我搀他进他自己的车里
Dialogue: 1,1:28:25.44,1:28:30.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But it was dark. It was certainly dark when I... when I walked him to his car.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:30.12,1:28:33.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么他开车走了, 那么, 呃, 你做了什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:30.12,1:28:33.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So he drove away, and, uh, you did what?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:33.12,1:28:36.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,上床睡觉
Dialogue: 1,1:28:33.12,1:28:36.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I went to bed.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:37.19,1:28:42.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪很能喝, 不过我才喝了两杯就不行了
Dialogue: 1,1:28:37.19,1:28:42.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie's a big man, but I'm in trouble after a couple of drinks.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:42.14,1:28:44.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一直都很难受․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:28:42.14,1:28:44.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've been suffering all...
Dialogue: 2,1:28:44.47,1:28:46.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,谁找到他的?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:44.47,1:28:46.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Who found him?
Dialogue: 2,1:28:46.63,1:28:50.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,请你理解, 我一定得请你
Dialogue: 1,1:28:46.63,1:28:50.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You understand, I must ask you...
Dialogue: 2,1:28:50.10,1:28:51.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,留在罗马, 格林立夫先生
Dialogue: 1,1:28:50.10,1:28:51.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to stay in Rome, Signor Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:51.93,1:28:56.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,好的, 如果能有所帮助的话, 当然
Dialogue: 1,1:28:51.93,1:28:56.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, if it's gonna help, certainly.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:56.11,1:28:59.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么, 法医, 他得, 嗯․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:28:56.11,1:28:59.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So, the doctor, he has to make the, um...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:02.61,1:29:05.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 验尸  - 对, 就是这样
Dialogue: 1,1:29:02.61,1:29:05.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Postmortem. - Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:05.91,1:29:08.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是, 你看, 他的初步推论是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:29:05.91,1:29:08.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But, you know, his first conclusion...
Dialogue: 2,1:29:08.66,1:29:13.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,迈尔斯先生是昨晚𝟕∶𝟎𝟎以前被杀害的
Dialogue: 1,1:29:08.66,1:29:13.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,was that Signor Miles was killed not later than 𝟕:𝟎𝟎 yesterday evening.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:13.79,1:29:17.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 他在开车走之前当然不会已经死了
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.79,1:29:17.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, he certainly wasn't dead when he drove away in his car.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:20.30,1:29:22.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 1,1:29:20.30,1:29:22.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:46.54,1:29:49.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 1,1:29:46.54,1:29:49.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:49.13,1:29:51.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 真没事?  - 是, 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.13,1:29:51.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay? - Si, si.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:01.39,1:30:06.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是他杀的弗雷迪?  - 玛吉 你什么时候来的?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:01.39,1:30:06.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Did he kill Freddie? - Marge. When did you get here?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:06.22,1:30:08.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉我真相 是他杀的弗雷迪吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:06.22,1:30:08.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth. Did he kill Freddie?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:08.19,1:30:11.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,我发誓他没有 他当然不会这么做
Dialogue: 1,1:30:08.19,1:30:11.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd swear he didn't. Of course he didn't.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:11.90,1:30:16.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,我又来碰碰运气 等在这儿, 看着他
Dialogue: 1,1:30:11.90,1:30:16.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I tried again. Waiting here, watching for him.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:16.20,1:30:20.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,相反, 是你 每次我找迪克, 找到的都是你
Dialogue: 1,1:30:16.20,1:30:20.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Instead, it's you. Whenever I look for Dickie, I find you.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:21.71,1:30:24.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,你脸怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:21.71,1:30:24.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:24.75,1:30:26.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克․․․迪克干的
Dialogue: 1,1:30:24.75,1:30:26.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie...Dickie did it.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:26.75,1:30:29.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克?  - 我的脸 我们起了些争执
Dialogue: 1,1:30:26.75,1:30:29.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Dickie? - My face. There was an argument.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:29.29,1:30:31.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․我说了些, 我不该说的, 而我․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:30:29.29,1:30:31.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I said some things I shouldn't have said and I...
Dialogue: 2,1:30:31.84,1:30:35.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,是关于你 关于他如此恶劣地对待你, 对待我们每一个人
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.84,1:30:35.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,About you. About the appalling way he's treating you, all of us.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:35.55,1:30:37.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,接下来我就发现他只朝我冲过来
Dialogue: 1,1:30:35.55,1:30:37.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And the next thing I know, he's launched himself at me.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:37.93,1:30:40.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你上来吗?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:37.93,1:30:40.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Are you getting on? - What?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:40.10,1:30:42.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,上来 我带你去见他
Dialogue: 1,1:30:40.10,1:30:42.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Get on. I'll take you to him.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:26.78,1:31:29.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他住哪儿?  - 在前面, 我们过了几个街区
Dialogue: 1,1:31:26.78,1:31:29.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Where does he live? - We passed it a few blocks back.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:29.79,1:31:32.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,那有警察 在乔亚的宅第
Dialogue: 1,1:31:29.79,1:31:32.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's where the police were. The Palazzo Gioia.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:33.50,1:31:37.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,看, 他们甚至不知道我在罗马, 我不能牵累迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:31:33.50,1:31:37.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Look, they don't even know I'm in Rome, and I'm not gonna incriminate Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:37.54,1:31:38.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,恩, 也许我该走了
Dialogue: 1,1:31:37.54,1:31:38.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps I shouldn't go either.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:38.67,1:31:43.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,不 好吧, 你想走就走吧, 但是别对警官说看到过我
Dialogue: 1,1:31:38.67,1:31:43.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No. Well, go if you want to, but just don't talk to the police about my face.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:43.06,1:31:46.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果他们知道他打了我和他的火爆脾气, 那他就能攻击弗雷迪
Dialogue: 1,1:31:43.06,1:31:46.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If they know he hit me and his temper, then he could've hit Freddie.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:46.50,1:31:47.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,呆会见
Dialogue: 1,1:31:46.50,1:31:47.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:05.99,1:32:08.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:05.99,1:32:08.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Signor Greenleaf!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:09.04,1:32:12.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,是格林立夫先生! 快, 快!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:09.04,1:32:12.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's Signor Greenleaf!Presto, presto!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:17.09,1:32:20.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,开门!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:17.09,1:32:20.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:20.09,1:32:21.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,快开门!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:20.09,1:32:21.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:23.85,1:32:25.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我住这儿!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:23.85,1:32:25.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I live here!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:25.21,1:32:26.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:25.21,1:32:26.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf!
Dialogue: 2,1:32:28.56,1:32:30.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们能上去吗? 你不介意吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:28.56,1:32:30.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can we go up?Do you mind?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:30.86,1:32:33.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,当然 你脸怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:30.86,1:32:33.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Of course. What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:33.53,1:32:37.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我的电单车 在被摄影师追赶的时候摔的
Dialogue: 1,1:32:33.53,1:32:37.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My scooter. I fell off getting chased by photographers.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:37.20,1:32:41.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,电话, 媒体, 我觉得․․․我觉得在被追捕
Dialogue: 1,1:32:37.20,1:32:41.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The telephone, the press, I've been...I'm feeling hounded.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:41.41,1:32:43.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,你就不能别泄漏我的地址吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:41.41,1:32:43.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you think you could not give out my address?
Dialogue: 2,1:32:43.58,1:32:48.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,从未 有很多人要求, 但我们都拒绝了, 连你的未婚妻都没有告知
Dialogue: 1,1:32:43.58,1:32:48.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Never. We've had many requests, and we say no, even to your fiancée.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:48.41,1:32:49.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,我真的不想见任何人
Dialogue: 1,1:32:48.41,1:32:49.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I really don't want to see anybody.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:50.04,1:32:52.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 包括你的未婚妻?  - 包括她
Dialogue: 1,1:32:50.04,1:32:52.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Even your fiancée? - Even her.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:56.18,1:33:00.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 那汤姆·瑞普雷呢?  - 汤姆·瑞普雷怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:56.18,1:33:00.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What about Thomas Ripley? - What about Tom Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:01.39,1:33:04.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,你和瑞普雷先生一起去了圣雷默 对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:01.39,1:33:04.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You and Signor Ripley went to San Remo. Is that right?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:04.20,1:33:06.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,是的, 我们․․․我们去了圣雷默 那已经是几个月以前的事情了
Dialogue: 1,1:33:04.20,1:33:06.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, we...We went to San Remo. That was months ago.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:06.87,1:33:08.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,十一月, 我想是 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:06.87,1:33:08.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,November, I thought. Was it?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:08.90,1:33:12.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你和汤姆说过吗?  - 十一月七日我记得
Dialogue: 1,1:33:08.90,1:33:12.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Did you speak to Tom? - November 𝟕 is my information.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:12.53,1:33:15.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,我记不清确切日期了
Dialogue: 1,1:33:12.53,1:33:15.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't remember the exact date.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:16.06,1:33:19.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你上一次见到瑞普雷先生是什么时候?  - 几天前
Dialogue: 1,1:33:16.06,1:33:19.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- When did you last see Signor Ripley? - A few days ago.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:19.83,1:33:23.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他住你这儿吗?  - 没有
Dialogue: 1,1:33:19.83,1:33:23.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Does he stay with you here? - No.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:23.50,1:33:25.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 1,1:33:23.50,1:33:25.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.45,1:33:30.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,大致是这样的 两天前
Dialogue: 1,1:33:27.45,1:33:30.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Here is a pattern. Two days ago,
Dialogue: 2,1:33:30.29,1:33:34.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪·迈尔斯死了, 嗯?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:30.29,1:33:34.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie Miles is dead, hmm?
Dialogue: 2,1:33:34.52,1:33:36.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,他离开你的公寓
Dialogue: 1,1:33:34.52,1:33:36.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He leaves your apartment,
Dialogue: 2,1:33:38.06,1:33:40.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,就被谋杀了
Dialogue: 1,1:33:38.06,1:33:40.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and he's murdered.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:40.90,1:33:46.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,昨天, 一条盛满石块的小船在圣雷默被发现
Dialogue: 1,1:33:40.90,1:33:46.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yesterday, a little boat is found in San Remo full of rocks.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:46.23,1:33:50.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,船主告诉警局船是𝟏𝟏月𝟕日被盗的
Dialogue: 1,1:33:46.23,1:33:50.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And the owner tells the police it was stolen on November 𝟕.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:51.03,1:33:53.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们看了旅店纪录․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:33:51.03,1:33:53.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We look at hotel records...
Dialogue: 2,1:33:53.62,1:33:56.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们发现․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:33:53.62,1:33:56.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and we see...
Dialogue: 2,1:33:56.50,1:33:59.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克·格林立夫在圣雷默
Dialogue: 1,1:33:56.50,1:33:59.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie Greenleaf is staying in San Remo.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:59.75,1:34:03.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,船主记得是两个美国人租的船
Dialogue: 1,1:33:59.75,1:34:03.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And then our boatman remembers two Americans taking a boat.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:03.59,1:34:06.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,这不是大概 纯属巧合
Dialogue: 1,1:34:03.59,1:34:06.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That is not a pattern. That's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:06.87,1:34:08.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,在圣雷默有𝟓𝟎家旅馆
Dialogue: 1,1:34:06.87,1:34:08.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There must be 𝟓𝟎 hotels in San Remo.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:08.64,1:34:11.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,那天也许有𝟏𝟎𝟎个人租了船
Dialogue: 1,1:34:08.64,1:34:11.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There were probably a hundred people renting a boat that day.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:11.39,1:34:13.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟑𝟏人
Dialogue: 1,1:34:11.39,1:34:13.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thirty-one people.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:13.98,1:34:15.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟑𝟏人
Dialogue: 1,1:34:13.98,1:34:15.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thirty-one people.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.11,1:34:19.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,𝟑𝟏人, 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:34:17.11,1:34:19.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thirty-one, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:22.30,1:34:24.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 玛吉·舍伍德  - 这次是舍伍德小姐
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.30,1:34:24.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Marge Sherwood. - That is Miss Sherwood now.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:32.63,1:34:34.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,让她进来
Dialogue: 1,1:34:32.63,1:34:34.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Let her in.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:34.71,1:34:38.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,让她进来 这又有能怎么样? 让她进来
Dialogue: 1,1:34:34.71,1:34:38.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Let her in. What's the difference? Let her in.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:39.84,1:34:43.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,不! 事实上․․․事实上, 不
Dialogue: 1,1:34:39.84,1:34:43.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No! Actually...Actually, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.57,1:34:46.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会․․․我会很感激的․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.57,1:34:46.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I would...I would really appreciate it...
Dialogue: 2,1:34:46.26,1:34:49.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你等会再让舍伍德小姐进来的话
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.26,1:34:49.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,if you would ask Miss Sherwood to come back later.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:54.73,1:34:56.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:34:54.73,1:34:56.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:58.25,1:35:00.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我可以问一下吗
Dialogue: 1,1:34:58.25,1:35:00.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,May I ask you...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:00.24,1:35:03.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,为什么你宁可对朋友说, 却不愿对你的未婚妻说?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:00.24,1:35:03.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why would you speak to your friend and not your fiancée?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:03.95,1:35:07.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 我․․․我想我刚才已经说过了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:03.95,1:35:07.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, I...I think I just said.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:07.68,1:35:10.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 瑞普雷先生在帮我处理一些事务
Dialogue: 1,1:35:07.68,1:35:10.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, Mr. Ripley was handling some business for me.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:10.75,1:35:14.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是瑞普雷先生想嫁给我․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:35:10.75,1:35:14.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Nor does Mr. Ripley want to marry me...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:14.17,1:35:18.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,并且每日每夜缠着你, 问你什么时候结婚
Dialogue: 1,1:35:14.17,1:35:18.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and ask me every single day if I'll marry him and when.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:18.68,1:35:21.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,你有瑞普雷先生的照片吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.68,1:35:21.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Do you keep a photograph of Signor Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:21.27,1:35:24.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,我没有随身携带男性朋友照片的习惯
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.27,1:35:24.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm not in the habit of carrying around photographs of my male friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:26.43,1:35:28.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想我是让你困扰了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.43,1:35:28.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now I think I've upset you.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:28.45,1:35:31.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起 我的英语, 可能, 太差了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:28.45,1:35:31.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Sorry. My English, perhaps, is coarse.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:31.94,1:35:34.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,是有点差, 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:35:31.94,1:35:34.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It is a little coarse, yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:37.45,1:35:39.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,我道歉
Dialogue: 1,1:35:37.45,1:35:39.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:39.45,1:35:45.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是你․․․没有人在圣雷默后见到过汤姆·瑞普雷
Dialogue: 1,1:35:39.45,1:35:45.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But you...No one has seen Signor Ripley since San Remo.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:45.20,1:35:46.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我见过  - 你见过, 是啊
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.20,1:35:46.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I have. - You have, yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:46.50,1:35:49.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,舍伍德小姐也见过他 问问她 还有, 嗯
Dialogue: 1,1:35:46.50,1:35:49.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And so has Miss Sherwood. Ask her. And, um,
Dialogue: 2,1:35:49.26,1:35:54.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,让我想想他当时住在哪家旅馆․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:35:49.26,1:35:54.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,if I can remember the name of the hotel he was staying at...
Dialogue: 2,1:35:54.51,1:35:57.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯, 高多尼旅馆 汤姆住在高多尼
Dialogue: 1,1:35:54.51,1:35:57.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um, the Goldoni. Tom was staying at the Goldoni.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:57.64,1:36:01.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,高多尼 高多尼 很好, 很好, 但是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:35:57.64,1:36:01.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Goldoni. The Goldoni. Good, good, but...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:01.11,1:36:03.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,是的, 你是对的
Dialogue: 1,1:36:01.11,1:36:03.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, you are right.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:03.73,1:36:05.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是对的 纯属巧合
Dialogue: 1,1:36:03.73,1:36:05.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You are right. A coincidence.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:10.07,1:36:12.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,我期待下一次见面
Dialogue: 1,1:36:10.07,1:36:12.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I look forward to our next meeting.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:12.29,1:36:14.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯? 那时我会更注重我的英文的
Dialogue: 1,1:36:12.29,1:36:14.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hmm? When I will be more careful with my English.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:14.89,1:36:18.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃 我有证人说当时看到两个男人․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:36:14.89,1:36:18.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ah. I have a witness who thinks they saw two men...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:18.17,1:36:20.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,进了迈尔斯先生的车
Dialogue: 1,1:36:18.17,1:36:20.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,getting into Mr. Miles' car.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:20.17,1:36:24.05,Default,22,0,0,0,,她想来正面指证一下
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.17,1:36:24.05,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And she wants to identify you in a confronto.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:24.13,1:36:26.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,一组人 明天, 怎么样?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:24.13,1:36:26.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Lineup. Tomorrow, then?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:28.14,1:36:30.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 明天
Dialogue: 1,1:36:28.14,1:36:30.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Uh, tomorrow.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:37.69,1:36:39.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 早上好, 舍伍德小姐  - 早上好
Dialogue: 1,1:36:37.69,1:36:39.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Buon giorno, Miss Sherwood. - Buon giorno.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:39.69,1:36:44.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,他在里面, 不过我认为他现在真不想见任何人
Dialogue: 1,1:36:39.69,1:36:44.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's in, but I really don't think he wants to meet anybody.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:01.22,1:37:03.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.22,1:37:03.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dick?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:06.64,1:37:08.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:06.64,1:37:08.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:10.05,1:37:11.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你能听到我
Dialogue: 1,1:37:10.05,1:37:11.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:21.12,1:37:24.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想说我会数到三, 如果你不开门的话․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:37:21.12,1:37:24.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was gonna say that I would count to three, and if you didn't open the door...
Dialogue: 2,1:37:24.50,1:37:28.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,我就不会再․․․ ․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:37:24.50,1:37:28.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But I won't count anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:28.83,1:37:30.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,指望你了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:28.83,1:37:30.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,On you.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:32.88,1:37:37.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不会再指望你了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:32.88,1:37:37.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I won't count on you anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:39.85,1:37:44.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,不管你做了什么没做什么
Dialogue: 1,1:37:39.85,1:37:44.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Whatever it is you've done or haven't done,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:44.81,1:37:47.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,你已经伤透了我的心
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.81,1:37:47.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,you've broken my heart.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:49.57,1:37:52.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是我指认你的一项罪行
Dialogue: 1,1:37:49.57,1:37:52.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's one thing I know you're guilty of.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:59.58,1:38:02.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不明白是为了什么
Dialogue: 1,1:37:59.58,1:38:02.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I don't know why.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:04.50,1:38:07.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不明白是为了什么 我就是不明白是为了什么
Dialogue: 1,1:38:04.50,1:38:07.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know why. I just don't know why.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:17.77,1:38:19.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,我亲爱的汤姆
Dialogue: 1,1:38:17.77,1:38:19.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My dear Tom.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:20.06,1:38:23.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,我再也无法忍受了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.06,1:38:23.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I' m getting out of this.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:23.65,1:38:27.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,弗雷迪的死, 希尔维那的死
Dialogue: 1,1:38:23.65,1:38:27.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Freddie's death. Silvana.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:27.28,1:38:31.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,我曾经想过要去自首, 但我不能
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.28,1:38:31.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I' ve thought about going to the police, but I can' t do it.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:31.53,1:38:33.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我无法再面对这一切了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:31.53,1:38:33.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can' t face it.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:33.99,1:38:35.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,我再也无法面对这一切了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:33.99,1:38:35.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can' t face anything anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:35.66,1:38:36.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,我再也无法面对更多了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:35.66,1:38:36.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can' t face anything anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:36.83,1:38:39.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望我能将我的生命交给你
Dialogue: 1,1:38:36.83,1:38:39.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I wish I could give you the life I took for granted.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:42.67,1:38:45.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,你总是能猜透我心里在想什么, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,1:38:42.67,1:38:45.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've always understood what's at the heart of me, Tom.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:45.23,1:38:48.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉永远都不能
Dialogue: 1,1:38:45.23,1:38:48.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge never could.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:48.72,1:38:52.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想这就是为什么我给你写这封信的原因
Dialogue: 1,1:38:48.72,1:38:52.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I suppose that's why I'm writing this to you,
Dialogue: 2,1:38:52.18,1:38:54.81,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的兄弟
Dialogue: 1,1:38:52.18,1:38:54.81,Eng,22,0,0,0,,the brother I never had.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:54.89,1:38:58.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,也是我唯一真正的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:38:54.89,1:38:58.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The only true friend I ever had.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:02.99,1:39:04.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,从各方面来看
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.99,1:39:04.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,in all kinds of ways,
Dialogue: 2,1:39:04.99,1:39:09.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,你都更像是我父亲更想要的儿子
Dialogue: 1,1:39:04.99,1:39:09.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,you're much more like the son my father wanted.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:09.70,1:39:12.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道你能改变人
Dialogue: 1,1:39:09.70,1:39:12.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I realize you can change the people,
Dialogue: 2,1:39:13.00,1:39:15.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,改变风景
Dialogue: 1,1:39:13.00,1:39:15.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,change the scenery,
Dialogue: 2,1:39:15.54,1:39:18.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,但却永远改变不了自己已经腐败的内心
Dialogue: 1,1:39:15.54,1:39:18.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,but you can't change your own rotten self.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:20.55,1:39:23.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在我完全失去了方向
Dialogue: 1,1:39:20.55,1:39:23.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now I can't think what to do or where to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:25.06,1:39:29.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,我被一切不可挽回的错事所困扰
Dialogue: 1,1:39:25.06,1:39:29.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I' m haunted by everything I' ve done and can' t undo.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:31.56,1:39:33.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:39:31.56,1:39:33.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I' m sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:35.61,1:39:38.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,我把迪克·格林立夫的生活搞得一团糟, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:39:35.61,1:39:38.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've made a mess of being Dickie Greenleaf, haven't I?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:43.01,1:40:46.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:43.01,1:40:46.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:48.53,1:40:51.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,我在那儿见你!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:48.53,1:40:51.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll see you over there!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:00.21,1:41:02.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,真不好意思让你经历这些, 彼得
Dialogue: 1,1:41:00.21,1:41:02.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to put you through this, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:02.59,1:41:06.47,Default,22,0,0,0,,我只是无法在意大利语这么烂的情况下一个人去面对警方
Dialogue: 1,1:41:02.59,1:41:06.47,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I just can't face going to the police by myself when my Italian's so rotten.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:06.49,1:41:08.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,别傻了 没事的
Dialogue: 1,1:41:06.49,1:41:08.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't be so daft. It's fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:08.29,1:41:10.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很高兴你最终还是到了威尼斯
Dialogue: 1,1:41:08.29,1:41:10.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm delighted you finally made it to Venice.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:11.05,1:41:13.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很开心, 和谣言相反, 你还好好的毫发无伤
Dialogue: 1,1:41:11.05,1:41:13.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm delighted, contrary to rumor, that you're still in one piece.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:13.77,1:41:15.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么谣言?  - 哦, 你知道
Dialogue: 1,1:41:13.77,1:41:15.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What rumor? - Oh, you know.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:15.85,1:41:19.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克谋杀了你, 并冒用你的护照到处旅行
Dialogue: 1,1:41:15.85,1:41:19.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That Dickie murdered you and is traveling under your passport.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:19.29,1:41:21.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道 这是很荒谬
Dialogue: 1,1:41:19.29,1:41:21.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know. It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:36.29,1:41:38.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,欢迎来威尼斯
Dialogue: 1,1:41:36.29,1:41:38.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Welcome to Venice.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:38.29,1:41:41.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,天啊, 这地方很臭, 不是吗? 你闻到了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:38.29,1:41:41.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,God, this place reeks, doesn't it?Can you smell it?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:41.49,1:41:44.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,不管怎样, 我不能再推迟了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:41.49,1:41:44.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've got to the bottom of the delay, finally.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:44.99,1:41:47.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们在等从罗马来的警探
Dialogue: 1,1:41:44.99,1:41:47.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We're waiting for someone from Rome.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:47.99,1:41:51.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,你说什么? 他们从罗马派了人来?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:47.99,1:41:51.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What do you mean?They've sent for someone from Rome?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:51.23,1:41:54.05,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 呃, 是的 这挺好, 不是吗?  - 不, 我以为․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:41:51.23,1:41:54.05,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Well, yes. That's good, isn't it? - No, I thought...
Dialogue: 2,1:41:54.06,1:41:57.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,在意大利不是这么运作的, 我以为各地区都是独立的
Dialogue: 1,1:41:54.06,1:41:57.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,that didn't happen in Italy, that each region is separate.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:57.32,1:41:59.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,我肯定․․․我读过․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:41:57.32,1:41:59.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was sure that...I've read that...
Dialogue: 2,1:41:59.90,1:42:02.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,你也读过报纸 你知道这件事有多重大
Dialogue: 1,1:41:59.90,1:42:02.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've read the papers. You know what a big deal it's been.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:02.82,1:42:05.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 美国游客被谋杀了  - 但是, 这件事能先搁一搁吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:42:02.82,1:42:05.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- American tourist murdered. - Actually, can we not do this now?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:05.95,1:42:10.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,这臭味真是
Dialogue: 1,1:42:05.95,1:42:10.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The stench really is...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.31,1:42:32.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,他接管这个案子, 是因为他们对前一任负责人很不满
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.31,1:42:32.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's taken over the case, 'cause they're annoyed that the previous chap...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:32.25,1:42:35.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,让弗雷德谋杀案唯一的嫌疑犯迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:42:32.25,1:42:35.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,let Dickie disappear when he was, um,
Dialogue: 2,1:42:35.14,1:42:36.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,就这么失踪了
Dialogue: 1,1:42:35.14,1:42:36.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,the only suspect in Freddie' s murder.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:39.99,1:42:43.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,在罗马, 大约三周以前
Dialogue: 1,1:42:39.99,1:42:43.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,In Rome, about three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:43.33,1:42:45.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,这句我能听懂
Dialogue: 1,1:42:43.33,1:42:45.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I knew that one.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:45.33,1:42:50.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 1,1:42:45.33,1:42:50.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:42:52.51,1:42:58.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是同性恋吗? 有趣的不知所云
Dialogue: 1,1:42:52.51,1:42:58.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you a homosexual?  Interesting non sequitur.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:58.24,1:42:59.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 1,1:42:58.24,1:42:59.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:59.52,1:43:02.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 不是  - 噢
Dialogue: 1,1:42:59.52,1:43:02.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- No. - Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:02.81,1:43:07.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,顺便说一下, 嗯, 官方是没有意大利同性恋这种讲法的
Dialogue: 1,1:43:02.81,1:43:07.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,By the way, um, officially there are no Italian homosexuals.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:07.82,1:43:10.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,这让米开朗基罗和莱昂纳多很是困扰
Dialogue: 1,1:43:07.82,1:43:10.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Makes Michelangelo and Leonardo very inconvenient.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:10.32,1:43:12.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 1,1:43:10.32,1:43:12.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:12.15,1:43:15.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉他․․․我有个未婚妻
Dialogue: 1,1:43:12.15,1:43:15.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tell him...I have a fiancée.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.65,1:43:17.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克也有个未婚妻
Dialogue: 1,1:43:15.65,1:43:17.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And Dickie has a fiancée.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:17.87,1:43:21.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,至于那个弗雷迪·迈尔斯, 他没准有一打的未婚妻
Dialogue: 1,1:43:17.87,1:43:21.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And that Freddie Miles probably had a string of them.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:33.18,1:43:37.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,我的老天呀
Dialogue: 1,1:43:33.18,1:43:37.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mamma mia.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:40.65,1:43:43.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他说了什么?  - 他说"这么多未婚妻"
Dialogue: 1,1:43:40.65,1:43:43.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What did he say? - He says "so many fiancées."
Dialogue: 2,1:43:48.03,1:43:51.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,他问․․․是不是你杀了弗雷迪·迈尔斯․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.03,1:43:51.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He' s asking... if you killed Freddie Miles...
Dialogue: 2,1:43:51.48,1:43:53.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,然后又杀了迪克·格林立夫
Dialogue: 1,1:43:51.48,1:43:53.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and then killed Dickie Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:53.08,1:43:57.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,不! 没有, 我没有杀弗雷迪·迈尔斯, 更没有杀迪克·格林立夫
Dialogue: 1,1:43:53.08,1:43:57.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No! No, I did not kill Freddie Miles and then kill Dickie Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:57.32,1:44:00.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,他是在指控我吗? 问问他他是否在指控我
Dialogue: 1,1:43:57.32,1:44:00.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is he accusing me?Ask him if he's accusingme.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.34,1:44:03.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,这里的办事程序就是这样, 这总比严刑逼供好多了
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.34,1:44:03.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The way it works here, it's better to be less volatile.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:03.22,1:44:05.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,但这也太荒谬了!
Dialogue: 1,1:44:03.22,1:44:05.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But it' s absurd!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:20.90,1:44:25.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,他们在迪克罗马的寓所里发现了这个
Dialogue: 1,1:44:20.90,1:44:25.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,They found this in Dickie's place in Rome.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:25.49,1:44:28.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你打开过?  - 当然
Dialogue: 1,1:44:25.49,1:44:28.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You opened this? - Of course.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:44.35,1:44:47.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是一封遗书
Dialogue: 1,1:44:44.35,1:44:47.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's a suicide note.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:50.98,1:44:54.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,你早就看过这份遗书, 还问我这些问题?
Dialogue: 1,1:44:50.98,1:44:54.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You asked me all these questions and you already read this suicide note?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:13.22,1:45:15.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不相信那封遗书 你呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:13.22,1:45:15.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't believe that letter. Do you?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:15.30,1:45:18.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克的信 你相信吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:15.30,1:45:18.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie's letter. Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:18.97,1:45:22.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道什么该相信
Dialogue: 1,1:45:18.97,1:45:22.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know what to believe.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:22.07,1:45:26.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,那你能想象吗, 如果是他杀了弗雷迪, 那会是怎样一个情形?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:22.07,1:45:26.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can you imagine, though, if he did kill Freddie, what that must be like?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:26.31,1:45:30.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,每天早上照常醒来 我是说, 你怎么能做到?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:26.31,1:45:30.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just to wake up every morning. I mean, how can you?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:30.23,1:45:33.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,醒来像个常人一样的生活? 喝你的咖啡
Dialogue: 1,1:45:30.23,1:45:33.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just wake up and be a person?Drink your coffee.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:33.98,1:45:38.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 不管你做了什么, 不管有过可怕, 不管有多痛苦
Dialogue: 1,1:45:33.98,1:45:38.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, whatever you do, however terrible, however hurtful,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:38.24,1:45:41.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,它都是有意义的, 不是吗, 在你的头脑里
Dialogue: 1,1:45:38.24,1:45:41.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,it all makes sense, doesn't it, in your head.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:41.62,1:45:44.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,你从未遇到过自认为是坏人的人
Dialogue: 1,1:45:41.62,1:45:44.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You never meet anybody who thinks they're a bad person.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:45.48,1:45:48.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,没有, 我知道, 但是你仍然饱受煎熬 你一定会这样 你杀了人
Dialogue: 1,1:45:45.48,1:45:48.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, I know, but you're still tormented. You must be. You've killed someone.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:48.59,1:45:51.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,你不会将过去放进地下室的房间里吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:48.59,1:45:51.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Don't you just take the past and put it in a room in the basement,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:51.80,1:45:53.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,锁上门, 再也不走进去?
Dialogue: 1,1:45:51.80,1:45:53.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and lock the door and never go in there?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:53.85,1:45:57.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 那是我会做的  - 上帝啊, 是这样
Dialogue: 1,1:45:53.85,1:45:57.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- That's what I do. - God, yes.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:57.27,1:46:01.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过, 当然, 按我的情况, 可能需要一整幢楼来装我的记忆
Dialogue: 1,1:45:57.27,1:46:01.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But, of course, in my case, it's probably a whole building.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:02.98,1:46:05.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,然后你遇到一个对你而言特别的人
Dialogue: 1,1:46:02.98,1:46:05.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And then you meet someone special,
Dialogue: 2,1:46:05.11,1:46:09.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,你想做的只是扔给他们这把钥匙
Dialogue: 1,1:46:05.11,1:46:09.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and all you want to do is toss them the key.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:10.49,1:46:13.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,说"开了 进来吧"
Dialogue: 1,1:46:10.49,1:46:13.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Say "Open up. Step inside."
Dialogue: 2,1:46:15.79,1:46:18.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是你不能․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:46:15.79,1:46:18.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But you can't...
Dialogue: 2,1:46:18.08,1:46:20.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,因为里面很黑․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:46:18.08,1:46:20.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,because it's dark...
Dialogue: 2,1:46:20.92,1:46:23.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,还有恶魔
Dialogue: 1,1:46:20.92,1:46:23.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and there are demons.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:24.84,1:46:27.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,一旦有人看见里面有多肮脏․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:46:24.84,1:46:27.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And if anybody saw how ugly it is...
Dialogue: 2,1:46:32.02,1:46:34.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在是音乐在影响你的情绪
Dialogue: 1,1:46:32.02,1:46:34.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now that's the music talking.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:36.31,1:46:39.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果你是在弹"站起来, 布朗妈妈" 想忧郁也难了
Dialogue: 1,1:46:36.31,1:46:39.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's harder to be bleak if you're playing "Knees Up, Mother Brown."
Dialogue: 2,1:46:45.36,1:46:48.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一直都想․․․ ․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:46:45.36,1:46:48.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I keep wanting to do that.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:48.33,1:46:52.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,冲开门․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:46:48.33,1:46:52.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Fling...the door open.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:54.67,1:46:58.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,让阳光洒进来, 把一切都清洗干净
Dialogue: 1,1:46:54.67,1:46:58.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just let the light in, clean everything out.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:00.72,1:47:04.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果我有一块巨大的橡皮, 能擦除一切
Dialogue: 1,1:47:00.72,1:47:04.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If I could take a giant eraser and rub out everything,
Dialogue: 2,1:47:04.80,1:47:07.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,从我自己开始․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.80,1:47:07.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,starting with myself...
Dialogue: 2,1:47:10.31,1:47:13.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,问题在于, 彼得, 如果․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:47:10.31,1:47:13.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The thing is, Peter, if...
Dialogue: 2,1:47:16.07,1:47:19.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 嗯?  - 如果․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:47:16.07,1:47:19.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Hmm? - If...
Dialogue: 2,1:47:21.53,1:47:23.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:47:21.53,1:47:23.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 2,1:47:30.54,1:47:32.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果没有钥匙, 对吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:30.54,1:47:32.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No key, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:48:17.31,1:48:19.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 玛吉  - 彼得
Dialogue: 1,1:48:17.31,1:48:19.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Marge. - Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:21.77,1:48:23.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你  - 你好, 玛吉
Dialogue: 1,1:48:21.77,1:48:23.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- So good to see you. - Hello, Marge.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:23.77,1:48:25.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆
Dialogue: 1,1:48:23.77,1:48:25.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:26.07,1:48:30.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我发现你找到了彼得  - 我想是我们彼此找到了对方
Dialogue: 1,1:48:26.07,1:48:30.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I see you found Peter. - I think we sort of found each other.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:30.20,1:48:33.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 迪克的父亲在哪儿?  - 他今天早上才能到
Dialogue: 1,1:48:30.20,1:48:33.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Where's Dickie's father? - He's not coming till the morning.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:33.99,1:48:37.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,他的胃 我觉得这儿的食物不适合他
Dialogue: 1,1:48:33.99,1:48:37.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Evidently his stomach. I don't think the food here is agreeing with him.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:37.62,1:48:39.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 我很期待见到他
Dialogue: 1,1:48:37.62,1:48:39.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I was looking forward to seeing him.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:39.63,1:48:42.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克没有自杀 我确信
Dialogue: 1,1:48:39.63,1:48:42.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie hasn't killed himself. I'm sure of that.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:42.34,1:48:44.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在有一位私人侦探正着手调查此案
Dialogue: 1,1:48:42.34,1:48:44.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's a private detective on the case now.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:45.05,1:48:47.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,麦卡伦先生, 迪克的父亲雇来的
Dialogue: 1,1:48:45.05,1:48:47.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,A Mr. MacCarron Dickie's father's employed.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:47.63,1:48:50.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这太好了  - 他是个美国人
Dialogue: 1,1:48:47.63,1:48:50.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- That's a terrific idea. - He's American.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:51.05,1:48:54.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,他已经查出迪克在失踪前一天․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:48:51.05,1:48:54.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's already discovered that Dickie cashed checks for ＄𝟏 ,𝟎𝟎𝟎․․․
Dialogue: 2,1:48:54.39,1:48:56.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,刚取了𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟎美元
Dialogue: 1,1:48:54.39,1:48:56.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,the day before he disappeared.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:56.73,1:48:58.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 1,1:48:56.73,1:48:58.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Signora.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:58.73,1:49:02.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,你在跳进台伯河前会这样做吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:48:58.73,1:49:02.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Is that what you do before you jump into the Tiber?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:02.23,1:49:04.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不这么认为
Dialogue: 1,1:49:02.23,1:49:04.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don' t think so.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:08.66,1:49:10.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这是你的?  - 不, 这是汤姆的
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.66,1:49:10.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is this you? - No, it's Tom's.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:10.95,1:49:12.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,很不错, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:10.95,1:49:12.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Splendid, eh?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:12.96,1:49:16.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,天啊 谁付的房租?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:12.96,1:49:16.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Golly. Who's paying for this?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:16.33,1:49:18.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得替我找的
Dialogue: 1,1:49:16.33,1:49:18.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Peter found it for me.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:18.38,1:49:23.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,我能付的起是因为这里又潮湿․․․又破旧
Dialogue: 1,1:49:18.38,1:49:23.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can afford it because it's damp and... falling down.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:23.34,1:49:26.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆改造过这房子  - 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,1:49:23.34,1:49:26.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom's transformed it. - This is spectacular.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:26.60,1:49:28.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,这就是为什么汤姆希望你能住下来
Dialogue: 1,1:49:26.60,1:49:28.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's why Tom wanted you to stay.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:28.93,1:49:31.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,这总比挤在我的小屋里好
Dialogue: 1,1:49:28.93,1:49:31.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's better than trying to squeeze into my room.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:31.60,1:49:33.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道你讨厌旅馆
Dialogue: 1,1:49:31.60,1:49:33.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I know how you hate hotels.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.77,1:49:35.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,旅馆就可以了
Dialogue: 1,1:49:33.77,1:49:35.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,A hotel would have been fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:39.24,1:49:43.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们得告诉格林立夫先生 他的佣金已经用到哪儿了
Dialogue: 1,1:49:39.24,1:49:43.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We'll have to tell Mr. Greenleaf how far his dollar stretched.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:47.16,1:49:50.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,什么这么可笑?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:47.16,1:49:50.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What's funny?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:50.25,1:49:53.79,Default,22,0,0,0,,我只是想起汤姆第一次来蒙吉
Dialogue: 1,1:49:50.25,1:49:53.79,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about when Tom first came to Mongibello.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:55.84,1:49:59.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 再看看你现在  - 看我什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:49:55.84,1:49:59.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- And look at you now. - Look at me what?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:00.55,1:50:02.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,贵族出生
Dialogue: 1,1:50:00.55,1:50:02.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,To the manor born.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:16.70,1:50:18.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:16.70,1:50:18.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:22.79,1:50:24.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:22.79,1:50:24.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:24.79,1:50:29.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆 你好吗? 你看起来真不错
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.79,1:50:29.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom. How are you?You look well.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:29.29,1:50:31.92,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你, 先生, 我还不错  - 和在纽约时判若两人啊
Dialogue: 1,1:50:29.29,1:50:31.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Thank you, sir. I am well. - Far cry from New York.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:31.92,1:50:33.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 玛吉
Dialogue: 1,1:50:31.92,1:50:33.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes, it is. - Marge.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:34.05,1:50:37.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,早上好 不寻常的天气
Dialogue: 1,1:50:34.05,1:50:37.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good morning. Unusual weather.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:37.18,1:50:40.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是呀  - 你呢, 先生 好点了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:37.18,1:50:40.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Very. - And you, sir. Any better?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:40.10,1:50:43.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,很好 用热水捂着
Dialogue: 1,1:50:40.10,1:50:43.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Pretty good. Sticking with hot water.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:43.31,1:50:45.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 麦卡隆先生呢?  - 在圣雷默
Dialogue: 1,1:50:43.31,1:50:45.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Where's Mr. MacCarron?- San Remo.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:45.69,1:50:48.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,警察都是业余的
Dialogue: 1,1:50:45.69,1:50:48.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The police are amateurs.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:48.64,1:50:53.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 我的孩子, 不错的转变, 不是吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:48.64,1:50:53.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, my boy, it's come to a pretty pass, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:53.11,1:50:56.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,侦探在圣雷默找什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:53.11,1:50:56.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What is the detective hoping to find in San Remo?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:56.49,1:51:01.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,他在进行地毯式的搜索 我正在了解我的儿子, 汤姆
Dialogue: 1,1:50:56.49,1:51:01.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's being thorough. I'm learning about my son, Tom.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:01.29,1:51:04.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在他失踪了, 我了解到很多关于他的事
Dialogue: 1,1:51:01.29,1:51:04.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now he's missing, I'm learning a great deal about him,
Dialogue: 2,1:51:04.80,1:51:07.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望你能帮我填上一些空白
Dialogue: 1,1:51:04.80,1:51:07.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and I hope that you can fill in some more blanks for me.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:07.97,1:51:11.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉已经将蒙吉那部分填得差不多了
Dialogue: 1,1:51:07.97,1:51:11.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge has been good enough to do that about Mongibello.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:11.09,1:51:14.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会尽最大努力的, 先生 很明显, 我会为迪克做一切事情
Dialogue: 1,1:51:11.09,1:51:14.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll try my best, sir. Obviously, I'll do anything to help Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:14.97,1:51:18.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,很好 这个理论
Dialogue: 1,1:51:14.97,1:51:18.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good. This theory,
Dialogue: 2,1:51:18.33,1:51:19.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,他留给你的那封信
Dialogue: 1,1:51:18.33,1:51:19.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,the letter he left for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:19.73,1:51:22.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,警察认为这清楚地指出了․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:51:19.73,1:51:22.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The police think that's a clear indication...
Dialogue: 2,1:51:23.07,1:51:26.82,Default,22,0,0,0,,他打算对自己, 呃, 做些事情
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.07,1:51:26.82,Eng,22,0,0,0,,he was planning on doing something, uh, to himself.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:26.86,1:51:29.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不相信
Dialogue: 1,1:51:26.86,1:51:29.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I just don't believe that.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:29.74,1:51:32.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,亲爱的, 你只是不愿去相信
Dialogue: 1,1:51:29.74,1:51:32.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You don't want to, dear.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:35.04,1:51:37.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,我想和汤姆单独谈谈
Dialogue: 1,1:51:35.04,1:51:37.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to Tom alone.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:37.78,1:51:40.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,也许就这个下午 你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 1,1:51:37.78,1:51:40.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Perhaps this afternoon. Would you mind?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:42.84,1:51:46.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 一个男人对他的爱人所说的․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:51:42.84,1:51:46.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, what a man may say to his sweetheart...
Dialogue: 2,1:51:46.93,1:51:50.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,和对他的朋友所说的❪是不一样的❫․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:51:46.93,1:51:50.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and what he'll admit to another fellow...
Dialogue: 2,1:51:52.39,1:51:55.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,比如说?
Dialogue: 1,1:51:52.39,1:51:55.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Such as?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:59.82,1:52:02.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,真是在浪费生命和机遇
Dialogue: 1,1:51:59.82,1:52:02.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What a waste of lives and opportunities.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:02.56,1:52:05.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,我宁可付𝟏𝟎𝟎美元给那个萨克斯手让他闭嘴!
Dialogue: 1,1:52:02.56,1:52:05.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'd pay that fellow a hundred dollars right now to shut up!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:13.03,1:52:16.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 玛吉连一半都不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:52:13.03,1:52:16.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, Marge doesn't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:16.92,1:52:20.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,还有他的护照照片
Dialogue: 1,1:52:16.92,1:52:20.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And his passport photo.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:20.26,1:52:23.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,你听说了吗? 把他自己的脸划成那个样子?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:20.26,1:52:23.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Did you hear? To scratch out his own face like that?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:23.46,1:52:25.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能想象吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:23.46,1:52:25.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:25.39,1:52:28.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,他一定要这样钻牛角尖吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:25.39,1:52:28.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Frame of mind you'd have to be in?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:28.81,1:52:32.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,"我想过要去自首, 但是我不能
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.81,1:52:32.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"I've thought about going to the police, but I can't face it.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.19,1:52:35.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,我再也忍受不了了"
Dialogue: 1,1:52:32.19,1:52:35.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can't face anything anymore."
Dialogue: 2,1:52:35.78,1:52:39.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,我觉得愧疚 我觉得是我把他推开了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:35.78,1:52:39.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I feel guilty. I feel like I pushed him away.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:39.20,1:52:41.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,我觉得每当我开口劝阻, 他听到的都是你的声音
Dialogue: 1,1:52:39.20,1:52:41.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I feel like I spoke and he heard you.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:41.33,1:52:44.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 1,1:52:41.33,1:52:44.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 2,1:52:44.20,1:52:47.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,与其说是我们把他推开了, 还不如说是他把我们都推开了吧?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:44.20,1:52:47.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,if we all pushed him away, what about him pushing us away?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.21,1:52:49.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,你曾经是我儿子最好的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:52:47.21,1:52:49.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You've been a great friend to my son.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:49.62,1:52:52.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,每件事都是别人的错
Dialogue: 1,1:52:49.62,1:52:52.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Everything is someone else's fault.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:52.76,1:52:55.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们都想让他放任自流
Dialogue: 1,1:52:52.76,1:52:55.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We all want to sow wild oats,
Dialogue: 2,1:52:55.30,1:52:58.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是总有人得․․․得․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:52:55.30,1:52:58.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,but somebody's got to...got to...
Dialogue: 2,1:52:58.68,1:53:01.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,怎么说来着?
Dialogue: 1,1:52:58.68,1:53:01.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What is the word?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:01.81,1:53:04.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 当有人和他对峙的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:53:01.81,1:53:04.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, the moment someone confronts him,
Dialogue: 2,1:53:06.15,1:53:08.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,他总是痛殴对方
Dialogue: 1,1:53:06.15,1:53:08.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,he lashes out.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:08.73,1:53:11.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,他总是这样
Dialogue: 1,1:53:08.73,1:53:11.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He always has.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:11.36,1:53:16.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 人们总是说你不能选择你的父母
Dialogue: 1,1:53:11.36,1:53:16.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, people always say that you can't choose your parents,
Dialogue: 2,1:53:20.00,1:53:23.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,但是你也不能选择你的孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:53:20.00,1:53:23.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,but you can't choose your children.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:23.83,1:53:27.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克
Dialogue: 1,1:53:23.83,1:53:27.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:27.52,1:53:31.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,你就像个吸血水蛭 你很令人厌烦
Dialogue: 1,1:53:27.52,1:53:31.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You can be a leech. You can be quite boring.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:31.38,1:53:33.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 住手!  - 令人厌烦
Dialogue: 1,1:53:31.38,1:53:33.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Stop it! - It's boring.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:37.18,1:53:40.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,住手, 住手, 住手!
Dialogue: 1,1:53:37.18,1:53:40.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:41.02,1:53:42.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 住手, 住手, 住手!  - 汤米, 汤米
Dialogue: 1,1:53:41.02,1:53:42.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Stop, stop, stop! - Tommy, Tommy.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:43.02,1:53:44.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,像个小姑娘
Dialogue: 1,1:53:43.02,1:53:44.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Like a little girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:45.03,1:53:48.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,像个小姑娘
Dialogue: 1,1:53:45.03,1:53:48.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Like a little girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:51.74,1:53:53.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.74,1:53:53.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:53.79,1:53:56.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 我睡着了  - 总算开了
Dialogue: 1,1:53:53.79,1:53:56.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Sorry. I was asleep. - Finally.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:57.01,1:53:58.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我一定是睡着了  - 迪克的爸爸走了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:57.01,1:53:58.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I must have fallen asleep. - Did Dickie's dad go?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:58.42,1:54:00.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,你看起来气色很差, 汤姆 是发噩梦了吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:53:58.42,1:54:00.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You look ghastly, Tom. Did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:00.42,1:54:03.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 他时差还没调过来  - 噢, 可怜的老人
Dialogue: 1,1:54:00.42,1:54:03.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He's having an early night. - Oh, poor man.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:03.72,1:54:06.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 我们会无休无止地敲下去
Dialogue: 1,1:54:03.72,1:54:06.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, we were banging on that door forever.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:09.76,1:54:11.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢․․․ 不
Dialogue: 1,1:54:09.76,1:54:11.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:11.77,1:54:15.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我想我弄断了一根吊带  - 别介意
Dialogue: 1,1:54:11.77,1:54:15.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I think I've broken a strap. - Not guilty.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:15.44,1:54:18.40,Default,22,0,0,0,,我来弄点喝的
Dialogue: 1,1:54:15.44,1:54:18.40,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll fix some drinks.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:18.40,1:54:21.11,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢! 这就是在威尼斯步行
Dialogue: 1,1:54:18.40,1:54:21.11,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ah!You walk in Venice.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:22.65,1:54:24.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:22.65,1:54:24.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:26.07,1:54:27.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 1,1:54:26.07,1:54:27.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:27.99,1:54:33.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你想让我留下吗?  - 不用了, 没关系
Dialogue: 1,1:54:27.99,1:54:33.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Did you want me to stick around? - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:34.21,1:54:36.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会回来的
Dialogue: 1,1:54:34.21,1:54:36.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I could come back.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:51.73,1:54:53.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,你的钥匙
Dialogue: 1,1:54:51.73,1:54:53.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Your key.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:57.57,1:55:00.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆?
Dialogue: 1,1:54:57.57,1:55:00.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:00.32,1:55:03.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 我在洗澡 不需要太久的
Dialogue: 1,1:55:00.32,1:55:03.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, I'm in the bath. I won't be long.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:03.91,1:55:06.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆, 我必须同你谈谈 非常紧急
Dialogue: 1,1:55:03.91,1:55:06.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom, I have to speak to you. It' s urgent.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:09.38,1:55:11.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 1,1:55:09.38,1:55:11.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:22.81,1:55:26.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我找到了迪克的戒指  - 什么?
Dialogue: 1,1:55:22.81,1:55:26.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I found Dickie's rings. - What?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:26.18,1:55:28.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,你拿了迪克的戒指
Dialogue: 1,1:55:26.18,1:55:28.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You have Dickie's rings.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:32.98,1:55:34.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,这点我可以解释
Dialogue: 1,1:55:32.98,1:55:34.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can explain.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:34.98,1:55:38.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克向我保证过他决不会摘掉这个戒指
Dialogue: 1,1:55:34.98,1:55:38.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie promised me he would never take off this ring.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:38.74,1:55:40.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,先让我穿上点衣服再来讨论此事
Dialogue: 1,1:55:38.74,1:55:40.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Let me put some clothes on and we'll talk about this.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:40.87,1:55:43.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我必须告诉格林立夫先生  - 玛吉, 你太过敏了
Dialogue: 1,1:55:40.87,1:55:43.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- I have to tell Mr. Greenleaf. - Marge, you're being hysterical.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:43.39,1:55:47.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,他向我保证过, "我发誓, 我绝不会摘掉这个戒指直到我们结․․․"
Dialogue: 1,1:55:43.39,1:55:47.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He promised me, "I swear, I will never take off this ring until we get..."
Dialogue: 2,1:55:47.90,1:55:48.83,Default,22,0,0,0,,闭嘴!
Dialogue: 1,1:55:47.90,1:55:48.83,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Shut up!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:51.04,1:55:55.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,我湿透了, 玛吉 我的毛巾也掉了
Dialogue: 1,1:55:51.04,1:55:55.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm wet, Marge. I've lost my towel.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:55.19,1:55:57.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,我真的得穿上些衣服
Dialogue: 1,1:55:55.19,1:55:57.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I' d really like to put some clothes on.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:57.77,1:55:59.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,去给我们俩倒杯酒好吗
Dialogue: 1,1:55:57.77,1:55:59.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Go and pour us both a drink.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:03.10,1:56:05.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,倒杯酒
Dialogue: 1,1:56:03.10,1:56:05.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Pour us a drink.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:38.38,1:56:40.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:38.38,1:56:40.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:40.80,1:56:43.05,Default,22,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿?
Dialogue: 1,1:56:40.80,1:56:43.05,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:43.14,1:56:46.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,我没有乱翻 我只是․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:56:43.14,1:56:46.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I wasn't snooping. I just...
Dialogue: 2,1:56:46.68,1:56:50.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我只是想找针线缝一下我的文胸
Dialogue: 1,1:56:46.68,1:56:50.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was looking for a needle and thread to mend my bra.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.60,1:56:55.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,你在用的这瓶香水
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.60,1:56:55.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That scent you're wearing.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:55.27,1:56:58.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,是我买的
Dialogue: 1,1:56:55.27,1:56:58.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I bought that for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:58.57,1:57:01.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,关于迪克的一些事․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:56:58.57,1:57:01.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The thing about Dickie...
Dialogue: 2,1:57:01.24,1:57:03.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,很多事
Dialogue: 1,1:57:01.24,1:57:03.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So many things.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:05.07,1:57:09.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,那天他从罗马回来晚了
Dialogue: 1,1:57:05.07,1:57:09.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That day when he was late coming back from Rome,
Dialogue: 2,1:57:09.45,1:57:10.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,我曾经尝试着告诉你
Dialogue: 1,1:57:09.45,1:57:10.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you this.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:10.75,1:57:15.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,他是和其它女孩好上了 我并不是指梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,1:57:10.75,1:57:15.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He was with another girl. I'm not talking about Meredith, either.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:15.29,1:57:17.55,Default,22,0,0,0,,另一个在酒吧里认识的女孩
Dialogue: 1,1:57:15.29,1:57:17.55,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Another girl that we met in a bar.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:17.59,1:57:20.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,他连五分钟的忠诚都保证不了
Dialogue: 1,1:57:17.59,1:57:20.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He couldn't be faithful for five minutes.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:20.76,1:57:23.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以当他作其它一些保证的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:57:20.76,1:57:23.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So when he makes a promise,
Dialogue: 2,1:57:23.54,1:57:25.59,Default,22,0,0,0,,并不像你我许诺一样․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:57:23.54,1:57:25.59,Eng,22,0,0,0,,it doesn't mean what it means when you make a promise...𝟏𝟔𝟔𝟑
Dialogue: 2,1:57:25.62,1:57:27.56,Default,22,0,0,0,,会信守到底
Dialogue: 1,1:57:25.62,1:57:27.56,Eng,22,0,0,0,,or I make a promise.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:27.60,1:57:32.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,他有那么多的现实, 迪克, 而他又全部相信
Dialogue: 1,1:57:27.60,1:57:32.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He has so many realities, Dickie, and he believes them all.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:32.68,1:57:35.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,他撒谎 他撒谎
Dialogue: 1,1:57:32.68,1:57:35.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He lies. He lies.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:35.34,1:57:39.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,那还只是一半的情况, 有时他甚至意识不到他在背叛誓言
Dialogue: 1,1:57:35.34,1:57:39.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And that's his...Half the time he doesn't even realize he's doing it.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:39.54,1:57:42.74,Default,22,0,0,0,,而今天
Dialogue: 1,1:57:39.54,1:57:42.74,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And today,
Dialogue: 2,1:57:42.78,1:57:46.57,Default,22,0,0,0,,我开始怀疑是否是他谋杀了弗雷迪
Dialogue: 1,1:57:42.78,1:57:46.57,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I really started wondering whether he may have killed Freddie.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:46.66,1:57:51.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果有人站出来和他对抗, 他会变得如此疯狂
Dialogue: 1,1:57:46.66,1:57:51.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He would get so crazy if anybody would contradict him.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:51.36,1:57:54.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,是这样, 你知道这一点 你知道这一点
Dialogue: 1,1:57:51.36,1:57:54.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, you know that. You know that.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:54.12,1:57:55.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道这一点
Dialogue: 1,1:57:54.12,1:57:55.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:55.79,1:57:58.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,这就是讽刺的地方, 玛吉
Dialogue: 1,1:57:55.79,1:57:58.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And that's the irony, Marge.
Dialogue: 2,1:57:58.13,1:58:00.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 1,1:57:58.13,1:58:00.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I loved you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:00.13,1:58:03.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,你也许已经知道, 玛吉 我爱你
Dialogue: 1,1:58:00.13,1:58:03.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You may as well know, Marge. I loved you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:03.20,1:58:05.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道这时候说这个会很怪异
Dialogue: 1,1:58:03.20,1:58:05.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know, maybe it's grotesque of me to say this now,
Dialogue: 2,1:58:05.83,1:58:09.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以․․․就请在一张纸或别的什么东西上․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:58:05.83,1:58:09.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,so just... write it on apiece of paper or something...
Dialogue: 2,1:58:09.19,1:58:11.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,写上"汤姆爱我, 汤姆爱我"
Dialogue: 1,1:58:09.19,1:58:11.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and put it in your purse for a rainy day.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:11.19,1:58:14.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,放到你的钱包里, 将来也许可以作为慰籍
Dialogue: 1,1:58:11.19,1:58:14.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"Tom loves me. Tom loves me."
Dialogue: 2,1:58:14.69,1:58:18.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你为什么会有迪克的戒指  - 我告诉过你
Dialogue: 1,1:58:14.69,1:58:18.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Why do you have Dickie's rings? - I told you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:18.15,1:58:21.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是他给我的  - 为什么? 什么时候?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:18.15,1:58:21.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- He gave them to me. - Why? When?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:21.24,1:58:24.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我觉得你刚才完全没有在听我对你说的话
Dialogue: 1,1:58:21.24,1:58:24.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I feel as if you haven't been listening to anything I've been saying to you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:24.30,1:58:27.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不相信你 我不相信你
Dialogue: 1,1:58:24.30,1:58:27.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't believe you. I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:27.42,1:58:30.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 这都是真的  - 你说的话․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:58:27.42,1:58:30.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- It's all true. - I don't believe...
Dialogue: 2,1:58:30.16,1:58:33.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,我一个字也不相信
Dialogue: 1,1:58:30.16,1:58:33.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,a single word you've said.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:33.62,1:58:37.33,Default,22,0,0,0,,你在发抖, 玛吉 看看你
Dialogue: 1,1:58:33.62,1:58:37.33,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're shivering, Marge. Look at you.
Dialogue: 2,1:58:37.42,1:58:40.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 我能抱着你吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:37.42,1:58:40.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, can I hold you?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:40.30,1:58:42.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,你能让我抱着你吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:40.30,1:58:42.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Will you let me hold you?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:42.34,1:58:45.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:42.34,1:58:45.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:45.41,1:58:48.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 彼得! 感谢上天你来了  - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:45.41,1:58:48.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Peter! Thank God you're here. - What' s going on?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:48.34,1:58:51.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,带我走 带我走 求求你了!
Dialogue: 1,1:58:48.34,1:58:51.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Get me out of here. Get me out of here. Please!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:52.06,1:58:55.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆, 你还好吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:58:52.06,1:58:55.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom, are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:58:55.94,1:59:00.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,你试试 你试着劝劝她
Dialogue: 1,1:58:55.94,1:59:00.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You try. You try talking to her.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:01.15,1:59:03.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆?  - 我放弃
Dialogue: 1,1:59:01.15,1:59:03.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom? - I give up.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:03.22,1:59:05.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉我到底发生了什么 汤姆!
Dialogue: 1,1:59:03.22,1:59:05.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on. Tom!
Dialogue: 2,1:59:05.99,1:59:08.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 我从未对她做过什么, 我对她做过什么吗?  - 听着․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:59:05.99,1:59:08.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What did I ever do to her? - Listen...
Dialogue: 2,1:59:08.43,1:59:10.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,她能说出一件我曾经伤害过她的事吗?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:08.43,1:59:10.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Have her tell you one thing that I've ever done to her.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:10.74,1:59:13.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,听着, 你不能同她怄气
Dialogue: 1,1:59:10.74,1:59:13.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You can't be angry with her.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:13.50,1:59:17.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,她很迷惑, 她需要一个迁怒的对象
Dialogue: 1,1:59:13.50,1:59:17.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She's confused, and she needs someone to blame.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:17.29,1:59:18.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以她迁怒于你
Dialogue: 1,1:59:17.29,1:59:18.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So she blames you.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:18.50,1:59:21.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会回去和她好好谈谈
Dialogue: 1,1:59:18.50,1:59:21.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'll go back home and talk to her.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:21.33,1:59:23.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,至于你
Dialogue: 1,1:59:21.33,1:59:23.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,As for you,
Dialogue: 2,1:59:23.71,1:59:27.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,要么换个安全剃刀, 要么就留胡子吧
Dialogue: 1,1:59:23.71,1:59:27.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,either get a safety razor or grow a beard.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:39.35,1:59:43.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 格林立夫先生在吗?- 瑞普雷先生?
Dialogue: 1,1:59:39.35,1:59:43.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Is Mr. Greenleaf here? - Mr. Ripley?
Dialogue: 2,1:59:43.41,1:59:46.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 是我  - 我是阿尔文·麦克隆
Dialogue: 1,1:59:43.41,1:59:46.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Yes. - I'm Alvin MacCarron.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:47.99,1:59:51.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道, 我不知道 我就知道是这样
Dialogue: 1,1:59:47.99,1:59:51.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know, I don't know. I just know it.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:51.47,1:59:55.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 这只是女性的直觉, 然而事实․․․ ․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:59:51.47,1:59:55.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, there's female intuition and then there are facts.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:57.15,1:59:58.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 汤姆  - 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:59:57.15,1:59:58.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Tom. - Sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:58.47,2:00:01.96,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 你该等一等的 我没有․․․
Dialogue: 1,1:59:58.47,2:00:01.96,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, you should have waited. I didn't...
Dialogue: 2,2:00:02.04,2:00:04.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得没有告诉你我会顺道去接你吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:00:02.04,2:00:04.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Didn't Peter say I'd come by and pick you up?
Dialogue: 2,2:00:05.54,2:00:08.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉在对我们说戒指的事情
Dialogue: 1,2:00:05.54,2:00:08.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge has been telling us about the rings.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:08.18,2:00:11.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,是啊, 我也觉得很荒谬, 我昨天并没有提起
Dialogue: 1,2:00:08.18,2:00:11.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yes, I feel ridiculous I didn't mention them yesterday.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:11.09,2:00:13.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,我完全忘了 太荒谬了
Dialogue: 1,2:00:11.09,2:00:13.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I clean forgot. Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:15.40,2:00:20.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,也许只有一个理由能解释为什么你没有告诉我们
Dialogue: 1,2:00:15.40,2:00:20.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Perhaps you didn't mention them because there's only one conclusion to be drawn.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:21.48,2:00:25.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,我带玛吉去散散步 汤姆, 麦克隆先生需要和你谈谈
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.48,2:00:25.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm going to take Marge for a walk. Tom, Mr. MacCarron needs to talk to you.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:25.72,2:00:28.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,没必要吧 我们可以一起去酒吧, 没这个必要
Dialogue: 1,2:00:25.72,2:00:28.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There's no need. We could go to the bar. There's no need.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:28.01,2:00:29.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 不
Dialogue: 1,2:00:28.01,2:00:29.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:30.16,2:00:32.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,我认为你应该呆在这里
Dialogue: 1,2:00:30.16,2:00:32.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I think you should stay here.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:53.51,2:00:56.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,我能从这儿看到我的房间
Dialogue: 1,2:00:53.51,2:00:56.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I could probably see my room from here.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:56.09,2:00:59.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,我能看到我的房子
Dialogue: 1,2:00:56.09,2:00:59.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I can see my house.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:00.02,2:01:04.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,当你从远方眺望你的家时, 感觉就像是在做梦, 是不是?
Dialogue: 1,2:01:00.02,2:01:04.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,When you see where you live from a distance, it's like a dream, isn't it?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:04.23,2:01:06.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,我没时间瞎扯
Dialogue: 1,2:01:04.23,2:01:06.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't care for B. S.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:06.57,2:01:10.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不想听 也不想说
Dialogue: 1,2:01:06.57,2:01:10.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't care to hear it. I don't care to speak it.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:12.40,2:01:15.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 你知道在普林斯顿的时候․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:01:12.40,2:01:15.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Did you know that at Princeton...
Dialogue: 2,2:01:15.34,2:01:17.08,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克·格林立夫差点打死了一个男孩?
Dialogue: 1,2:01:15.34,2:01:17.08,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie Greenleaf half-killed a boy?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:17.16,2:01:19.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,在一个聚会上为了些女孩争风吃醋
Dialogue: 1,2:01:17.16,2:01:19.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,At a party over some girl.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:19.25,2:01:23.12,Default,22,0,0,0,,踹了那男孩的头好几脚, 把他送进了医院
Dialogue: 1,2:01:19.25,2:01:23.12,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Kicked the kid several times in the head, put him in the hospital.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:23.21,2:01:27.15,Default,22,0,0,0,,男孩的下巴得用铁丝固定, 丧失了部分听力
Dialogue: 1,2:01:23.21,2:01:27.15,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Boy had a wire fixed in his jaw, lost some hearing.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:27.19,2:01:31.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,你以为为什么迪克的父亲最初要把他送到欧洲来?
Dialogue: 1,2:01:27.19,2:01:31.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why do you think Dickie's father sent him to Europe in the first place?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:33.09,2:01:37.31,Default,22,0,0,0,,罗马警局没想到来问格林立夫先生
Dialogue: 1,2:01:33.09,2:01:37.31,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The Rome police didn't think to ask Mr. Greenleaf.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:37.39,2:01:41.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,也没想过要去查查汤姆斯·瑞普雷是否真的․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:01:37.39,2:01:41.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Nor did they think to check on whether a Thomas Ripley...
Dialogue: 2,2:01:41.39,2:01:43.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,曾经在普林斯顿上学
Dialogue: 1,2:01:41.39,2:01:43.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,had ever been a student at Princeton University.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:43.69,2:01:48.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 我发现汤姆·瑞普雷․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:01:43.69,2:01:48.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, I turned up a Tom Ripley...
Dialogue: 2,2:01:48.40,2:01:53.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,原来只是音乐系的一个钢琴调音师
Dialogue: 1,2:01:48.40,2:01:53.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,who had been a piano tuner in the music department.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:54.57,2:01:56.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,你看, 在美国
Dialogue: 1,2:01:54.57,2:01:56.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You see, in America,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:56.06,2:02:00.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们总是被教育要防患于未然
Dialogue: 1,2:01:56.06,2:02:00.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,we are taught to check a fact before it becomes a fact.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:01.03,2:02:02.75,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们被训练去四处探听
Dialogue: 1,2:02:01.03,2:02:02.75,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We're taught to nose around.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:02.79,2:02:05.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,如果一个女孩溺水死了
Dialogue: 1,2:02:02.79,2:02:05.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,When a girl drowns herself,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:05.75,2:02:08.13,Default,22,0,0,0,,查查看她是否怀孕了
Dialogue: 1,2:02:05.75,2:02:08.13,Eng,22,0,0,0,,find out if that girl is pregnant.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:08.21,2:02:11.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,查查看迪克是不是有什么不可告人的秘密
Dialogue: 1,2:02:08.21,2:02:11.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Find out if Dickie had an embarrassment there.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:12.55,2:02:15.93,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生非常欣赏你的忠诚 他真的很欣赏
Dialogue: 1,2:02:12.55,2:02:15.93,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf appreciates your loyalty. He really does.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:15.97,2:02:19.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉․․․她能有上百种推论
Dialogue: 1,2:02:15.97,2:02:19.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge...She has a hundred theories.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:19.14,2:02:22.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,有些事情是她不知道的
Dialogue: 1,2:02:19.14,2:02:22.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,There are a few things that she doesn't know.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:22.14,2:02:24.10,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们希望她永远也不要知道
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.14,2:02:24.10,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We hope she never knows.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:24.19,2:02:27.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们希望她永远也不要知道
Dialogue: 1,2:02:24.19,2:02:27.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I hope she never knows.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:27.28,2:02:28.98,Default,22,0,0,0,,三个不同的人․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:02:27.28,2:02:28.98,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Three different people...
Dialogue: 2,2:02:29.07,2:02:32.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,看见迪克进了弗雷迪的车
Dialogue: 1,2:02:29.07,2:02:32.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,saw Dickie get into Freddie's car.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:32.69,2:02:35.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,其中一个, 并不会指认․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:02:32.69,2:02:35.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,One man, who will not testify...
Dialogue: 2,2:02:36.07,2:02:39.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,因为他当时是在和别人的妻子通奸
Dialogue: 1,2:02:36.07,2:02:39.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,because he was jumping somebody else's wife at the time,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:39.38,2:02:43.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,他看到迪克从一辆红色跑车上取下牌照
Dialogue: 1,2:02:39.38,2:02:43.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,saw Dickie removing license plates from a red sports car.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:43.40,2:02:48.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,警方之所以知道是因为这人本身就是个警察
Dialogue: 1,2:02:43.40,2:02:48.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The police know about this man because he happens to be a policeman.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:49.97,2:02:52.63,Default,22,0,0,0,,我在迪克的地下室里发现了这些
Dialogue: 1,2:02:49.97,2:02:52.63,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I found these in the basement of Dickie's apartment.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:52.71,2:02:54.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,它们是弗雷迪的车上的
Dialogue: 1,2:02:52.71,2:02:54.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,They belong to Freddie's car.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:54.88,2:02:59.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生叫我․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:02:54.88,2:02:59.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf has asked me...
Dialogue: 2,2:02:59.26,2:03:03.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,把这些扔到运河里去
Dialogue: 1,2:02:59.26,2:03:03.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to lose these in the canal this evening.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:08.15,2:03:10.29,Default,22,0,0,0,,格林立夫先生说他从迪克给你的信中․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:03:08.15,2:03:10.29,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Mr. Greenleaf feels that there was a silent promise...
Dialogue: 2,2:03:10.37,2:03:13.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,觉察到了迪克对你的一些秘密承诺
Dialogue: 1,2:03:10.37,2:03:13.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,in Dickie's letter to you which he intends to honor.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:13.53,2:03:16.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,他已经打算将迪克收入的一大部分․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:03:13.53,2:03:16.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He also intends to transfer a good portion...
Dialogue: 2,2:03:16.15,2:03:20.87,Default,22,0,0,0,,转入你的账户
Dialogue: 1,2:03:16.15,2:03:20.87,Eng,22,0,0,0,,of Dickie's income from his trust into your name.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:20.95,2:03:23.04,Default,22,0,0,0,,他不想让․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:03:20.95,2:03:23.04,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He does not intend...
Dialogue: 2,2:03:23.12,2:03:27.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,意大利人知道任何关于迪克的过去
Dialogue: 1,2:03:23.12,2:03:27.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to give the Italians any information about Dickie's past.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:28.54,2:03:33.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,他宁可希望․․․你也是这样想的
Dialogue: 1,2:03:28.54,2:03:33.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He's rather hoping that...you will feel the same.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:51.10,2:03:53.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢, 汤姆  - 先生
Dialogue: 1,2:03:51.10,2:03:53.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Thank you so much, Tom. - Sir.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:53.40,2:03:54.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 1,2:03:53.40,2:03:54.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Good-bye.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:58.55,2:04:03.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉, 我希望我那天晚上从未对你说过那些话
Dialogue: 1,2:03:58.55,2:04:03.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge, I feel I never should have said those things to you the other evening.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:03.45,2:04:08.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,我太慌乱了, 还有戒指․․․你看起来又那么․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:04:03.45,2:04:08.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was pretty flustered, and the rings...And you looked so...
Dialogue: 2,2:04:08.41,2:04:09.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 1,2:04:08.41,2:04:09.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:09.75,2:04:14.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,但我希望你钱包里那张纸条能和你一回纽约․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:04:09.75,2:04:14.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But I hope that note goes in your purse to New York...
Dialogue: 2,2:04:14.32,2:04:16.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,总有一天会用上的
Dialogue: 1,2:04:14.32,2:04:16.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,for a rainy day.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:17.62,2:04:22.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你现在打算干吗, 汤姆?  - 我不知道
Dialogue: 1,2:04:17.62,2:04:22.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What are you gonna do now, Tom? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:22.32,2:04:24.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得下个月在雅典有场音乐会
Dialogue: 1,2:04:22.32,2:04:24.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Peter has a concert in Athens next month,
Dialogue: 2,2:04:24.93,2:04:27.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,所以他问我是否愿意一起去帮帮他的忙
Dialogue: 1,2:04:24.93,2:04:27.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,so he asked me to come along and help out.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:29.10,2:04:31.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,他向你告别
Dialogue: 1,2:04:29.10,2:04:31.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,He says good-bye.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:31.10,2:04:34.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,对了, 他正在预演所以不能来․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:04:31.10,2:04:34.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,By the way, he was in rehearsal so he couldn't...
Dialogue: 2,2:04:34.37,2:04:37.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,为什么我觉得瑞普雷永远都不会陷入困境?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:34.37,2:04:37.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why do I think there's never been a Ripley rainy day?
Dialogue: 2,2:04:37.40,2:04:39.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 1,2:04:37.40,2:04:39.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,2:04:40.07,2:04:44.28,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道是你干的 我知道是你干的
Dialogue: 1,2:04:40.07,2:04:44.28,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know it was you. I know it was you.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:44.37,2:04:46.70,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道是你干的! 我知道是你干的!
Dialogue: 1,2:04:44.37,2:04:46.70,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know it was you!I know it was you!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 玛吉, 玛吉 别这样!  - 我知道是你杀了迪克!
Dialogue: 1,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Marge, Marge. Please! - I know you killed Dickie!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:50.50,2:04:53.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 玛吉!  - 我知道! 不!
Dialogue: 1,2:04:50.50,2:04:53.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Marge! - I know! No!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:53.20,2:04:56.30,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道是你干的!
Dialogue: 1,2:04:53.20,2:04:56.30,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know it was you!
Dialogue: 2,2:04:56.39,2:04:58.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,玛吉 玛吉, 别这样
Dialogue: 1,2:04:56.39,2:04:58.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Marge. Marge, please.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:58.50,2:05:01.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,不是汤姆 真的
Dialogue: 1,2:04:58.50,2:05:01.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,It's not Tom. Really.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:10.23,2:05:13.69,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们是凤尾船船夫
Dialogue: 1,2:05:10.23,2:05:13.69,Eng,22,0,0,0,,We are called gondoleri
Dialogue: 2,2:05:13.70,2:05:17.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过那只是幻想, 那是无上的光荣
Dialogue: 1,2:05:13.70,2:05:17.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But that's a vagary It's quite honorary
Dialogue: 2,2:05:17.54,2:05:22.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我们的往返旅途
Dialogue: 1,2:05:17.54,2:05:22.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,The trade that we ply
Dialogue: 2,2:05:22.62,2:05:26.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,问我这一刻我想改变什么
Dialogue: 1,2:05:22.62,2:05:26.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Ask me what I want to change about this moment.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:26.16,2:05:28.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,我不知道 你想改变这一刻?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:26.16,2:05:28.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I don't know. What do you want to change about this moment?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:28.53,2:05:29.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,什么也不变
Dialogue: 1,2:05:28.53,2:05:29.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:34.54,2:05:36.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,我冷死了 一起下去?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:34.54,2:05:36.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm freezing. Coming down?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:36.55,2:05:39.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,过一会 我想看看日落
Dialogue: 1,2:05:36.55,2:05:39.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Later. I want to catch the sunset.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:39.34,2:05:44.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你疯了  - 我是疯了
Dialogue: 1,2:05:39.34,2:05:44.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You're mad. - I am.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:53.02,2:05:54.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:53.02,2:05:54.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:58.15,2:06:00.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克?
Dialogue: 1,2:05:58.15,2:06:00.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie?
Dialogue: 2,2:06:03.49,2:06:05.41,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克!
Dialogue: 1,2:06:03.49,2:06:05.41,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie!
Dialogue: 2,2:06:17.50,2:06:19.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 我的天
Dialogue: 1,2:06:17.50,2:06:19.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:21.38,2:06:23.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,你好, 梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,2:06:21.38,2:06:23.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hello, Meredith.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:26.37,2:06:28.20,Default,22,0,0,0,,我刚一直在看你
Dialogue: 1,2:06:26.37,2:06:28.20,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I was looking at you.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:28.29,2:06:32.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,你的衣服 我差点就认不出来了
Dialogue: 1,2:06:28.29,2:06:32.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Your clothes. I wouldn't have known you.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:32.39,2:06:35.14,Default,22,0,0,0,,呃, 你发现了我, 所以你拿到了你的奖励
Dialogue: 1,2:06:32.39,2:06:35.14,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Well, you spotted me, so you get the reward.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:36.41,2:06:38.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,2:06:36.41,2:06:38.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- What? - Just kidding.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:38.57,2:06:42.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你一个人?  - 噢
Dialogue: 1,2:06:38.57,2:06:42.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Are you alone? - Oh.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:42.57,2:06:46.21,Default,22,0,0,0,,难说 孤单的不能再孤单了
Dialogue: 1,2:06:42.57,2:06:46.21,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hardly. Couldn't be less alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:46.40,2:06:49.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 琼阿姨  - 还有叔叔
Dialogue: 1,2:06:46.40,2:06:49.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Aunt Joan. - And "co."
Dialogue: 2,2:06:52.49,2:06:54.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,太多叔叔了
Dialogue: 1,2:06:52.49,2:06:54.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,A lot of "co."
Dialogue: 2,2:06:55.18,2:06:57.71,Default,22,0,0,0,,噢, 天
Dialogue: 1,2:06:55.18,2:06:57.71,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:57.79,2:07:01.88,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 再次看到你, 我․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:06:57.79,2:07:01.88,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, seeing you again, I...
Dialogue: 2,2:07:02.56,2:07:06.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,在想你․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:07:02.56,2:07:06.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've thought about you...
Dialogue: 2,2:07:06.29,2:07:08.46,Default,22,0,0,0,,一直
Dialogue: 1,2:07:06.29,2:07:08.46,Eng,22,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:08.50,2:07:10.86,Default,22,0,0,0,,我也在想你
Dialogue: 1,2:07:08.50,2:07:10.86,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I've thought about you.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:12.81,2:07:16.77,Default,22,0,0,0,,是呀, 不过, 当我想到你的时候, 我可是很恨你的
Dialogue: 1,2:07:12.81,2:07:16.77,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, when I've thought about you, I was mostly hating you.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:23.06,2:07:25.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,你躲哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:23.06,2:07:25.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Where have you been hiding?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:25.40,2:07:27.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,我没躲
Dialogue: 1,2:07:25.40,2:07:27.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I haven't been hiding.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:27.99,2:07:31.23,Default,22,0,0,0,,我被警察看守
Dialogue: 1,2:07:27.99,2:07:31.23,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I've been in police custody.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:32.16,2:07:34.62,Default,22,0,0,0,,他们试图找出杀死弗雷迪的凶手
Dialogue: 1,2:07:32.16,2:07:34.62,Eng,22,0,0,0,,They've been trying to flush out Freddie's killer.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:34.66,2:07:38.97,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑  - 他们给了我这个假期
Dialogue: 1,2:07:34.66,2:07:38.97,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- You're kidding. - They're giving me this vacation,
Dialogue: 2,2:07:38.98,2:07:40.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么打扮成这样的缘故
Dialogue: 1,2:07:38.98,2:07:40.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,which is why the getup.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:40.29,2:07:43.16,Default,22,0,0,0,,这也是你为什么没听到我的消息
Dialogue: 1,2:07:40.29,2:07:43.16,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Which is why you haven't heard from me.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:43.25,2:07:45.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道, 整个世界都认为是你杀了弗雷迪
Dialogue: 1,2:07:43.25,2:07:45.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know, the whole world thinks you killed Freddie.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:45.32,2:07:48.01,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 哦! 太可怕了  - 我知道
Dialogue: 1,2:07:45.32,2:07:48.01,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Oh! It's terrible. - I know.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:48.09,2:07:51.80,Default,22,0,0,0,,你看, 我现在不能长谈 嗯, 呆会见?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:48.09,2:07:51.80,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Listen, I can't talk now. Um, later?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:55.77,2:07:58.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,呆会见? 呆会见?
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.77,2:07:58.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Later? Later?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:08.86,2:08:11.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,那么․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:08:08.86,2:08:11.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:15.58,2:08:18.85,Default,22,0,0,0,,你还是以"R"为姓名首字母旅行的吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:08:15.58,2:08:18.85,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Are you traveling under "R"?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:19.33,2:08:22.38,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 正是这样
Dialogue: 1,2:08:19.33,2:08:22.38,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know what? I am.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:25.06,2:08:29.24,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克, 你是和彼得·史密斯·金斯利在一起吗? 我赌你是的
Dialogue: 1,2:08:25.06,2:08:29.24,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie, are you with Peter Smith- Kingsley? I bet you are.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:29.28,2:08:31.51,Default,22,0,0,0,,我的姑姑说她看见他了
Dialogue: 1,2:08:29.28,2:08:31.51,Eng,22,0,0,0,,My aunt thought she saw him.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:31.59,2:08:33.72,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得·史密斯·金斯利? 不, 我․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:08:31.59,2:08:33.72,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Peter Smith- Kingsley?No, I...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:33.81,2:08:37.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,我已经好几个月没见过他了
Dialogue: 1,2:08:33.81,2:08:37.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in months.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:37.52,2:08:39.44,Default,22,0,0,0,,不, 我一个人
Dialogue: 1,2:08:37.52,2:08:39.44,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, I'm alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:59.21,2:09:01.17,Default,22,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 1,2:08:59.21,2:09:01.17,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:03.58,2:09:07.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 美吗?  - 不错
Dialogue: 1,2:09:03.58,2:09:07.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- How was it? - It was good.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:07.36,2:09:09.18,Default,22,0,0,0,,不过我要告诉你一些事
Dialogue: 1,2:09:07.36,2:09:09.18,Eng,22,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you something.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:09.37,2:09:13.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望我们接下来的旅程都在这里度过
Dialogue: 1,2:09:09.37,2:09:13.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I want us to stay in here for the rest of the trip.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:16.77,2:09:19.52,Default,22,0,0,0,,那是梅瑞迪斯吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:16.77,2:09:19.52,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Was that Meredith?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:21.32,2:09:23.94,Default,22,0,0,0,,谁是梅瑞迪斯吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:21.32,2:09:23.94,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Was who Meredith?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:24.02,2:09:27.53,Default,22,0,0,0,,梅瑞迪斯·罗吉 你刚刚在吻什么人, 看起来像是梅瑞迪斯
Dialogue: 1,2:09:24.02,2:09:27.53,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Meredith Logue. You were kissing someone. It looked like Meredith.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:34.15,2:09:36.95,Default,22,0,0,0,,我出去找你了
Dialogue: 1,2:09:34.15,2:09:36.95,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I came out to find you.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:37.04,2:09:39.45,Default,22,0,0,0,,哦, 也不算是吻
Dialogue: 1,2:09:37.04,2:09:39.45,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Oh, hardly kissing.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:40.87,2:09:45.00,Default,22,0,0,0,,- 吻个别而已  - 看起来不像是那样
Dialogue: 1,2:09:40.87,2:09:45.00,Eng,22,0,0,0,,- Kissing off. - It didn't look that way.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:45.80,2:09:48.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 远远望过去?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:45.80,2:09:48.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You know?From a distance?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:52.51,2:09:55.58,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․骗了她
Dialogue: 1,2:09:52.51,2:09:55.58,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I lied... to her.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:56.43,2:09:59.06,Default,22,0,0,0,,她以为她看到你了
Dialogue: 1,2:09:56.43,2:09:59.06,Eng,22,0,0,0,,She thought she'd seen you.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:59.60,2:10:00.66,Default,22,0,0,0,,为什么要骗她?
Dialogue: 1,2:09:59.60,2:10:00.66,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Why lie?
Dialogue: 2,2:10:01.70,2:10:06.26,Default,22,0,0,0,,迪克和彼得在一起 会招来太多闲言闲语
Dialogue: 1,2:10:01.70,2:10:06.26,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Dickie and Peter together. That's just too good gossip.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:06.51,2:10:09.07,Default,22,0,0,0,,或是汤姆和彼得在一起
Dialogue: 1,2:10:06.51,2:10:09.07,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Or Tom and Peter, even.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:09.11,2:10:11.65,Default,22,0,0,0,,那甚至会招来更多闲言闲语
Dialogue: 1,2:10:09.11,2:10:11.65,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That would be even better gossip.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:11.74,2:10:13.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,真的吗? 为什么?
Dialogue: 1,2:10:11.74,2:10:13.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Really? Why?
Dialogue: 2,2:10:18.43,2:10:23.49,Default,22,0,0,0,,我․․․我, 嗯․․․我完全迷惑了
Dialogue: 1,2:10:18.43,2:10:23.49,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I...I, um...I'm completely lost.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:26.16,2:10:27.48,Default,22,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 1,2:10:26.16,2:10:27.48,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:28.37,2:10:31.50,Default,22,0,0,0,,对不起, 彼得
Dialogue: 1,2:10:28.37,2:10:31.50,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:31.58,2:10:33.54,Default,22,0,0,0,,是我迷失了自己
Dialogue: 1,2:10:31.58,2:10:33.54,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm lost.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:37.37,2:10:40.35,Default,22,0,0,0,,我会永远被困死在地下室里了, 是吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:10:37.37,2:10:40.35,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be stuck in the basement, aren't I?
Dialogue: 2,2:10:40.53,2:10:43.43,Default,22,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 1,2:10:40.53,2:10:43.43,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Aren't I?
Dialogue: 2,2:10:43.51,2:10:45.73,Default,22,0,0,0,,那是我․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:10:43.51,2:10:45.73,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's my...
Dialogue: 2,2:10:49.41,2:10:50.68,Default,22,0,0,0,,可怕․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:10:49.41,2:10:50.68,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Terrible...
Dialogue: 2,2:10:51.81,2:10:53.90,Default,22,0,0,0,,寂寞․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:10:51.81,2:10:53.90,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and alone...
Dialogue: 2,2:10:54.48,2:10:57.60,Default,22,0,0,0,,并且黑暗的地下室
Dialogue: 1,2:10:54.48,2:10:57.60,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and dark.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:57.68,2:11:00.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,我还撒了谎․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:10:57.68,2:11:00.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,And I've lied...
Dialogue: 2,2:11:00.23,2:11:03.32,Default,22,0,0,0,,关于我是谁․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:11:00.23,2:11:03.32,Eng,22,0,0,0,,about who I am...
Dialogue: 2,2:11:03.60,2:11:05.61,Default,22,0,0,0,,我在哪儿
Dialogue: 1,2:11:03.60,2:11:05.61,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and where I am.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:06.09,2:11:08.99,Default,22,0,0,0,,现在再也没人能找到我了
Dialogue: 1,2:11:06.09,2:11:08.99,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Now no one'll ever find me.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:09.58,2:11:12.91,Default,22,0,0,0,,你在说什么, 撒谎说你是谁?
Dialogue: 1,2:11:09.58,2:11:12.91,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What do you mean, lied about who you are?
Dialogue: 2,2:11:13.00,2:11:14.67,Default,22,0,0,0,,我总是想․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:11:13.00,2:11:14.67,Eng,22,0,0,0,,I always thought it'd be better...
Dialogue: 2,2:11:14.71,2:11:17.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,做一个虚假的大人物․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:11:14.71,2:11:17.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,to be a fake somebody...
Dialogue: 2,2:11:17.88,2:11:20.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,总比做个无足轻重的人好
Dialogue: 1,2:11:17.88,2:11:20.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,than a real nobody.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:20.88,2:11:24.76,Default,22,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么? 你怎么会是个无足轻重的人
Dialogue: 1,2:11:20.88,2:11:24.76,Eng,22,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?You're not a nobody.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:24.77,2:11:26.34,Default,22,0,0,0,,你最不可能会是这种人
Dialogue: 1,2:11:24.77,2:11:26.34,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That's the last thing you are.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:33.77,2:11:37.36,Default,22,0,0,0,,彼得
Dialogue: 1,2:11:33.77,2:11:37.36,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:37.40,2:11:40.78,Default,22,0,0,0,,告诉我一些关于汤姆的优点
Dialogue: 1,2:11:37.40,2:11:40.78,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tell me some good things about Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:41.86,2:11:45.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,别, 别起来 别起来 别起来
Dialogue: 1,2:11:41.86,2:11:45.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,No, don't get up. Don't get up. Don't get up.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:47.45,2:11:49.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,就․․․
Dialogue: 1,2:11:47.45,2:11:49.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just...
