Dialogue: 1,2:11:52.16,2:11:56.92,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Just tell me some nice things...about Tom Ripley.
Dialogue: 2,2:11:59.00,2:12:02.09,Default,22,0,0,0,,"关于汤姆·瑞普雷的优点"
Dialogue: 1,2:11:59.00,2:12:02.09,Eng,22,0,0,0,,"Good things about Tom Ripley."
Dialogue: 2,2:12:04.31,2:12:07.22,Default,22,0,0,0,,这可得花些时间了
Dialogue: 1,2:12:04.31,2:12:07.22,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That could take me some time.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:08.76,2:12:13.64,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆很有天赋 汤姆很温柔
Dialogue: 1,2:12:08.76,2:12:13.64,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom is talented. Tom is tender.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:14.02,2:12:16.02,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆很美丽
Dialogue: 1,2:12:14.02,2:12:16.02,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom is beautiful.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:16.06,2:12:19.42,Default,22,0,0,0,,你是个大骗子
Dialogue: 1,2:12:16.06,2:12:19.42,Eng,22,0,0,0,,You're such a liar.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:22.42,2:12:25.19,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆...汤姆是个谜
Dialogue: 1,2:12:22.42,2:12:25.19,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom is...Tom is a mystery.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:30.78,2:12:34.03,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆不是无足轻重
Dialogue: 1,2:12:30.78,2:12:34.03,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom is not a nobody.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:36.96,2:12:40.84,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆有秘密不想告诉我
Dialogue: 1,2:12:36.96,2:12:40.84,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom has secrets he doesn't want to tell me,
Dialogue: 2,2:12:40.88,2:12:43.25,Default,22,0,0,0,,我希望他能告诉我
Dialogue: 1,2:12:40.88,2:12:43.25,Eng,22,0,0,0,,and I wish he would.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:47.43,2:12:49.89,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆会做恶梦
Dialogue: 1,2:12:47.43,2:12:49.89,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom has nightmares.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:53.93,2:12:56.39,Default,22,0,0,0,,这不是一件好事
Dialogue: 1,2:12:53.93,2:12:56.39,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That' s not a good thing.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:00.98,2:13:04.37,Default,22,0,0,0,,汤姆有个深爱他的人
Dialogue: 1,2:13:00.98,2:13:04.37,Eng,22,0,0,0,,Tom has someone to love him.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:05.45,2:13:08.27,Default,22,0,0,0,,这是件好事
Dialogue: 1,2:13:05.45,2:13:08.27,Eng,22,0,0,0,,That is a good thing.
